1
00:00:00,933 --> 00:00:03,933
♪ IN THE NOT-TOO-DISTANT
FUTURE ♪

2
00:00:03,933 --> 00:00:06,800
♪ SOMEWHERE IN TIME AND SPACE ♪

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:10,500
♪ MIKE NELSON
AND HIS ROBOT PALS ♪

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,433
♪ ARE CAUGHT
IN A NASTY PLACE ♪

5
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:16,533
♪ THEY TRY TO SURVIVE
THE WRATH OF PEARL ♪

6
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:19,567
♪ JUST AN EVIL GAL
WHO WANTS TO RULE THE WORLD ♪

7
00:00:19,567 --> 00:00:22,733
♪ FROM HER CASTLE BELOW
SHE SETS HER SIGHTS ABOVE ♪

8
00:00:22,733 --> 00:00:25,867
♪ JUST TO TORTURE
ALL THE CAPTIVES
ON THE SATELLITE OF LOVE ♪

9
00:00:25,867 --> 00:00:28,867
GET ME DOWN!

10
00:00:28,867 --> 00:00:32,033
♪ I’LL SEND HIM
CHEESY MOVIES ♪

11
00:00:32,033 --> 00:00:35,233
- ♪ THE WORST I CAN FIND ♪
- ♪ LA-LA-LA ♪

12
00:00:35,233 --> 00:00:38,233
♪ HE’LL HAVE TO SIT
AND WATCH THEM ALL ♪

13
00:00:38,233 --> 00:00:41,233
- ♪ AND I’LL MONITOR HIS MIND ♪
- ♪ LA-LA-LA ♪

14
00:00:41,233 --> 00:00:44,067
♪ NOW, KEEP IN MIND
MIKE CAN’T CONTROL ♪

15
00:00:44,067 --> 00:00:47,133
- ♪ WHERE THE MOVIES
BEGIN OR END ♪
- ♪ LA-LA-LA ♪

16
00:00:47,133 --> 00:00:50,233
♪ HE’LL TRY
TO KEEP HIS SANITY ♪

17
00:00:50,233 --> 00:00:53,567
♪ WITH THE HELP
OF HIS ROBOT FRIENDS ♪

18
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:57,067
♪ ROBOT ROLL CALL ♪

19
00:00:57,067 --> 00:00:58,700
- OH, CAMBOT!
- YOU’RE ON!

20
00:00:58,700 --> 00:00:59,900
- GYPSY!
- OH, MY STARS!

21
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,567
- TOM SERVO!
- CHECK ME OUT!

22
00:01:01,567 --> 00:01:03,367
- CROOOOW!
- I’M DIFFERENT.

23
00:01:03,367 --> 00:01:06,567
♪ IF YOU’RE WONDERING HOW
HE EATS AND BREATHES ♪

24
00:01:06,567 --> 00:01:09,333
- ♪ AND OTHER SCIENCE FACTS ♪
- ♪ LA, LA, LA ♪

25
00:01:09,333 --> 00:01:12,533
♪ JUST TO PROVE TO YOURSELF
IT’S JUST A SHOW ♪

26
00:01:12,533 --> 00:01:15,633
♪ I SHOULD REALLY JUST RELAX ♪

27
00:01:15,633 --> 00:01:18,733
♪ FOR... ♪

28
00:01:35,267 --> 00:01:38,300
HI, EVERYONE. MIKE NELSON
HERE, ON THE SATELLITE OF LOVE.

29
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:40,967
THIS IS TOM SERVO, AND
TOM’S GOT SOMETHING TO SAY.

30
00:01:40,967 --> 00:01:42,467
THANK YOU, MIKE.
[CLEARS THROAT]

31
00:01:42,467 --> 00:01:47,333
MIKE? FOLKS? IN 1984, THE TECHNO
MEGA-GIANT BAND NAMED "YES"

32
00:01:47,333 --> 00:01:49,233
RELEASED A SONG
IN WHICH THEY ASSURED US

33
00:01:49,233 --> 00:01:51,733
THAT ♪ THE OWNER
OF A LONELY HEART ♪

34
00:01:51,733 --> 00:01:56,400
♪ IS MUCH BETTER THAN
THE OWNER OF A BROKEN HEART ♪

35
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,767
YEAH. GREAT SONG.
I REMEMBER THAT.

36
00:01:57,767 --> 00:01:59,733
AS DO WE ALL, MIKE.
AS DO WE ALL.

37
00:01:59,733 --> 00:02:02,633
BUT MY POINT IS SIMPLY
THIS: THEY INTRODUCED
A PROFOUND TOPIC,

38
00:02:02,633 --> 00:02:05,700
AND THEN BARELY SCRATCHED THE
SURFACE: THEY TOLD ME NOTHING!

39
00:02:05,700 --> 00:02:08,167
HOW DOES THE
♪ OWNER OF A LONELY HEART ♪

40
00:02:08,167 --> 00:02:11,467
COMPARE TO, SAY, THE
♪ OWNER OF A BROKEN
GAS FIREPLACE ♪

41
00:02:11,467 --> 00:02:12,967
OR FOR THAT MATTER, TO THE

42
00:02:12,967 --> 00:02:15,600
♪ OWNER OF
A PERFECTLY-FUNCTIONAL
CHEESE SLICER ♪

43
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:18,033
AS THE
♪ OWNER OF A LONELY HEART ♪

44
00:02:18,033 --> 00:02:21,033
HOW DO I STACK UP AGAINST THE
♪ OWNER OF A P-EN-CIL ♪

45
00:02:21,033 --> 00:02:23,767
- I MEAN, COME ON, "YES!"
- I DON’T THINK IT’S UP TO "YES"

46
00:02:23,767 --> 00:02:26,100
TO COME UP WITH
EVERY POSSIBLE PERMUTATION.

47
00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:28,633
WELL, THEY BROUGHT IT UP, MIKE,
AND THERE’S SO MUCH MORE
TO CONSIDER!

48
00:02:28,633 --> 00:02:31,767
WHAT ABOUT THE
♪ OWNER OF A PARCEL OF LAND
IN MONTANA? ♪

49
00:02:31,767 --> 00:02:34,433
VERSUS THE
♪ OWNER OF A PI-IE! ♪

50
00:02:34,433 --> 00:02:37,100
- WE’LL BE RIGHT BACK.
- HOW DOES THE
♪ OWNER OF A JAR ♪

51
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:39,800
STACK UP AGAINST
♪ THE OWNER OF A SPLIT LEVEL? ♪

52
00:02:46,633 --> 00:02:48,500
OKAY, NOW WE’VE DONE IT.
EVERY TIME WE SAY,

53
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:50,633
- "OWNER OF A LONELY HEART--"
- ♪♪ [BRASS CHORD]

54
00:02:50,633 --> 00:02:53,000
- AAH!
- WE GET A "YES" ORCHESTRA HIT.

55
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:56,133
HI. HEY, HANG ON.
TESS? TESS?

56
00:02:56,133 --> 00:02:58,300
- OWNER OF THE LONELY HEART?
- ♪♪ [BRASS]

57
00:02:58,300 --> 00:03:01,000
FOR NOW, LET’S JUST AVOID
"OWNER OF A..." YOU KNOW.

58
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,767
- YEAH. "LONELY HEART."
- ♪♪ [BRASS]

59
00:03:02,767 --> 00:03:05,000
- GAAH!
- OW!

60
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,467
UH, YES, PEARL?

61
00:03:06,467 --> 00:03:08,533
NELSON! THANK GOODNESS
IT’S YOU!

62
00:03:08,533 --> 00:03:10,800
I NEEDED TO TALK TO A LOSER!

63
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:13,667
[PEARL LAUGHS]

64
00:03:13,667 --> 00:03:17,167
OH, WE HAVE FUN,
DON’T WE, BRAIN GUY?

65
00:03:17,167 --> 00:03:19,167
WE DO. WE REALLY DO!

66
00:03:19,167 --> 00:03:20,767
BUT YOU KNOW, ANYONE CAN.

67
00:03:20,767 --> 00:03:24,100
THAT’S RIGHT.
YOU SEE, I REALIZED
THAT WITH A LARGE STAFF

68
00:03:24,100 --> 00:03:26,300
NECESSARY FOR TAKING OVER
THE WORLD, I NEED TO KEEP

69
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:28,800
THE WORKPLACE LOOSE AND FUN,

70
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:31,933
AND STUDIES SHOW THAT
IF I DO, YOU MORONS WILL
BE MORE PRODUCTIVE!

71
00:03:31,933 --> 00:03:33,233
[ALL LAUGHING]

72
00:03:33,233 --> 00:03:36,233
HEY, YOU WANT SOME TIPS
ON HOW TO HAVE FUN?

73
00:03:36,233 --> 00:03:38,667
YOU SHOULD SEE THIS PLACE
ON A FRIDAY!

74
00:03:38,667 --> 00:03:40,767
YEAH, IT IS NUTS!

75
00:03:40,767 --> 00:03:44,233
I’M SURE. WELL,
LET’S GET STARTED.

76
00:03:44,233 --> 00:03:47,633
I MEAN, SOMETIMES I THINK
EVERYONE UP HERE IS CRAZY!

77
00:03:47,633 --> 00:03:50,767
I TELL MY FRIENDS, "I’M NOT SURE
WHETHER I WORK ON A SATELLITE

78
00:03:50,767 --> 00:03:53,633
- OR AT THE NUTHOUSE!"
- WHOO-HOO!

79
00:03:53,633 --> 00:03:56,767
OKAY. LET’S TRY AND KEEP
TO OUR SCHEDULE.

80
00:03:56,767 --> 00:03:59,300
I’LL TELL YOU
WHO’S FUNNY-- CROW!

81
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:01,933
- CROW IS THE CUTUP AROUND HERE!
- I’M THE MAN!

82
00:04:01,933 --> 00:04:03,800
DON’T DRINK MILK AND TALK
TO THIS FELLOW,

83
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:06,267
- OR IT WILL COME OUT YOUR NOSE!
- NO! COME ON...

84
00:04:06,267 --> 00:04:08,300
LOOK, SHUT UP!

85
00:04:08,300 --> 00:04:10,400
OKAY, WHY DON’T WE START
WITH AN ILLUSTRATION

86
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:13,733
OF HOW HUMOR CAN LIGHTEN UP
A STRESSFUL SITUATION.

87
00:04:13,733 --> 00:04:16,367
- BRAIN GUY?
- OH, SURE.

88
00:04:16,367 --> 00:04:19,867
[COUGHS]
EXCUSE ME PEARL. BUSINESS,
BUSINESS DEADLINE MERGER,

89
00:04:19,867 --> 00:04:22,500
- MERGER,
STOCK OPTION, ACQUISITION--
- I’M SORRY, WHAT WAS THAT?

90
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:25,300
I WAS BUSY HAVING EYEBALLS THAT
WON’T STAY IN THEIR SOCKETS!

91
00:04:25,300 --> 00:04:27,333
[ALL LAUGHING]

92
00:04:27,333 --> 00:04:29,333
DO YOU BEGIN TO SEE
HOW CREATIVITY

93
00:04:29,333 --> 00:04:31,367
CAN LEAD TO PRODUCTIVITY?

94
00:04:31,367 --> 00:04:35,200
UM, NO. I’M JUST
KIND OF DEPRESSED.

95
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:39,733
YEAH, MOSTLY I FEEL
SAD AND... ACHY.

96
00:04:39,733 --> 00:04:42,700
WELL, I’M GLAD YOU HAD FUN.

97
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:44,567
BOBO, LET’S SEND THEM
THEIR MOVIE.

98
00:04:44,567 --> 00:04:48,267
FINAL JUSTICE, STARRING
THE DYSPEPTIC JOE DON BAKER.

99
00:04:48,267 --> 00:04:51,233
AS SOON AS I’M DONE WEARING
BIG, FUNNY-GOOFY TEETH!

100
00:04:51,233 --> 00:04:54,367
HEY! GET TO WORK! WHAT THE HELL
DO YOU THINK THIS IS?

101
00:04:54,367 --> 00:04:57,500
TOM GARLICS?
DON’T MAKE ME PAY YOU!

102
00:05:00,467 --> 00:05:03,633
WOW! I’M TERRIFIED.
AND DELIGHTED.

103
00:05:03,633 --> 00:05:04,967
- HOO-HOO!
- [LAUGHING]

104
00:05:04,967 --> 00:05:06,933
- [BUZZING]
- HELLO?

105
00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:23,367
- WEIRD.
- ♪♪ ["YELLOW ROSE OF TEXAS",
FAINT.]

106
00:05:23,367 --> 00:05:25,733
OH, BOY. COWBOY MUSIC.
LET’S JUST TURN BACK, SHALL WE?

107
00:05:25,733 --> 00:05:27,633
NO, NO, WE CAN’T.
SIT RIGHT THERE.

108
00:05:27,633 --> 00:05:29,367
[MAN] HEAVY RAIN
CONTINUING THROUGH THE NIGHT,

109
00:05:29,367 --> 00:05:30,967
CLEARING TOMORROW.

110
00:05:30,967 --> 00:05:33,500
AND NOW, HERE’S AN UPDATE
ON THE CAR-BOMBING IN DALLAS.

111
00:05:33,500 --> 00:05:35,433
- OH, YEAH.
- BUILDING CONTRACTOR
LARRY WAYNE

112
00:05:35,433 --> 00:05:38,233
IS IN CRITICAL CONDITION
AT PARKLAND HOSPITAL.

113
00:05:38,233 --> 00:05:41,767
THE TEXAS RANGER ORGANIZED
CRIME UNIT IS INVESTIGATING.

114
00:05:41,767 --> 00:05:44,900
GOOD LUCK, BOYS!
AND NOW, BACK TO OUR MUSIC.

115
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:49,067
OOH, I WISH I WAS ILLITERATE,
SO I DIDN’T HAVE TO READ THAT.

116
00:05:49,067 --> 00:05:50,867
- ♪ FADING BEFORE ITS TIME ♪

117
00:05:50,867 --> 00:05:52,300
PLEASE, CAN’T I HAVE JUST

118
00:05:52,300 --> 00:05:55,267
ONE MORE JUSTICE?

119
00:05:55,267 --> 00:05:59,000
- ♪ TO ME, IT’S JUST A CRAZE ♪
- HE CAME, HE SAW, HE ACTED
WITH BILL McKINNEY.

120
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,767
♪ CALL ME WHAT YOU WILL-- ♪

121
00:06:01,767 --> 00:06:04,467
SOUNDS LIKE THEY HIRED
LIVINGSTON TAYLOR.

122
00:06:04,467 --> 00:06:07,467
- OHH...
- ♪ THAT DON’T FEEL
THE SAME NO MORE ♪

123
00:06:07,467 --> 00:06:10,933
- IS HE DEAD?
- HEY, ROSANNO BRAZZI!

124
00:06:10,933 --> 00:06:14,900
- ♪ SOME ENCHANTED EVENING! ♪
- DANG, IT IS

125
00:06:14,900 --> 00:06:17,167
- POURIN’ OUT THERE, T.J.
- YUP.

126
00:06:17,167 --> 00:06:19,500
- YEP. [BELCHES]
- HOW ARE WE DOING TONIGHT?
ANYTHING HAPPENING?

127
00:06:19,500 --> 00:06:21,367
- NO, NO CALL.
- NOTHIN’ UP?

128
00:06:21,367 --> 00:06:23,500
- NAH, A BIG FAT NADA.
- THAT’S ME.

129
00:06:23,500 --> 00:06:25,333
LISTEN, T.J. THERE’S SOMETHING
I’VE BEEN MEANING TO...

130
00:06:25,333 --> 00:06:27,567
- TALK TO YOU ABOUT.
- YEAH?

131
00:06:27,567 --> 00:06:29,867
- HOW’S THE DIET COMING?
- WHAT ARE YA, MY MOTHER?

132
00:06:29,867 --> 00:06:31,700
NO, T.J. WHAT I AM
IS YOUR FRIEND.

133
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:34,600
- AND JIMMIE DEAN.
- YOU KNOW YOU’VE GOT LESS
THAN THREE MONTHS

134
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:37,100
- BEFORE YOUR NEXT ANNUAL.
- I’LL MAKE IT.

135
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:40,033
WELL, NOT UNLESS YOU GET OFF
YOUR ___ AND GET EXERCISE!

136
00:06:40,033 --> 00:06:44,033
AND YOU STOP EATIN’
THOSE DAMN... DONUTS!

137
00:06:44,033 --> 00:06:46,300
AND QUIT DRINKIN’ BABY OIL.

138
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:50,833
♪ TO ME IT’S JUST A CRAZE ♪

139
00:06:50,833 --> 00:06:52,800
♪ YOU CAN CALL ME
WHAT YOU WISH ♪

140
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:56,700
FATHER GUIDO SARDUCCI!

141
00:06:56,700 --> 00:06:59,433
AN EDITOR THEY’D SCRAPE
FROM THE BOTTOM OF THE BARREL
EVERY SPRING.

142
00:07:01,033 --> 00:07:02,400
- [GRUNTS]
- [TIRES SQUEAL]

143
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:04,567
ROAD HOG!

144
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,500
THE D.P. IS
AN AUSTRIAN PRINCE!

145
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:11,967
BE COOL.

146
00:07:11,967 --> 00:07:13,800
OH, TOM WOLFE. GREAT.

147
00:07:14,867 --> 00:07:16,567
- HEY, OPIE!
- GOOD TO SEE YOU!

148
00:07:16,567 --> 00:07:18,567
[SPEAKING SPANISH]

149
00:07:18,567 --> 00:07:20,567
EXECUTIVE PRODUCER,
THE SUN KING.

150
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:30,467
I’M REALLY SORRY.
I CAN’T MAKE ANOTHER CLAIM

151
00:07:30,467 --> 00:07:33,133
ON MY INSURANCE.

152
00:07:33,133 --> 00:07:35,933
GREYDON CLARK, THE PRODUCER
OF "HOBGOBLINS!" WE’RE DOOMED!

153
00:07:35,933 --> 00:07:38,600
OH, MAN!

154
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:42,900
- [CAR WON’T START]
- IF YOU’RE GONNA WHACK A GUY,
GET A DECENT BATTERY.

155
00:07:44,367 --> 00:07:46,800
WE JUST LEAVE IT ALONE!
HOLD ON!

156
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:51,133
LET’S GET OUT THE MANUAL.
"IF YOU’VE KILLED SOMEONE,
TURN TO PAGE 37."

157
00:07:51,133 --> 00:07:54,233
- IS THERE ANY OTHER BORDER?
- IF WE GET OUT OF TEXAS,
WE’RE SAFE, RIGHT?

158
00:07:54,233 --> 00:07:57,400
- OH, BOY.
- OUT HERE, BOSS.

159
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:59,833
"IF YOU’VE KILLED SOMEONE AND
YOU HAVE OUR LIMITED EDITION,

160
00:07:59,833 --> 00:08:02,133
TURN TO PAGE 43."

161
00:08:04,967 --> 00:08:06,267
YOU KNOW YOU’RE
THE MOST QUALIFIED

162
00:08:06,267 --> 00:08:08,167
DEPUTY SHERIFF IN
THE WHOLE DAMN STATE?

163
00:08:08,167 --> 00:08:11,000
ALL THEM YEARS UP IN DALLAS,
AND THAT TRAINING MUST BE
WORTH SOMETHING.

164
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,900
BUT DALLAS
WASN’T ALL MY FAULT.

165
00:08:13,900 --> 00:08:15,933
I DIDN’T KILL ALL THOSE PEOPLE
ALL BY MYSELF.

166
00:08:15,933 --> 00:08:20,367
- MOST OF THEM.
- I BAGGED MY LIMIT THAT DAY,
THAT’S FOR SURE.

167
00:08:20,367 --> 00:08:22,667
- KILLIN’ RULES.
- ’COURSE YOU KNOW, T.J.,
I THINK I, UH,

168
00:08:22,667 --> 00:08:24,833
MIGHT HAVE KEPT
THE SENATOR’S BROTHER OUT OF IT.

169
00:08:24,833 --> 00:08:26,900
AH, HE WAS DOIN’ DIRTY.

170
00:08:26,900 --> 00:08:29,267
HE PAYS A PRICE, JUST LIKE
ALL US ORDINARY FOLK.

171
00:08:29,267 --> 00:08:31,967
YEAH. SO, YOU GET BOOTED OUT
OF DALLAS,

172
00:08:31,967 --> 00:08:34,400
I END UP WITH THE BEST
DEPUTY SHERIFF IN TEXAS.

173
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:35,800
THAT’S OUR BACK STORY!

174
00:08:35,800 --> 00:08:37,467
SOMEHOW, IT JUST DON’T
SEEM FAIR.

175
00:08:37,467 --> 00:08:40,567
WELL, MAMA NEVER SAID
LIFE WAS FAIR.

176
00:08:40,567 --> 00:08:42,200
- AH...
- PASS THE SAUSAGE?

177
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:45,533
- I PAID A PRICE.
- LISTEN MAN,

178
00:08:45,533 --> 00:08:48,233
I’M GONNA GO SEE THE OLD LADY.
YOU TAKE CARE.

179
00:08:48,233 --> 00:08:50,100
- IF ANYTHING HAPPENS,
GIVE ME A CALL.
- ALL RIGHT.

180
00:08:50,100 --> 00:08:52,000
GET SOME SLEEP, ALL RIGHT?

181
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:55,300
- YEAH.
- YEAH, AND PUT A GLADE
AIR FRESHENER IN HERE, OKAY?

182
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:57,967
OH, BOB! WAIT A MINUTE.

183
00:08:57,967 --> 00:09:01,067
- YEAH?
- PHOTOS CAME BACK
FROM THE DRUGSTORE.

184
00:09:01,067 --> 00:09:04,200
THEY’RE PICTURES OF
MY LUNCH YESTERDAY.

185
00:09:05,767 --> 00:09:07,567
- LOOK AT THAT.
- LOOK HOW NUDE I AM?

186
00:09:07,567 --> 00:09:09,400
- ISN’T THAT NICE?
- YEAH.

187
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:11,933
TREVOR’S A CUTE KID,
ALL RIGHT.

188
00:09:11,933 --> 00:09:14,100
- YOU’RE A LUCKY MAN, BOB.
- YEAH, HOPE.

189
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:18,367
- WHO’S OUT THERE MESSING WITH
MY CAR ON A NIGHT LIKE THIS?
- [MOTOR NOT STARTING]

190
00:09:18,367 --> 00:09:20,433
HEY, HOLD IT RIGHT THERE,
YOU GUYS!

191
00:09:20,433 --> 00:09:24,667
- HOLD IT RIGHT THERE!
- [GROANING]

192
00:09:24,667 --> 00:09:26,300
HEY! THAT WAS THE SAME SHOT!

193
00:09:26,300 --> 00:09:28,733
EXACT SAME.

194
00:09:28,733 --> 00:09:31,867
SO WHAT GOES ON IN TEXAS?
OPENING FIRE ON COPS,
KILLING PRESIDENTS,

195
00:09:31,867 --> 00:09:34,133
THE WHOLE BUSH THING--
I MEAN, WHAT THE HELL?

196
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:38,267
THE BRISKET IS IN THE--
[SIGHS]

197
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,600
OH, MY HEART’S SHUTTING DOWN
AGAIN. HANG ON.

198
00:09:46,633 --> 00:09:48,533
WELL, IT’LL BE A LOT OF FUN
TO SHOOT AT HIM NOW.

199
00:09:48,533 --> 00:09:50,833
I MEAN, HE’S GONNA DIE ANYWAY.

200
00:09:50,833 --> 00:09:53,733
HE JUST BLEACHED HIS HAIR
AND SHAPED IT INTO A HAT.

201
00:09:59,500 --> 00:10:00,833
IT’S IT HAPPENED ONE NIGHT,

202
00:10:00,833 --> 00:10:02,867
ONLY GAY.

203
00:10:02,867 --> 00:10:06,600
- YOU KILLED A COP!
- LISTEN.

204
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,667
SHOULD I EXPLAIN TO THEM
WHAT WE ARE DOING

205
00:10:08,667 --> 00:10:11,200
OUT HERE IN
THE MIDDLE OF NOWHERE?

206
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,400
THE BORDER’S GOT TO BE
SOMEWHERE NEAR HERE.

207
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:16,833
- STRANGE TEXAS DRAWL.
- MM-HMM.

208
00:10:16,833 --> 00:10:19,733
THEN IT’S EUROPE, KIDDO!
IT’S EUROPE, LET’S GO! COME ON!

209
00:10:21,333 --> 00:10:24,333
"THE SUN IS BLOTTED OUT
AS JOE DON BAKER APPROACHES."

210
00:10:28,933 --> 00:10:30,400
ALL RIGHT, HALT, OR I’LL FART!

211
00:10:34,733 --> 00:10:37,033
CAN HE PROVE
HE’S NOT HOYT AXTON?

212
00:10:40,867 --> 00:10:43,000
AH, NOW IT ALL BECOMES...
HUH?

213
00:10:44,667 --> 00:10:48,900
♪♪ [THEME]

214
00:10:48,900 --> 00:10:50,667
MUSIC FROM
THE POLICEWOMAN SOUNDTRACK.

215
00:10:53,767 --> 00:10:55,967
WE HAVE TO CROSS THE RIVER
INTO ITALY.

216
00:10:59,967 --> 00:11:04,433
HEY! THIS ISN’T PHONEY!
WE FOUND IT! THE BORDER!

217
00:11:04,433 --> 00:11:06,933
- LOOK!
- THEY FOUND A TACO BELL?
BIG DEAL.

218
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,767
FIRST TIME WATER HAS
HIT HIS PANTS IN OVER A YEAR.

219
00:11:11,767 --> 00:11:13,433
AT LEAST FROM THE OUTSIDE.

220
00:11:21,533 --> 00:11:23,600
THE GUY ON THE RIGHT
IS FROM THE KNACK.

221
00:11:24,933 --> 00:11:27,067
HOLD IT! RIGHT THERE.

222
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:30,567
NOW OVER FOUR INCHES. GOOD.

223
00:11:30,567 --> 00:11:34,533
RELAX, DONNY.
HE’S GOT NO AUTHORITY HERE.

224
00:11:34,533 --> 00:11:37,133
- "HE’S GOT ALL DOROTHY HERE?"
- YOU CAN DO NOTHING TO US!

225
00:11:37,133 --> 00:11:40,067
YOU’RE AMERICAN!
WE ARE ACROSS THE BORDER!

226
00:11:40,067 --> 00:11:41,800
THAT BORDER DON’T
MEAN [MUTED] TO ME.

227
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:45,267
- JUST A LINE, MISTER.
- QUICK. DISTRACT HIM
WITH A MOSTACCIOLI.

228
00:11:45,267 --> 00:11:48,300
YOU THINK YOU CAN TAKE ME?
GO RIGHT ON.

229
00:11:48,300 --> 00:11:50,867
HE’S SWEATING
PALM KERNEL OIL.

230
00:11:52,367 --> 00:11:54,600
IT’S YOUR MOVE.

231
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:57,700
WHAT? HIM, OR ME?

232
00:12:02,767 --> 00:12:05,267
HUH? HIS CHEST HAIR’S
ON FIRE, NO?

233
00:12:07,133 --> 00:12:10,533
- THEY JUST WANT A LAZZERONI!
- OOH! [SCREAMING]

234
00:12:10,533 --> 00:12:12,633
IN THE TIME IT TAKES HIM TO
FALL, THE GOVERNMENT IN ITALY

235
00:12:12,633 --> 00:12:14,833
CHANGES THREE TIMES.

236
00:12:14,833 --> 00:12:17,333
- YOU SON OF A [MUTED].
- WHAT?

237
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:20,167
WHAT IS HE A SON OF?
A PREACHER MAN?

238
00:12:20,167 --> 00:12:22,600
- SON OF A SAILOR, MAYBE?
- I DON’T KNOW.

239
00:12:24,667 --> 00:12:27,300
HE ABSORBED ALL THE WATER.

240
00:12:27,300 --> 00:12:29,433
- DONNY!
- [LAUGHS]

241
00:12:29,433 --> 00:12:31,367
- DONNY!
- SEEING EYE TO EYE.

242
00:12:31,367 --> 00:12:33,500
- DONNY!
- HEY!

243
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:36,467
- YOU SON OF A...
- ...SOMETHING!

244
00:12:36,467 --> 00:12:38,667
YOU DON’T HAVE
THE RIGHT TO DO THIS.

245
00:12:38,667 --> 00:12:40,900
I GOT ALL THE RIGHT I NEED.
NOW GET OFF YOUR KNEES,

246
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:42,433
- YOU SON OF A [MUTED].
- SAME THING YOU SAID.

247
00:12:42,433 --> 00:12:44,067
COME ON,
YOU YELLOW-BELLIED [MUTED].

248
00:12:44,067 --> 00:12:45,800
GO FOR IT!
I WANT YOU TO DRAW!

249
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:47,333
COME ON! WHAT’S THE MATTER,

250
00:12:47,333 --> 00:12:49,533
SHOOTING PEOPLE FROM THE DARK
MORE YOUR STYLE?

251
00:12:49,533 --> 00:12:51,233
YOU THINK YOU CAN TAKE ME?
GO AHEAD ON.

252
00:12:51,233 --> 00:12:53,867
- HERE’S MY MEATY FLANK.
- IT’S YOUR MOVE.

253
00:12:53,867 --> 00:12:56,767
YOU’LL PAY FOR MY BROTHER!
I SWEAR, YOU’LL PAY!

254
00:12:56,767 --> 00:12:59,067
- YOU’RE SCUM, AIN’T YOU?
- [YELPS IN PAIN]

255
00:12:59,067 --> 00:13:00,967
YOU KILL MY BROTHER,
I’D BARBECUE YOU.

256
00:13:00,967 --> 00:13:02,367
NOW GET UP
AND GO FOR YOUR GUN!

257
00:13:02,367 --> 00:13:06,000
YOU’LL SEE MY GUN
WHEN THE TIME COMES.

258
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:08,600
I SWEAR ON GOD
YOU’RE GONNA PAY FOR THIS.

259
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:10,333
"I’LL KILL YOU,
BUT I WON’T CURSE YOU!"

260
00:13:10,333 --> 00:13:12,067
THE MAN YOU KILLED BACK THERE
WAS MY PARTNER.

261
00:13:12,067 --> 00:13:14,100
OUGHT TO KILL YOU
ON GENERAL PRINCIPAL.

262
00:13:14,100 --> 00:13:17,100
INSTEAD, I’M GONNA
TAKE YOU TO TEXAS AND JUSTICE.

263
00:13:17,100 --> 00:13:19,100
YOU GOT THE RIGHT
TO REMAIN SILENT.

264
00:13:19,100 --> 00:13:20,633
- [GROANS]
- OH, HE IS A REAL COP.

265
00:13:20,633 --> 00:13:22,567
AND ALL THAT OTHER STUFF.

266
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:33,567
THOMAS JEFFERSON
GERONIMO III.

267
00:13:33,567 --> 00:13:36,367
IT’S APACHE.
THAT’S PRONOUNCED "HERONIMO."

268
00:13:36,367 --> 00:13:39,433
AN APACHE THAT’S A SHERIFF?
WHAT’S THIS WORLD COMIN’ TO?

269
00:13:39,433 --> 00:13:42,300
NOW, YOU’LL BE WORKING WITH
THE ITALIAN AUTHORITIES ON THIS.

270
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:45,033
NOW JUST DO AS YOU’RE TOLD.
MY GOD, THIS IS GOING TO BE

271
00:13:45,033 --> 00:13:46,733
A WONDERFUL PIECE
OF INTERNATIONAL P.R.

272
00:13:46,733 --> 00:13:49,167
IT’S NOT MY JOB TO EXTRADITE.
I’M A DEPUTY SHERIFF,

273
00:13:49,167 --> 00:13:52,967
NOT A BORDER PATROL AGENT--
- MOM MADE ME
A REAL COWBOY SUIT.

274
00:13:52,967 --> 00:13:55,500
NORMALLY I WOULD,
BUT YOU’RE SORT OF A HERO
TO THE ITALIANS--

275
00:13:55,500 --> 00:13:56,933
YOU KNOW, BIG TEXAS SHERIFF
AND ALL?

276
00:13:56,933 --> 00:13:58,933
THEY WANT TO PERSONALLY THANK
YOU FOR CAPTURING THIS MAN.

277
00:13:58,933 --> 00:14:01,000
- WHAT DO I GET OUT OF THIS?
- A MEDAL.

278
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,500
- A MEDAL?
- LIKE ZINC?

279
00:14:02,500 --> 00:14:04,200
THAT OUGHT TO FROST THEIR ___
IN DALLAS.

280
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,900
SO NOBLE.

281
00:14:05,900 --> 00:14:07,300
YOU SEE,
MR. PALERMO’S BEEN

282
00:14:07,300 --> 00:14:10,067
A MAJOR SOURCE OF EMBARRASSMENT
TO THE ITALIAN GOVERNMENT.

283
00:14:10,067 --> 00:14:12,567
- THAT’S HARD TO DO!
- HE’S MADE CONTRACTS
ON FOUR CONTINENTS

284
00:14:12,567 --> 00:14:15,033
- THAT WE KNOW OF.
- BEEN A BUSY BOY, HUH?

285
00:14:15,033 --> 00:14:17,167
- OH, HI!
- I GET AROUND, COWBOY.

286
00:14:17,167 --> 00:14:21,300
OKAY? WHAT MAKES YOU THINK
YOU CAN HANDLE A GUY LIKE ME?

287
00:14:21,300 --> 00:14:23,733
- UH-HUH?
- YOU DON’T KNOW ANYTHING.

288
00:14:23,733 --> 00:14:25,867
YOU’RE GOING TO EUROPE.

289
00:14:25,867 --> 00:14:29,167
DO YOU KNOW HOW HARSH
THE TOILET PAPER IS OVER THERE?

290
00:14:32,667 --> 00:14:34,700
[SPEAKING ITALIAN]

291
00:14:34,700 --> 00:14:36,467
- [SPEAKING FRENCH]
- HMM?

292
00:14:36,467 --> 00:14:38,733
- [SPEAKING GERMAN]
- YEAH, LICKIN’-ZIE ME.

293
00:14:38,733 --> 00:14:42,367
[SIGHS] IF I’D KNOWN
YOU WAS GONNA BE SUCH A FUSS,

294
00:14:42,367 --> 00:14:44,400
I’D HAVE DUSTED YOUR [MUTED]
BACK ON THE BORDER,

295
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:46,567
- WHEN I HAD THE CHANCE.
- YOU SON OF A--

296
00:14:46,567 --> 00:14:50,333
OOH, YOU’LL GET
YOUR CHANCE, COWBOY. YEAH.

297
00:14:50,333 --> 00:14:52,833
- YOU CAN MAKE A BOOK ON IT.
- IT WOULD BE CALLED,
"GETTING YOUR CHANCE".

298
00:14:52,833 --> 00:14:55,333
JUST TURN MR. PALERMO HERE
OVER TO THE ITALIAN AUTHORITIES,

299
00:14:55,333 --> 00:14:57,433
GET THEM TO SIGN HIM OFF,
AND YOU GO BACK TO TEXAS

300
00:14:57,433 --> 00:14:58,667
AND ENJOY YOURSELF.

301
00:14:58,667 --> 00:15:00,733
- HMM.
- WHO KNOWS?

302
00:15:00,733 --> 00:15:02,100
YOU MIGHT LIKE EUROPE.

303
00:15:02,100 --> 00:15:05,367
GUESTS OF "FINAL JUSTICE"
FLY TWA.

304
00:15:09,767 --> 00:15:11,467
[SOFTLY]
DARLING, WHAT IS YOUR NAME?

305
00:15:11,467 --> 00:15:13,833
- IT’S BUTCH.
- NO, THANKS, MA’AM. SHUT UP!

306
00:15:17,100 --> 00:15:18,600
JON LOVITZ
REFUSES A DRINK.

307
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:20,467
AS DOES ANDY WARHOL.

308
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:25,600
LET’S TALK LOUDLY
ABOUT OUR S.U.V.s.

309
00:15:28,733 --> 00:15:31,400
[BEEPS]

310
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:34,100
THIS REMINDS THE PILOT
HE’S BEEN A FAILURE IN LIFE.

311
00:15:35,800 --> 00:15:38,933
- I’LL ANNOUNCE IT.
- "LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,
I’M A FAILURE."

312
00:15:38,933 --> 00:15:41,400
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,
THIS IS YOUR PILOT SPEAKING.

313
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:43,967
WE’RE EXPERIENCING
SOME TECHNICAL DIFFICULTIES.

314
00:15:43,967 --> 00:15:45,667
NOTHING TO BE ALARMED ABOUT.

315
00:15:45,667 --> 00:15:48,200
HOWEVER, WE WILL NOT BE
PROCEEDING ON TO SICILY.

316
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,500
WE WILL BE LANDING
AT THE NEAREST ISLAND, MALTA.

317
00:15:50,500 --> 00:15:52,167
- STEWARDESS.
- CAN I HAVE ANOTHER MEAL?

318
00:15:52,167 --> 00:15:55,867
- WHERE THE HELL’S MALTA?
- IT’S A BEAUTIFUL ISLAND
NEARBY.

319
00:15:55,867 --> 00:15:58,633
SORT OF LIKE GALVESTON?

320
00:15:58,633 --> 00:16:01,100
YES, PLENTY OF ROOM
FOR DEVELOPMENT, IN MALTA!

321
00:16:01,100 --> 00:16:04,633
MALTA, MAKERS OF FINE CROSSES,
KNIGHTS AND FALCONS!

322
00:16:04,633 --> 00:16:07,167
- PLEASE PROCEED
TO PASSPORT CONTROL--
- UH, MA’AM.

323
00:16:07,167 --> 00:16:10,267
- CAN I HAVE ANOTHER MEAL?
- WHEN IS THIS PLANE GOING
TO BE READY TO GO TO SICILY?

324
00:16:10,267 --> 00:16:12,700
SORRY, SIR. IT APPEARS
NOT UNTIL TOMORROW.

325
00:16:12,700 --> 00:16:15,000
WE’VE MADE ARRANGEMENTS
FOR OVERNIGHT ACCOMMODATIONS.

326
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:16,933
- YOU MUST PROCEED TO CUSTOMS.
- THANK YOU, MA’AM.

327
00:16:16,933 --> 00:16:19,100
- NO MEAL.
- THAT’S GREAT.

328
00:16:19,100 --> 00:16:22,433
- HERE YOU GO.
- AIR MALTA FLIGHT 110,

329
00:16:22,433 --> 00:16:25,367
NOW DEPARTING FOR LONDON,
GATE 12.

330
00:16:25,367 --> 00:16:27,633
THE ROUGH SEX
GOT OUT OF HAND.

331
00:16:27,633 --> 00:16:31,400
- PAGING MR. LENO CASAR.
- AAH! I DON’T WANT
TO BE DOWN HERE!

332
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:33,833
- UGH.
- IN THE BACK.

333
00:16:33,833 --> 00:16:36,567
- YES, SIR?
- PUT THOSE BAGS IN THE BACK
THERE, WILL YOU, PAL?

334
00:16:36,567 --> 00:16:38,800
THE THREE-INCH TAXICAB DRIVER.

335
00:16:42,633 --> 00:16:45,067
- OKAY, WHERE TO, CAP?
- POLICE HEADQUARTERS.

336
00:16:45,067 --> 00:16:47,067
POLICE HEADQUARTERS?
ARE YOU IN SOME TROUBLE, SIR?

337
00:16:47,067 --> 00:16:48,533
JUST DRIVE ME
TO POLICE HEADQUARTERS.

338
00:16:48,533 --> 00:16:51,167
- CARRY THIS UP FRONT, WILL YOU?
- I DO, BOSS! I’LL DO, BOSS.

339
00:16:51,167 --> 00:16:54,567
- YES, SIR, BOSS!
- THANKS, PAL.

340
00:16:54,567 --> 00:16:57,567
MAN, I CAN’T BELIEVE I’M BEING
SEEN WITH JOE DON BAKER!

341
00:16:57,567 --> 00:16:59,700
WHERE DO YOU COME FROM, TEX?

342
00:16:59,700 --> 00:17:02,767
- TEXAS.
- OH, TEXAS! I KNEW, I KNEW!

343
00:17:02,767 --> 00:17:05,467
- DO YOU KNOW JOHN WAYNE?
- GACY, YES.

344
00:17:05,467 --> 00:17:08,767
- AMERICANS, HUH?
- HEY, PAL. YOU’RE ON
THE WRONG SIDE OF THE ROAD.

345
00:17:08,767 --> 00:17:10,367
- GAME OVER.
- NO, NO!

346
00:17:10,367 --> 00:17:12,500
- THIS IS
THE MAUSOLEUM DISTRICT.
- WE’RE ON THE LEFT SIDE.

347
00:17:12,500 --> 00:17:14,067
IN MALTA,
WE DRIVE ON THE LEFT.

348
00:17:14,067 --> 00:17:16,600
THERE’S OUR NEW CONVENTION
CENTER! IT WAS BUILT IN 1411!

349
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:18,433
- YOU FROM SICILY?
- [SPEAKING ITALIAN]

350
00:17:18,433 --> 00:17:21,067
- AHH, SICILIANO!
- HEY, HEY.

351
00:17:21,067 --> 00:17:24,367
HEY! DIDN’T I TELL YOU
NOT TO TALK TO HIM?

352
00:17:24,367 --> 00:17:26,567
- [ITALIAN]
- HOW ’BOUT YOU
JUST SHUTTIN’ UP,

353
00:17:26,567 --> 00:17:28,033
AND TAKING ME
TO THE POLICE STATION, HUH?

354
00:17:28,033 --> 00:17:29,867
NOW WATCH THIS, GUYS.

355
00:17:29,867 --> 00:17:32,200
AAH! THE MALTESE CAR!

356
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:35,333
AAAH!

357
00:17:35,333 --> 00:17:38,867
-ALL THE GERMAN BOMBERS COME.
-OH, I’D USE THAT
EVERY NOW AND THEN.

358
00:17:38,867 --> 00:17:40,867
THE STUKA COMES,
AND THE MESSERSCHMIDT,

359
00:17:40,867 --> 00:17:43,000
AND THEY COME
TO BOMBARD US.
[LAUGHS]

360
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:45,000
I DON’T KNOW HOW
WE MANAGED TO SURVIVE--

361
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:47,433
COME ON, GET OUT OF HERE!
MOVE IT!

362
00:17:47,433 --> 00:17:49,967
- PULL OVER, YOU!
- AH, RUSH HOUR ON THE 405.

363
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:56,500
- [GUNSHOT]
- SORRY, I WAS JUST TRYING
TO PASS YOU!

364
00:17:59,433 --> 00:18:01,600
LUGGAGE HITTING A GORILLA.
THAT’S DIFFERENT.

365
00:18:04,533 --> 00:18:06,967
JOE DON WHIZZES IT
IN RECORD TIME.

366
00:18:09,600 --> 00:18:13,133
- PULL OVER.
- CARS PROVIDED BY MATCHBOX.

367
00:18:16,100 --> 00:18:19,833
- PLEASE DON’T SHOOT.
- DON’T WORRY. [ITALIAN]

368
00:18:21,367 --> 00:18:22,967
GIVE ME ROOM
ON MY SIDE, YOU JERK!

369
00:18:22,967 --> 00:18:24,900
NO, YOU BUGGER!

370
00:18:30,100 --> 00:18:32,033
- [GUNSHOT]
- OH, MY BUTT!

371
00:18:33,433 --> 00:18:35,567
THE VATICAN BANK
GETS SERIOUS.

372
00:18:37,733 --> 00:18:40,267
JOE DON BAKER’S FAMOUS
DELAYED REACTION FARTS.

373
00:18:43,267 --> 00:18:46,200
REVENGE IS A DISH BEST SERVED
WITH LAUGHTER AND GIGGLES.

374
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:48,067
AND GOD SENDS A DOOR CHASSIS
FROM HOME.

375
00:18:53,633 --> 00:18:55,633
THESE BOOTS ARE
FROM GATEWAY COMPUTER.

376
00:18:57,133 --> 00:18:58,767
SUPERINTENDENT MIFSUD
WOULD LIKE TO SEE YOU.

377
00:18:59,900 --> 00:19:01,567
AAH, PFFT--
OH, GUNTHER!

378
00:19:01,567 --> 00:19:04,800
- RIGHT.
- [SIGHS]

379
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:06,667
CARL, QUIT PLAYING
"TOLL BRIDGE".

380
00:19:10,100 --> 00:19:12,933
HMM. YEAH, I’M GLAD THEY WENT
WITH THE FRESCOES

381
00:19:12,933 --> 00:19:15,667
INSTEAD OF THE DROP CEILING
WITH THE ACOUSTICAL TILES.

382
00:19:17,767 --> 00:19:20,567
MAN, IT’D BE GREAT TO PUT
A SLIP ’N’ SLIDE IN THERE, HUH?

383
00:19:20,567 --> 00:19:21,933
- COOL!
- WSSHH!

384
00:19:21,933 --> 00:19:23,900
WSSHH!

385
00:19:23,900 --> 00:19:27,000
- YES?
- EXCUSE ME, SIR. YOU WANTED
TO SEE THE AMERICAN?

386
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:29,033
OH, YES. I’LL GET TO YOU LATER.

387
00:19:29,033 --> 00:19:30,733
MENACHEM BEGIN
TRANSFERRED TO MALTA!

388
00:19:30,733 --> 00:19:33,200
SORRY TO HAVE ARRESTED YOU,
SHERIFF GERONIMO,

389
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:36,633
BUT YOU UNDERSTAND-- WE HAD
NO WAY OF KNOWING WHO YOU WERE.

390
00:19:36,633 --> 00:19:38,300
IT’S PRONOUNCED "HERONIMO."

391
00:19:38,300 --> 00:19:40,733
OH, YES, YES. YOU HAVE
MY PRAYERS AND APOLOGIES.

392
00:19:40,733 --> 00:19:45,533
- NOT NECESSARY.
- YOUR SUPERIOR, MR. WILSON,
IN WASHINGTON,

393
00:19:45,533 --> 00:19:47,567
IS ON MY SPEAKER.

394
00:19:47,567 --> 00:19:49,933
AND HE WOULD
LIKE TO TALK TO YOU.

395
00:19:49,933 --> 00:19:53,200
PLEASE, DO SIT DOWN.

396
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:55,633
PLEASE, NO TEXAS ASSES
ON MY DESK.

397
00:19:58,300 --> 00:20:01,367
- MR. WILSON, ARE YOU THERE?
- YES, GO AHEAD.

398
00:20:01,367 --> 00:20:04,633
LET ME APOLOGIZE ONCE AGAIN
FOR DISTURBING YOU AT YOUR HOME

399
00:20:04,633 --> 00:20:06,367
AT THIS LATE HOUR IN AMERICA.

400
00:20:06,367 --> 00:20:08,667
THAT’S PERFECTLY ALL RIGHT,
SUPERINTENDANT MIFSUD.

401
00:20:08,667 --> 00:20:10,000
IS GERONIMO WITH YOU?

402
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:13,867
THE BIG DUMPLING
IN THE WEIRD SUIT?

403
00:20:13,867 --> 00:20:17,667
- YES, SIR. HE’S RIGHT HERE.
- YOU SCREWED IT UP, COWBOY.
WHAT HAPPENED?

404
00:20:17,667 --> 00:20:20,900
- WELL, HE HAD A BRIEFCASE!
- AS NEAR AS WE CAN TELL,

405
00:20:20,900 --> 00:20:24,033
PALERMO’S PEOPLE, IN SOME WAY,
TAMPERED WITH THE AIRPLANE

406
00:20:24,033 --> 00:20:26,500
AND FORCED IT TO LAND
BEFORE IT COULD GET TO SICILY.

407
00:20:26,500 --> 00:20:28,500
NOW, YOU LISTEN TO ME, GERONIMO.

408
00:20:28,500 --> 00:20:31,967
THE MALTESE AND ITALIAN
AUTHORITIES WILL HANDLE THIS
FROM NOW ON.

409
00:20:31,967 --> 00:20:34,333
I WANT YOU TO CATCH THE NEXT
PLANE BACK TO THE UNITED STATES,

410
00:20:34,333 --> 00:20:36,633
AND FILE YOUR REPORT,
YOU UNDERSTAND?

411
00:20:36,633 --> 00:20:40,067
- YOU SAYIN’ I WAS SET UP?
- THAT’S WHAT THE MAN SAID,
COWBOY.

412
00:20:40,067 --> 00:20:43,667
GUESS YOU WERE RIGHT.
I SHOULD HAVE SENT ONE
OF MY BOYS FROM IMMIGRATION

413
00:20:43,667 --> 00:20:46,533
INSTEAD OF A SMALL-TOWN
TEXAS SHERIFF.

414
00:20:46,533 --> 00:20:48,367
SUPERINTENDANT MIFSUD,
THANK YOU ONCE AGAIN

415
00:20:48,367 --> 00:20:49,867
FOR YOUR ASSISTANCE,

416
00:20:49,867 --> 00:20:51,967
AND GERONIMO,
YOU HAVE YOUR ORDERS.

417
00:20:51,967 --> 00:20:53,600
THANK YOU AGAIN,
SUPERINTENDANT. GOOD-BYE.

418
00:20:53,600 --> 00:20:56,633
ALWAYS A PLEASURE TO HELP.
GOOD-BYE, MR. WILSON.

419
00:20:56,633 --> 00:20:59,267
GOOD LUCK IN YOUR CONTINUING
FIGHT AGAINST DENNIS.

420
00:20:59,267 --> 00:21:01,367
- MM.
- LOW-STEM SALAD?

421
00:21:01,367 --> 00:21:03,400
YOU MUST LEARN
TO RELAX, JOSEPH.

422
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:05,400
YEAH, YEAH, YEAH, YEAH.

423
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:08,100
I HAVE A NEW ASSIGNMENT
COMING UP IN A FEW WEEKS.

424
00:21:08,100 --> 00:21:10,700
- WHERE?
- THE FAR EAST.

425
00:21:10,700 --> 00:21:14,500
GOOD! I LIKE ASIAN CUISINE.
BESIDES, I HAVEN’T BEEN THERE
IN ALMOST A YEAR.

426
00:21:14,500 --> 00:21:17,600
- WHY HAS IT BEEN THAT LONG?
- WHO’S THE HIT?

427
00:21:17,600 --> 00:21:19,133
- THE BANKER.
- I’M READY.

428
00:21:19,133 --> 00:21:20,900
HEY, DON’T DO THAT
WITH THE ROBE.

429
00:21:20,900 --> 00:21:23,367
I’LL GET YOU OFF THIS ISLAND
IN LESS THAN A WEEK.

430
00:21:23,367 --> 00:21:28,033
A WEEK? PLEASE, DON LEMANNA,
I’LL GET CRAZY WITHOUT
DOING ANYTHING.

431
00:21:28,033 --> 00:21:30,667
- COME ON, PLEASE!
- [CHUCKLES]

432
00:21:30,667 --> 00:21:33,733
- HELLO, SISTER.
- WHEN I WAS YOUR AGE, JOSEPH,

433
00:21:33,733 --> 00:21:37,500
-I SOMETIMES HAD TO SHAKE IT...
-[TOM SERVO BLATHERS]

434
00:21:53,267 --> 00:21:55,367
OKAY, HANG ON.
CHECK THIS OUT, HMM?

435
00:21:55,367 --> 00:21:58,633
OKAY, WATCH-- SEE?
AND... THERE!

436
00:21:58,633 --> 00:22:00,900
- [LAUGHS]
- SAME SHOT, USED TWICE!

437
00:22:00,900 --> 00:22:02,833
CONTINUITY, UH-UH.

438
00:22:02,833 --> 00:22:04,700
HEY, MIKE, COME IN HERE.
YOU GOT TO SEE THIS.

439
00:22:04,700 --> 00:22:07,933
TIME TO COMPLAIN TO PEARL.
HEY, PEARL! THESE MOVIES
YOU SEND US!

440
00:22:09,367 --> 00:22:11,367
OH, GOOD ONE, NEL-DORK.

441
00:22:11,367 --> 00:22:12,733
WHAT DO YOU WANT?
I’M BUSY.

442
00:22:12,733 --> 00:22:14,867
LOOK AT THAT!
MIKE’S TRIPPING, PEARL!

443
00:22:14,867 --> 00:22:16,900
[LAUGHS]
YEAH! AGAIN!

444
00:22:16,900 --> 00:22:18,433
WHAT’S HIS PROBLEM?

445
00:22:18,433 --> 00:22:20,833
YOU SEE, SOMETIMES
MIKE JUST TRIPS!

446
00:22:20,833 --> 00:22:23,600
UH-HUH. WOULD YOU
GET HIM TO STOP?

447
00:22:23,600 --> 00:22:26,300
THIS IS JUST
ONE OF THOSE TIMES!

448
00:22:26,300 --> 00:22:30,067
OH. I SEE.
YOU’RE COMPLAINING.

449
00:22:30,067 --> 00:22:32,633
YOU’RE MAKING THE POINT
THAT ONCE IN A WHILE,

450
00:22:32,633 --> 00:22:34,700
THESE MOVIES LEAVE
A LITTLE SOMETHING TO BE--

451
00:22:34,700 --> 00:22:36,900
OOPS, CAN’T TALK NOW!
MIKE’S TRIPPING!

452
00:22:36,900 --> 00:22:38,500
LOOK, I GET IT!

453
00:22:38,500 --> 00:22:40,733
UH, I’LL GET BACK TO YOU!
MIKE’S TRIPPING!

454
00:22:40,733 --> 00:22:44,933
- OKAY! FINE! NOW CAN I--
- SORRY, MIKE’S TRIPPING!
GOTTA GO!

455
00:22:44,933 --> 00:22:48,600
I GET THE POINT.
WOULD YOU STOP AND LET ME--

456
00:22:48,600 --> 00:22:51,000
WHAT’S THAT YOU SAY?
MIKE’S TRIPPING.

457
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:54,167
OKAY! I PROMISE I WILL NEVER

458
00:22:54,167 --> 00:22:56,733
SEND ANOTHER BAD MOVIE

459
00:22:56,733 --> 00:22:59,500
WITH JOE DON BAKER IN WHICH
A DARK-HAIRED SHERIFF

460
00:22:59,500 --> 00:23:03,267
IN A SMALL ROLE GETS SHOT
AND SLIDES DOWN A WALL TWICE--

461
00:23:03,267 --> 00:23:05,567
OKAY? HAPPY?

462
00:23:05,567 --> 00:23:08,367
YE-HEAH, ALL RIGHT!

463
00:23:08,367 --> 00:23:10,367
WELL, IT WAS HARD,
BUT IT WAS WORTH IT.

464
00:23:10,367 --> 00:23:12,200
- MM-HMM.
- YEP. WE’LL BE RIGHT BACK.

465
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:13,467
- NICE JOB.
- HOO-HOO!

466
00:23:13,467 --> 00:23:14,567
- OH! OOH!
- MIKE’S TRIPPING.

467
00:23:14,567 --> 00:23:15,600
I’LL SAY.

468
00:23:22,800 --> 00:23:25,767
OH, THE MALTESE MACY’S
THANKSGIVING PARADE!

469
00:23:30,267 --> 00:23:31,900
THE GUNBELT THEME.

470
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:35,767
I’M SURE GLAD WE GET TO SEE
JOE DON’S ACCESSORIES.

471
00:23:35,767 --> 00:23:39,100
[PERSISTENT KNOCKING]

472
00:23:39,100 --> 00:23:40,567
COME ON IN.
IT’S OPEN.

473
00:23:40,567 --> 00:23:44,200
- OH, NO. WHAT’S OPEN?
- IT’S THERE ON THE TABLE.

474
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:47,300
- SUPERINTENDANT GERONIMO?
- HUH? OH, YOU’RE NOT RIBS.

475
00:23:47,300 --> 00:23:49,300
OH, I THOUGHT
IT WAS ROOM SERVICE.

476
00:23:49,300 --> 00:23:53,633
IT’S "HERONIMO,"
DEPUTY SHERIFF "HERONIMO."

477
00:23:53,633 --> 00:23:56,967
- WHAT YOU WANT?
- SUPERINTENDANT MIFSUD SENT ME

478
00:23:56,967 --> 00:23:58,900
TO SEE IF I CAN
HELP YOU WITH ANYTHING.

479
00:23:58,900 --> 00:24:00,667
CAN YOU HELP ME UP?

480
00:24:00,667 --> 00:24:03,200
THE ONLY THING I REALLY WANT
HERE, HONEY, IS PALERMO.

481
00:24:03,200 --> 00:24:05,100
AND I DON’T THINK
YOU CAN HELP ME THERE.

482
00:24:05,100 --> 00:24:08,233
HOW UPSET WITH YOU WAS
YOUR CAPTAIN WHEN HE CAN’T
POSSIBLY GET AWAY--

483
00:24:08,233 --> 00:24:10,700
SUPERINTENDANT MIFSUD
WILL SEE TO THAT--

484
00:24:10,700 --> 00:24:12,500
IN THE MEANTIME,
SINCE YOU’VE GOT
THE REST OF THE DAY

485
00:24:12,500 --> 00:24:14,700
WITH NOTHING TO DO
AND IT’S CARNIVAL TIME,

486
00:24:14,700 --> 00:24:17,300
I THOUGHT MAYBE I CAN
SHOW YOU AROUND OUR ISLAND.

487
00:24:17,300 --> 00:24:20,433
- WHAT DID YOU SAY AFTER "THE"?
- WELL, THANKS ANYWAY, HONEY.

488
00:24:20,433 --> 00:24:22,433
OH, SHE HAS NO IDEA
HOW LUCKY SHE IS.

489
00:24:22,433 --> 00:24:24,833
- YEAH.
- CARNIVAL?

490
00:24:24,833 --> 00:24:27,333
- IS IT A BIG CARNIVAL?
- CAN I GET A BALLOON?

491
00:24:27,333 --> 00:24:28,967
THAT’S WHAT THAT NOISE
IS ALL ABOUT.

492
00:24:30,833 --> 00:24:33,067
- ♪♪ [CARNIVAL]
- [CHEERING]

493
00:24:33,067 --> 00:24:35,233
SOMEONE TOSS ME UP A CALZONE?

494
00:24:36,333 --> 00:24:38,667
- EGOISTE!
- EGOISTE. EGOISTE.

495
00:24:41,633 --> 00:24:45,000
HEY, IT’S A LADY
ELAINE FAIRCHILDE FLOAT.

496
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:49,067
YOU REALLY THINK PALERMO MIGHT
STILL BE ON THIS LITTLE PIECE
OF ROCK YOU CALL MALTA?

497
00:24:49,067 --> 00:24:51,700
- POSITIVE.
- HOW BIG’S THIS PLACE?

498
00:24:51,700 --> 00:24:55,200
WELL, THE MAIN ISLAND’S ONLY
9 MILES WIDE BY 17 MILES LONG.

499
00:24:55,200 --> 00:24:58,600
WE GOT COW PASTURES
BIGGER THAN THAT IN TEXAS.

500
00:24:58,600 --> 00:25:01,067
- MY PEOPLE! WINK, WINK, WINK.
- MIGHT BE PRETTY HARD

501
00:25:01,067 --> 00:25:03,100
TO HIDE OUT
IN A PLACE LIKE THIS.

502
00:25:03,100 --> 00:25:05,267
THINK I WILL TAKE A LOOK
AROUND, TALK TO SOME PEOPLE.

503
00:25:05,267 --> 00:25:07,333
I’M NOT GETTING ANYTHING
DONE IN THIS HOTEL ROOM.

504
00:25:07,333 --> 00:25:09,200
NOT ANYTHING YOU NEED
TO KNOW ABOUT.

505
00:25:10,733 --> 00:25:12,600
ELAINE BENES DISAPPROVED.

506
00:25:14,467 --> 00:25:16,933
HE HAS DOUBLE CHINS
ON HIS EYELIDS.

507
00:25:20,433 --> 00:25:23,200
THE MALTESE ARE EXCITED.
THEY THINK HE’S BUM PHILLIPS.

508
00:25:27,433 --> 00:25:29,467
KISS HAS SOFTENED THEIR ACT.,

509
00:25:29,467 --> 00:25:34,100
HEY, IT’S GOOSIO.
THE FAMOUS MALTESE CHILDREN’S
CHARACTER GOOSIO.

510
00:25:34,100 --> 00:25:36,067
NUNCIO.

511
00:25:36,067 --> 00:25:38,867
I’LL USE ANYTHING
TO TIDE ME OVER UNTIL LUNCH.

512
00:25:44,933 --> 00:25:47,100
EDDIE RABBIT’S
ALSO VISITING MALTA.

513
00:25:49,100 --> 00:25:53,067
CLOWNS: TERRIFYING
IN ANY COUNTRY.

514
00:25:53,067 --> 00:25:55,767
PAY A HUNDRED DOLLARS
FOR THE REST OF THAT GELATO.

515
00:25:58,700 --> 00:26:00,200
NOT EVEN WALKING TALL?

516
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:02,600
COME ON, YOU MUST HAVE
SEEN ME IN THAT.

517
00:26:02,600 --> 00:26:03,667
TAMMY FAYE BAKER!

518
00:26:09,567 --> 00:26:12,533
EVEN THE DEAD
ENJOY CARNIVAL.

519
00:26:12,533 --> 00:26:16,967
- ♪♪ [EURO DISCO]
- HEY, IT’S JOHN MAIER
THE THROAT HOCKEY DUDE.

520
00:26:19,133 --> 00:26:21,500
MAN, THE EMBASSY IN MALTA
ROCKS!

521
00:26:24,867 --> 00:26:27,000
WE’RE OUT OF BEEF BROTH,
SO THIS IS THE LAST FULL SHOT.

522
00:26:29,967 --> 00:26:32,867
IT’S THE AEROBICS COMPETITION
ON ESPN.

523
00:26:34,933 --> 00:26:37,133
THE AUDIENCE IS FACING
THE OTHER WAY, DEBBIE!

524
00:26:38,867 --> 00:26:40,400
HOPE THESE STRIPPERS LIKE ME.

525
00:26:42,633 --> 00:26:45,100
THE ONE ON THE RIGHT IS
THE MILES DAVIS OF STRIPPERS.

526
00:26:48,733 --> 00:26:50,067
WELL, I GUESS WE BETTER

527
00:26:50,067 --> 00:26:52,933
♪ RUN... ♪

528
00:26:52,933 --> 00:26:55,300
[IMITATING MISS PIGGY]
OH, KERMIE, TAKE A LOOK
AT MY GOOD STUFF.

529
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:59,500
BOBO! I DIDN’T KNOW
HE WAS IN THIS MOVIE!

530
00:26:59,500 --> 00:27:01,700
[LAUGHING]
THERE HE IS!

531
00:27:01,700 --> 00:27:03,867
THE STATUE OF LIBERTY
AFTER RETIREMENT.

532
00:27:06,533 --> 00:27:08,900
WELL, HAPPY ST. EUROPE DAY,
EVERYBODY.

533
00:27:10,467 --> 00:27:12,367
AGH! DID YOU DOSE ME, MIKE?

534
00:27:14,533 --> 00:27:16,133
I WISH IT WERE
A ROOT BEER FLOAT.

535
00:27:21,367 --> 00:27:23,400
HEY, WAIT! WHERE ARE YOU GOING?
WAIT FOR ME!

536
00:27:23,400 --> 00:27:25,900
- HEY!
- LET’S BEAT IT, OR MY HUGE
MALTESE FAN BASE

537
00:27:25,900 --> 00:27:27,733
WILL CRUSH ME!

538
00:27:30,433 --> 00:27:32,100
DENNIS WEAVER.

539
00:27:35,833 --> 00:27:38,933
A FLOAT GOT LOOSE! OH NO,
IT’S JOE DON BAKER. SORRY.

540
00:27:41,567 --> 00:27:44,333
UH, STAR OF MITCHELL,
THANK YOU. YEAH, BIT PART
IN GOLDENEYE.

541
00:27:44,333 --> 00:27:46,667
YUP.

542
00:27:46,667 --> 00:27:48,400
HUGO BOSS
AND HIS BODYGUARDS.

543
00:27:51,100 --> 00:27:52,767
- WATCH OUT, SHERIFF--
- STAY OUT OF IT!

544
00:27:52,767 --> 00:27:54,400
YOU BETTER STAND
UPWIND OF ME!

545
00:27:58,233 --> 00:28:00,600
HOLD IT! RIGHT THERE.

546
00:28:00,600 --> 00:28:02,300
JUST A LITTLE
TO THE LEFT? GOOD.

547
00:28:02,300 --> 00:28:05,133
JOSEPH PALERMO.
WHERE IS HE?

548
00:28:05,133 --> 00:28:07,367
MR. PALERMO,
PAGING MR. PALERMO.

549
00:28:10,767 --> 00:28:12,733
"HIGH GOON."

550
00:28:16,633 --> 00:28:19,433
OKAY, THAT’S CLOSE ENOUGH.
COME ON, NO CLOSER, PLEASE!

551
00:28:19,433 --> 00:28:21,767
- HEY!
- NO, NO, NO.

552
00:28:21,767 --> 00:28:23,267
NUNZIO, THERE’S A COWBOY.

553
00:28:23,267 --> 00:28:26,267
OHH. COWBOY.

554
00:28:26,267 --> 00:28:29,033
GUY’S TAKIN’ TOO LONG IN THE
PHONE BOOTH, AND I GOT TO PEE!

555
00:28:31,300 --> 00:28:33,467
OW, HE’S WEARING
A CHIA PET HAT.

556
00:28:36,767 --> 00:28:38,733
NONE OF THEM
ARE SPONGE-WORTHY.

557
00:28:40,267 --> 00:28:42,933
- THINK YOU CAN TAKE ME?
- TO A PIZZA PLACE?

558
00:28:44,500 --> 00:28:45,867
GIUSEPPE DON BAKER.

559
00:28:50,100 --> 00:28:53,667
- GO AHEAD ON.
- WOULD THAT BE HERCULES, HMM?

560
00:28:55,533 --> 00:28:58,933
- WHO’S THAT?
- EE-YEW!

561
00:29:02,500 --> 00:29:04,300
JACKIE O!

562
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:07,900
THE UGLY,
THE UGLY AND THE UGLY.

563
00:29:16,133 --> 00:29:17,467
THE LAST THING
A SAUSAGE SEES.

564
00:29:21,767 --> 00:29:23,500
♪ HAVA NAGILAH, HAVA-- ♪

565
00:29:28,667 --> 00:29:30,233
OH, PLEASE, DON’T FIGHT.

566
00:29:34,033 --> 00:29:36,167
"WHEN FAT KILLS FAT."

567
00:29:39,767 --> 00:29:42,300
LET ME FALL AND TURN SO THAT
THESE DELICIOUS ROMA TOMATOES

568
00:29:42,300 --> 00:29:44,033
FALL RIGHT INTO MY MOUTH!

569
00:29:47,633 --> 00:29:49,933
GET BEHIND MY JOCKEY VEST!

570
00:29:49,933 --> 00:29:53,000
HALT! WAIT A MINUTE!
DON’T DO ANYTHING STUPID
WITH THAT KID.

571
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:54,467
LIKE PICK UP
SOMETHING HOT WITH HIM.

572
00:29:54,467 --> 00:29:55,467
I’LL BLOW HIS BRAINS OUT.

573
00:29:55,467 --> 00:29:58,600
LET THE KID GO, YOU [MUTED].

574
00:29:58,600 --> 00:29:59,600
GET BACK.

575
00:29:59,600 --> 00:30:00,967
[GRUNTS]

576
00:30:00,967 --> 00:30:03,467
OKAY.
I’M PUTTING IT AWAY.

577
00:30:03,467 --> 00:30:04,467
COME ON.

578
00:30:04,467 --> 00:30:05,667
LET’S TALK.

579
00:30:05,667 --> 00:30:08,667
WE’RE DRIFTIN’ APART.

580
00:30:08,667 --> 00:30:10,233
COME ON.
DON’T DO ANYTHING.

581
00:30:10,233 --> 00:30:12,533
DON’T JUGGLE
OR CALL YOUR AUNT.

582
00:30:12,533 --> 00:30:14,500
[WHIMPERING]

583
00:30:14,500 --> 00:30:16,067
ALL RIGHT.

584
00:30:16,067 --> 00:30:17,733
THINK YOU CAN TAKE ME?

585
00:30:17,733 --> 00:30:19,100
GO ’HEAD ON.

586
00:30:19,100 --> 00:30:21,067
IT’S YOUR MOVE.

587
00:30:22,267 --> 00:30:23,633
HE SAVED NAPOLEON.

588
00:30:23,633 --> 00:30:24,633
AAH!

589
00:30:24,633 --> 00:30:25,700
OH, COME HERE.

590
00:30:25,700 --> 00:30:28,033
OH, JOSEPHINE.

591
00:30:28,033 --> 00:30:29,633
[LAUGHS]

592
00:30:29,633 --> 00:30:31,367
I WILL FART ON YOUR HEAD
AS MY REVENGE.

593
00:30:33,900 --> 00:30:35,500
SUPERINTENDENT MIFSUD
WOULD LIKE TO SEE YOU.

594
00:30:35,500 --> 00:30:36,500
ALL RIGHT.
[IMITATES FLATULENCE]

595
00:30:36,500 --> 00:30:37,767
UGH.
[IMITATES BELCH]

596
00:30:37,767 --> 00:30:39,867
ALL RIGHT.

597
00:30:39,867 --> 00:30:42,100
MY LITTLE BOATS
ARE COMING THROUGH.

598
00:30:42,100 --> 00:30:43,100
HOW YA DOIN’?

599
00:30:43,100 --> 00:30:44,533
COME ON.
SHUT UP, CARL.

600
00:30:44,533 --> 00:30:47,700
[LAUGHS]
I’M WEARIN’ SPURS
ON YOUR ITALIAN MARBLE.

601
00:30:53,833 --> 00:30:55,833
REALLY, SIR.
YOU MUST LISTEN TO THE STORY

602
00:30:55,833 --> 00:30:57,700
FROM THE BEGINNING.
THEN YOU WILL UNDERSTAND

603
00:30:57,700 --> 00:30:58,767
WHAT REALLY HAPPENED.

604
00:30:58,767 --> 00:30:59,867
EXCUSE ME, SIR.

605
00:30:59,867 --> 00:31:00,933
YOU WANT TO SEE
THE AMERICAN?

606
00:31:00,933 --> 00:31:03,833
AH, YES.
YES.

607
00:31:03,833 --> 00:31:07,400
MR. WILSON FROM WASHINGTON
WOULD LIKE TO SPEAK TO YOU.

608
00:31:07,400 --> 00:31:10,300
THE ACCURSED MENACE
HAS STRUCK AGAIN.

609
00:31:11,367 --> 00:31:13,100
ARE YOU THERE,
MR. WILSON?

610
00:31:13,100 --> 00:31:14,100
[...] DAMN IT,
GERONIMO.

611
00:31:14,100 --> 00:31:16,400
WHAT THE HELL IS
GOING ON OVER THERE?

612
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:19,400
WE’VE HAD EXCELLENT RELATIONS
WITH MALTA FOR OVER 100 YEARS.

613
00:31:19,400 --> 00:31:21,000
YOU TRYING TO CHANGE
ALL THAT?

614
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:22,600
NOW WHAT THE HELL’S
GOING ON?

615
00:31:22,600 --> 00:31:24,600
THE SITUATION
DEMANDED ACTION.

616
00:31:24,600 --> 00:31:26,567
WHAT I DID WAS APPROPRIATE.

617
00:31:26,567 --> 00:31:28,700
I RECOGNIZED THE [...] THAT
HELPED PALERMO GET LOOSE

618
00:31:28,700 --> 00:31:30,867
FROM ME SO I TRIED
TO ARREST HIM.

619
00:31:30,867 --> 00:31:31,900
THAT IS CORRECT, SIR.

620
00:31:31,900 --> 00:31:33,067
THE SITUATION WAS DICTATED

621
00:31:33,067 --> 00:31:34,067
BY THE SUSPECT.

622
00:31:34,067 --> 00:31:35,167
THEY WEREN’T SUSPECTS.

623
00:31:35,167 --> 00:31:36,167
DON’T SHOW ME.

624
00:31:36,167 --> 00:31:37,600
NOW, LOOK. COWBOY.

625
00:31:37,600 --> 00:31:40,900
YOU DO EXACTLY
AS SUPERINTENDENT MIFSUD SAYS.

626
00:31:40,900 --> 00:31:43,600
DO YOU READ ME, GERONIMO?
EXACTLY.

627
00:31:43,600 --> 00:31:46,500
THEN GET YOUR [...]
ON THE NEXT PLANE BACK TO TEXAS.

628
00:31:46,500 --> 00:31:49,067
AND OBEY LIEUTENANT TIRAMISU
TILL THEN.

629
00:31:49,067 --> 00:31:50,767
DO YOU READ ME?

630
00:31:50,767 --> 00:31:51,933
I READ YOU.

631
00:31:51,933 --> 00:31:52,967
SIR.

632
00:31:52,967 --> 00:31:54,533
SUPERINTENDENT MIFSUD.

633
00:31:54,533 --> 00:31:55,600
I AM LITTLE.

634
00:31:55,600 --> 00:31:56,600
THANK YOU FOR YOUR
UNDERSTANDING.

635
00:31:56,600 --> 00:31:57,600
AND ONCE AGAIN,

636
00:31:57,600 --> 00:31:58,600
LET ME APOLOGIZE ON BEHALF

637
00:31:58,600 --> 00:31:59,600
OF THE UNITED STATES GOVERNMENT

638
00:31:59,600 --> 00:32:01,800
FOR THE ACTIONS
OF SHERIFF GERONIMO.

639
00:32:01,800 --> 00:32:03,933
APOLOGY ACCEPTED.

640
00:32:03,933 --> 00:32:05,233
THANK YOU.

641
00:32:05,233 --> 00:32:06,833
AND IF I CAN
BE OF ANY FURTHER ASSISTANCE,

642
00:32:06,833 --> 00:32:07,833
PLEASE LET ME KNOW.

643
00:32:07,833 --> 00:32:09,300
YES. I WILL.

644
00:32:09,300 --> 00:32:12,700
LET’S HOPE WE HAVE NO FURTHER
NEED FOR YOUR ASSISTANCE.

645
00:32:13,767 --> 00:32:14,967
GOOD BYE.

646
00:32:14,967 --> 00:32:17,300
HE LOOKS LIKE
RUE McCLANAHAN.

647
00:32:18,467 --> 00:32:20,467
WHERE’S MY GUN?

648
00:32:20,467 --> 00:32:21,467
YOUR WEAPON?

649
00:32:21,467 --> 00:32:22,600
YEAH.

650
00:32:22,600 --> 00:32:24,733
YOUR WEAPON IS STAYING
LOCKED IN MY DESK

651
00:32:24,733 --> 00:32:26,533
UNTIL YOU LEAVE
ON TOMORROW’S PLANE.

652
00:32:26,533 --> 00:32:27,633
UNDERSTAND?

653
00:32:27,633 --> 00:32:28,633
IT’S YOUR COUNTRY.

654
00:32:28,633 --> 00:32:30,133
PLEASE TRY AND REMEMBER THAT.

655
00:32:30,133 --> 00:32:32,267
REALLY, SIR. I MUST PROTEST.
GERONIMO DID NOTHING--

656
00:32:32,267 --> 00:32:33,533
IT’S ALL RIGHT, HONEY.

657
00:32:33,533 --> 00:32:34,967
SITUATION’S ALL BEEN SETTLED.

658
00:32:34,967 --> 00:32:36,567
HASN’T IT,
SUPERINTENDENT MIFSUD?

659
00:32:36,567 --> 00:32:39,133
LOOK, THANKS FOR SPEAKING UP
FOR ME IN THERE, HONEY.

660
00:32:39,133 --> 00:32:40,367
BUT IT REALLY
WASN’T NECESSARY.

661
00:32:40,367 --> 00:32:41,367
I DIDN’T DO IT FOR YOU.

662
00:32:41,367 --> 00:32:42,600
I DID IT ’CAUSE
IT WAS THE TRUTH

663
00:32:42,600 --> 00:32:44,067
AND IT’S MY JOB
TO TELL THE TRUTH.

664
00:32:44,067 --> 00:32:45,100
OH, GREAT.

665
00:32:45,100 --> 00:32:46,367
IS THAT WHAT YOU THINK
YOUR JOB IS?

666
00:32:46,367 --> 00:32:47,867
YEAH, WELL.
PARTLY.

667
00:32:47,867 --> 00:32:49,700
HELL, THE WAY I SEE IT,
IT’S THE LAW OFFICER’S JOB

668
00:32:49,700 --> 00:32:51,333
TO GET THE LAWBREAKERS
OFF THE STREET.

669
00:32:51,333 --> 00:32:52,667
MAKE THE STREETS SAFE
FOR THE GOOD PEOPLE.

670
00:32:52,667 --> 00:32:53,900
GET RID OF THE SCUM.

671
00:32:53,900 --> 00:32:55,000
WHAT ABOUT THE LAW?

672
00:32:55,000 --> 00:32:56,400
THE POLICE OFFICER
MUST OBEY THAT TOO.

673
00:32:56,400 --> 00:32:57,800
MORE GRAVY, PLEASE.

674
00:32:57,800 --> 00:32:58,933
SAY, PAL.

675
00:32:58,933 --> 00:32:59,933
YOU GOT ANY MAALOX?

676
00:32:59,933 --> 00:33:02,167
MAALOX? NO, SIR.

677
00:33:02,167 --> 00:33:04,067
THEN BRING ME A TALL GLASS
OF MILK, OKAY?

678
00:33:04,067 --> 00:33:05,067
GLASS OF MILK.
YES SIR.

679
00:33:05,067 --> 00:33:06,067
AND THE CHECK.

680
00:33:06,067 --> 00:33:07,633
OH, AND ANOTHER VEAL HEAD.

681
00:33:07,633 --> 00:33:08,700
ARE YOU OKAY?

682
00:33:08,700 --> 00:33:09,967
YEAH.

683
00:33:09,967 --> 00:33:11,400
LOOK, OFFICER CASSAR.

684
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:12,567
OFFICER. HOT.

685
00:33:12,567 --> 00:33:13,967
LET ME SET YOU STRAIGHT
ABOUT THE LAW.

686
00:33:13,967 --> 00:33:16,400
NOW, OF COURSE THE LAWMAN
MUST OBEY THE LAW.

687
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:17,400
[IMITATES BELCH]

688
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:18,567
BUT THE LAW MUST BE JUST.

689
00:33:18,567 --> 00:33:20,367
NOW, THERE’S LOTS
OF BAD PEOPLE OUT THERE

690
00:33:20,367 --> 00:33:22,067
USING THE LAW
FOR THEIR OWN THING.

691
00:33:22,067 --> 00:33:23,267
[BELCH]

692
00:33:23,267 --> 00:33:24,633
WELL, SOME OF US GOTTA
STAND UP FOR JUSTICE.

693
00:33:24,633 --> 00:33:26,400
SEEMS AWFUL SIMPLE TO ME.

694
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:27,400
IT IS.

695
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:28,433
UNTIL THE POLITICIANS,

696
00:33:28,433 --> 00:33:29,667
AND THE LAWYERS GET INVOLVED.

697
00:33:29,667 --> 00:33:30,667
YOU KNOW HOW THEY ARE.

698
00:33:30,667 --> 00:33:31,667
YOUR MILK, SIR.

699
00:33:31,667 --> 00:33:33,033
THANK YOU.
APPRECIATE IT.

700
00:33:33,033 --> 00:33:36,967
MM. BARIUM.
[GULPS]

701
00:33:36,967 --> 00:33:38,900
HIS ARTERIES ARE JUST
LOOKIN’ AT EACH OTHER

702
00:33:38,900 --> 00:33:40,833
SHAKIN’ THEIR HEADS.

703
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:44,833
ARE YOU SURE YOU’RE OKAY?

704
00:33:44,833 --> 00:33:46,267
YEAH. SURE.
I’M FINE.

705
00:33:46,267 --> 00:33:47,400
THANK YOU.
[BELCHES]

706
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:49,567
WELL.
WELL, I DID GET SHOT UP

707
00:33:49,567 --> 00:33:51,600
A FEW YEARS AGO IN DALLAS.

708
00:33:51,600 --> 00:33:53,133
SOMETIMES IT ACTS UP A BIT.

709
00:33:53,133 --> 00:33:55,200
MAYBE YOU’RE NOT USED
TO MALTESE FOOD.

710
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:56,300
NO, NO.
THE FOOD’S GOOD.

711
00:33:56,300 --> 00:33:57,333
THANK YOU.

712
00:33:57,333 --> 00:33:58,900
SURE IS A LOT OF IT TOO.

713
00:33:58,900 --> 00:34:00,533
FITS RIGHT IN WITH MY PLAN.

714
00:34:00,533 --> 00:34:02,700
AH, THANK YA. HOW MUCH IS IT
IN AMERICAN MONEY?

715
00:34:02,700 --> 00:34:05,467
- ON THE MALTA
POLICE DEPARTMENT.
- OH, WELL,

716
00:34:05,467 --> 00:34:07,633
- THANK YOU, LITTLE LADY.
- YOU’RE WELCOME, HUGE MAN.

717
00:34:07,633 --> 00:34:10,767
NICE. MOMMA TAUGHT ME
NEVER TO PASS UP A FREE MEAL.

718
00:34:10,767 --> 00:34:11,933
AS YOU CAN TELL.

719
00:34:11,933 --> 00:34:13,233
AH.

720
00:34:13,233 --> 00:34:15,467
BOY, UP WITH PEOPLE
HAVE SURE CHANGED.

721
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:19,867
I DID THAT
BEFORE I HAD KIDS.

722
00:34:19,867 --> 00:34:22,333
[LAUGHS]

723
00:34:22,333 --> 00:34:25,100
BROUGHT TO YOU
BY THE TRIANGLE FOUNDATION.

724
00:34:28,533 --> 00:34:30,567
WHAT ARE THEY?
COWBOYS? PIRATES?

725
00:34:30,567 --> 00:34:32,933
HARDWARE STORE CLERKS?

726
00:34:32,933 --> 00:34:35,300
EW, VALERIE.
ONE OF THE GUPPIES IS DEAD.

727
00:34:39,500 --> 00:34:40,800
WHAT CAN I GET YOU?

728
00:34:40,800 --> 00:34:41,967
...ON THE ROCKS.

729
00:34:41,967 --> 00:34:44,233
WE DON’T HAVE MIXED DRINKS.

730
00:34:44,233 --> 00:34:46,667
BEER, WINE,
OR STRAIGHT LIQUOR ONLY.

731
00:34:46,667 --> 00:34:47,667
WOULD YOU BELIEVE THAT?

732
00:34:47,667 --> 00:34:48,667
DO YOU HAVE SPRITE?

733
00:34:48,667 --> 00:34:50,100
STRAIGHT BOURBON.
OKAY?

734
00:34:50,100 --> 00:34:51,267
STRAIGHT.

735
00:34:51,267 --> 00:34:54,100
REALLY HAD HIS HEART SET
ON A RAMOS GIN FIZZ.

736
00:34:56,600 --> 00:34:58,633
THE INDIGO GIRLS’
EARLY DAYS.

737
00:35:00,167 --> 00:35:02,333
DON LAMANNA.
I’M HONORED.

738
00:35:02,333 --> 00:35:03,733
WHAT CAN I GET YOU?

739
00:35:03,733 --> 00:35:05,033
NOTHING. THANK YOU.

740
00:35:05,033 --> 00:35:06,233
THERE’S STILL
A MILLION LIRA COVER.

741
00:35:06,233 --> 00:35:08,267
I’D LIKE TO SEE YOU
IN PRIVATE.

742
00:35:09,700 --> 00:35:11,767
GET THE WORD TO THAT COWBOY
THAT I’M AT THIS BAR.

743
00:35:11,767 --> 00:35:12,767
WE’LL BE WAITING FOR HIM.

744
00:35:12,767 --> 00:35:13,767
OKAY.

745
00:35:13,767 --> 00:35:15,667
WHADDA WHEEDA WHOPPO.

746
00:35:15,667 --> 00:35:17,000
HEY, CAN YOU COME
IN THE DRESSING ROOM?

747
00:35:17,000 --> 00:35:20,333
TELL ME HOW
THESE PANTS FIT?

748
00:35:20,333 --> 00:35:22,467
YOU GONNA HELP ME
FIND PALERMO, OR WHAT?

749
00:35:22,467 --> 00:35:25,267
MY INSTRUCTIONS ARE
TO SHOW YOU AROUND OUR ISLAND.

750
00:35:25,267 --> 00:35:26,500
WELL, I’M NOT HERE
AS A DAMN TOURIST.

751
00:35:26,500 --> 00:35:27,500
I’M HERE TO GET PALERMO.

752
00:35:27,500 --> 00:35:28,933
HOO-HOO.
[KISSES]

753
00:35:28,933 --> 00:35:30,267
WHERE THEY KEEP THE BROADS?

754
00:35:30,267 --> 00:35:31,600
HOW DO YOU MEAN?

755
00:35:31,600 --> 00:35:33,767
HOOKERS, HUSTLERS,
PROSTITUTES.

756
00:35:33,767 --> 00:35:35,200
I HEARD THAT.

757
00:35:35,200 --> 00:35:36,867
WELL, YEARS AGO, WHEN SAILORS
USED TO COME TO OUR ISLAND,

758
00:35:36,867 --> 00:35:38,567
THERE WAS A PLACE CALLED
"THE GUT," BUT, UH--

759
00:35:38,567 --> 00:35:40,167
THAT’LL BE IT.
WHICH WAY IS IT?

760
00:35:40,167 --> 00:35:41,833
WE DON’T ACCEPT COUPONS.

761
00:35:43,200 --> 00:35:45,833
I’M GONNA PUT ON HOT PANTS
AND GO UNDER COVER.

762
00:35:45,833 --> 00:35:47,200
YOU WANT A PIG LIKE PALERMO?

763
00:35:47,200 --> 00:35:49,100
YOU GO TO THE PIGSTY
WHERE HE WALLOWS.

764
00:35:49,100 --> 00:35:50,467
WELL, YOU’D KNOW PIGS.

765
00:35:50,467 --> 00:35:52,333
[LAUGHS]

766
00:35:55,733 --> 00:35:59,000
- HOW’S IT HANGIN’, KID?
- IT IS BUFORD PUSS.

767
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:01,033
- EXCUSE ME.
- NOT FOR ANY PRICE.

768
00:36:01,033 --> 00:36:02,233
I HATE TO INTERRUPT
YOUR BUSINESS,

769
00:36:02,233 --> 00:36:03,700
BUT I’M LOOKING
FOR THIS ITALIAN GUY

770
00:36:03,700 --> 00:36:04,867
NAMED JOE PALERMO.

771
00:36:04,867 --> 00:36:06,433
HE’S ABOUT SIX FEET TALL,
180 POUNDS,

772
00:36:06,433 --> 00:36:07,433
REAL SHARP DRESSER.

773
00:36:07,433 --> 00:36:09,033
I WONDER IF YOU
COULD HELP ME FIND HIM?

774
00:36:09,033 --> 00:36:10,100
FOR A WERTHER’S.

775
00:36:10,100 --> 00:36:11,100
OH.

776
00:36:11,100 --> 00:36:12,567
TAKE AMERICAN MONEY?

777
00:36:12,567 --> 00:36:13,933
YEAH. ALL CURRENCIES.

778
00:36:13,933 --> 00:36:15,333
NOW, LOOK.
I’M ON AN EXPENSE ACCOUNT,

779
00:36:15,333 --> 00:36:17,467
SO 20 BUCKS IS GONNA
HAVE TO DO, HUH?

780
00:36:17,467 --> 00:36:19,900
WELL, YOU’LL FIND HIM
IN SMUGGLER’S TAVERN.

781
00:36:19,900 --> 00:36:22,333
IT’S TWO BLOCKS UP FROM HERE.

782
00:36:22,333 --> 00:36:24,233
AND THEN GO LEFT AGAIN.

783
00:36:24,233 --> 00:36:25,233
AND YOU KNOW THIS PLACE?

784
00:36:25,233 --> 00:36:26,300
ALL RIGHT.
THANK YOU, HONEY.

785
00:36:26,300 --> 00:36:27,467
HEY, YOU BETTER NOT
BE LYIN’ TO ME.

786
00:36:28,533 --> 00:36:29,633
NO.

787
00:36:29,633 --> 00:36:31,033
GOOD LUCK.
PEDDLE LOTS OF SEX.

788
00:36:34,667 --> 00:36:36,300
WHY AM I NOT GETTING
ANY BUSINESS?

789
00:36:36,300 --> 00:36:37,400
WHAT AM I DOING WRONG?

790
00:36:37,400 --> 00:36:38,633
[LAUGHS]

791
00:36:41,033 --> 00:36:42,733
THANKS, CHER.
RHEA PERLMAN.

792
00:36:45,233 --> 00:36:48,600
HE’S HANGING AROUND LOOKING
FOR SOME BLACK MARKET PROPECIA.

793
00:36:52,267 --> 00:36:53,933
HEY, CROW.
YOU’VE GOT A GOLDEN ASH.

794
00:36:53,933 --> 00:36:55,200
SHUT UP.

795
00:36:55,200 --> 00:36:56,367
[LAUGHS]

796
00:36:56,367 --> 00:37:00,033
BOY. THEY REALLY SPELLED
"SONY" WRONG.

797
00:37:00,033 --> 00:37:03,000
HE’S GUARDING
MALTA’S ONLY PLANT.

798
00:37:08,333 --> 00:37:10,733
WELL, SEE, WITH YOUR BEEF RIBS
YOU GET A LITTLE MORE MEAT.

799
00:37:10,733 --> 00:37:13,833
WHEREAS YOUR PORK RIBS OFFER
A HIGHER FAT CONTENT.

800
00:37:16,867 --> 00:37:20,600
CHEAP CRAP.
GET YOUR CHEAP CRAP HERE.

801
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:23,133
JOHN RHYS-DAVIES FOR SALE.

802
00:37:27,467 --> 00:37:29,467
ENJOY MY FUZZY,
PUCKERED MID DRIFT.

803
00:37:29,467 --> 00:37:30,467
MINE TOO.

804
00:37:30,467 --> 00:37:31,833
MINE TOO.

805
00:37:36,433 --> 00:37:38,533
OH, MY TUMMY HURTS.

806
00:37:38,533 --> 00:37:40,467
OH.

807
00:37:41,700 --> 00:37:44,667
SEE YOU IN YOUR NIGHTMARES.
[LAUGHS]

808
00:37:44,667 --> 00:37:45,667
WHAT’S THE MATTER?

809
00:37:45,667 --> 00:37:46,800
WE’RE BEING SET UP.

810
00:37:46,800 --> 00:37:48,167
THERE’S A GUY
ON A BALCONY UP THERE.

811
00:37:48,167 --> 00:37:49,767
IT’S AN AMBUSH.

812
00:37:49,767 --> 00:37:51,000
THERE’S TWO MORE.

813
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:52,233
PALERMO’S MEN.

814
00:37:52,233 --> 00:37:53,500
I WILL SELL NO WINE.

815
00:37:53,500 --> 00:37:54,833
YOU WATCH MY BACK.

816
00:37:54,833 --> 00:37:56,533
WATCH IT JIGGLE AS I MOVE.

817
00:37:56,533 --> 00:37:58,433
AAH!

818
00:37:58,433 --> 00:37:59,500
YAH!

819
00:37:59,500 --> 00:38:01,200
MY FIRST FAT LAYER.

820
00:38:01,200 --> 00:38:02,600
[LAUGHS]

821
00:38:05,100 --> 00:38:07,000
I’M ALLERGIC
TO VERMICULITE.

822
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:10,433
MY OPERATION GAME.

823
00:38:13,433 --> 00:38:14,433
[LAUGHS]

824
00:38:14,433 --> 00:38:15,567
THE SPINNERS
ARE GETTING AWAY.

825
00:38:16,867 --> 00:38:18,667
WATCH OUT!

826
00:38:20,433 --> 00:38:22,567
OH.
NOW, WHAT WAS THAT FOR?

827
00:38:23,933 --> 00:38:25,167
I’M TELLING THE MOB.

828
00:38:25,167 --> 00:38:27,200
MOB, HE’S SHOOTING AT ME.

829
00:38:28,567 --> 00:38:31,200
REMIND ME TO BUY
SOMETHING CUTE FOR MR. WILSON.

830
00:38:37,467 --> 00:38:40,133
STOP, OR WE’LL SURRENDER.

831
00:38:40,133 --> 00:38:42,200
HOLD IT RIGHT THERE, SHERIFF.

832
00:38:42,200 --> 00:38:43,300
MARIA!

833
00:38:43,300 --> 00:38:44,500
MARIA!

834
00:38:44,500 --> 00:38:47,200
DO YOU REALIZE
YOU’RE WITH JOE DON BAKER?

835
00:38:47,200 --> 00:38:50,333
I WANT EVERY POLICE OFFICER
IN MALTA TO GET THIS ORDER--

836
00:38:50,333 --> 00:38:52,567
ARREST SHERIFF GERONIMO
ON SIGHT.

837
00:38:52,567 --> 00:38:54,400
HE’S ARMED AND DANGEROUS.

838
00:38:54,400 --> 00:38:56,200
USE WHAT PRECAUTION
IS NECESSARY.

839
00:38:56,200 --> 00:38:57,467
YES, SIR.

840
00:38:58,567 --> 00:39:01,333
THE STREETS
OF SAN FRAN--MALTA.

841
00:39:03,967 --> 00:39:05,400
NANU NANU.

842
00:39:07,667 --> 00:39:09,667
OOH, HIS WEIGHT IS FORCING HIM
DOWN THE STAIRS.

843
00:39:14,833 --> 00:39:17,367
OH, IT WAS THE GUN’S FAULT.

844
00:39:19,633 --> 00:39:21,700
MEAT LOAF--TEXAS RANGER.

845
00:39:21,700 --> 00:39:24,800
♪ WELL I REMEMBER
EVERY LITTLE THING ♪

846
00:39:31,467 --> 00:39:34,733
♪ GOOSIO GOOSIO GOOSIO ♪

847
00:39:34,733 --> 00:39:37,467
♪ DID YOU KNOW I’M GOOSIO ♪

848
00:39:37,467 --> 00:39:39,633
♪ FRIEND TO MALTESE CHILDREN
EVERYWHERE ♪

849
00:39:39,633 --> 00:39:40,667
♪ EE OH ♪

850
00:39:40,667 --> 00:39:43,200
♪ GOOSIO GOOSIO GOOSIO ♪

851
00:39:43,200 --> 00:39:44,200
HMM.

852
00:39:44,200 --> 00:39:45,600
♪ I BET YOU KNEW-SIO ♪

853
00:39:45,600 --> 00:39:46,700
OH. I GET IT.

854
00:39:46,700 --> 00:39:48,500
HE’S GOOSIO.

855
00:39:48,500 --> 00:39:49,500
HMM.

856
00:39:49,500 --> 00:39:50,500
ADORABLE.

857
00:39:50,500 --> 00:39:51,700
YEAH.

858
00:39:51,700 --> 00:39:54,733
FRIEND TO MALTESE CHILDREN
EVERYWHERE, EE OH.

859
00:39:54,733 --> 00:39:57,067
YEP.
GOOSIO.

860
00:39:57,067 --> 00:39:58,067
LIKE IN THE MOVIE.

861
00:39:58,067 --> 00:39:59,400
YUP, YUP, YUP, YUP.

862
00:39:59,400 --> 00:40:00,600
THIS MUST BE THE OFFAL

863
00:40:00,600 --> 00:40:02,233
OF THE SICK
AND PERVERTED MIND

864
00:40:02,233 --> 00:40:04,000
OF MIKE NELSON.

865
00:40:04,000 --> 00:40:05,067
YUP, YUP, YUP. MM-HMM.

866
00:40:05,067 --> 00:40:06,933
♪ GOOSIO ♪
[LAUGHS]

867
00:40:06,933 --> 00:40:08,533
GOD. I HATE CUTE.

868
00:40:08,533 --> 00:40:10,067
WELL, CROW.
ONLY ONE THING TO DO.

869
00:40:10,067 --> 00:40:11,067
YUP.

870
00:40:11,067 --> 00:40:12,067
GET HIM!

871
00:40:12,067 --> 00:40:15,500
WHY YOU HURT GOOSIO?

872
00:40:15,500 --> 00:40:17,700
...MAKE SOME PATE OUTTA YOU.

873
00:40:17,700 --> 00:40:18,700
THERE YA GO.

874
00:40:18,700 --> 00:40:20,967
FOIE GRAS NOW, BUDDY.

875
00:40:20,967 --> 00:40:22,967
[LAUGHTER]

876
00:40:22,967 --> 00:40:25,900
[GROANS]

877
00:40:25,900 --> 00:40:27,433
OOH. LOOK AT ’EM GO.

878
00:40:27,433 --> 00:40:28,633
HEY, GUYS. WHAT’S GO--

879
00:40:28,633 --> 00:40:29,633
WHAT HAPPENED?

880
00:40:29,633 --> 00:40:30,733
AAH!

881
00:40:30,733 --> 00:40:31,900
OH, COME ON, NELSON.

882
00:40:31,900 --> 00:40:33,300
IT’S YOUR ANNOYING GOB
OF PAPER MACHE

883
00:40:33,300 --> 00:40:35,600
WHICH YOU SO INGRATIATINGLY
CALLED "GOOSIO."

884
00:40:35,600 --> 00:40:37,467
NO, THI--THIS IS GOOSIO.

885
00:40:37,467 --> 00:40:40,600
TH-THE BELOVED FOLK HERO
AND TV STAR OF MALTA.

886
00:40:40,600 --> 00:40:41,833
UH.

887
00:40:41,833 --> 00:40:43,833
GOOSIO WAS SENT UP HERE
AS A GOOD WILL AMBASSADOR.

888
00:40:43,833 --> 00:40:46,033
HE--HE TEACHES CHILDREN
LESSONS ABOUT LOVE

889
00:40:46,033 --> 00:40:48,733
AND SHARING
AND HYGIENE AND--

890
00:40:48,733 --> 00:40:50,367
AND YOU KILLED HIM.

891
00:40:50,367 --> 00:40:51,733
- UH-OH.
- WOW.

892
00:40:51,733 --> 00:40:53,633
- SORRY, MIKE.
- YEAH, AND, UH,

893
00:40:53,633 --> 00:40:55,300
SORRY, MALTA.

894
00:40:55,300 --> 00:40:56,867
I MEAN, WE TRY TO DESTROY

895
00:40:56,867 --> 00:40:59,433
ONLY THINGS THAT ARE
SPECIFICALLY YOURS.

896
00:40:59,433 --> 00:41:01,233
- [ALARM BLARES]
- MOVIE SIGN.

897
00:41:01,233 --> 00:41:03,300
SORRY, GOOSIO.

898
00:41:17,133 --> 00:41:19,200
JUST DON’T TELL MALTA, OKAY?

899
00:41:19,200 --> 00:41:23,033
POOR GOOSIO.

900
00:41:23,033 --> 00:41:26,067
UGH, GOTTA GET TO MY SHIFT
AS ALTAR BOY.

901
00:41:28,967 --> 00:41:30,267
THAT’S A CHURCH!

902
00:41:30,267 --> 00:41:31,700
[CROW AS JERRY LEWIS]
WA-HEY-HEE!

903
00:41:31,700 --> 00:41:33,167
- FORGET GOOSIO.
- THANKS A LOT.

904
00:41:33,167 --> 00:41:34,633
NOW I GOT ONE SHOT LEFT.

905
00:41:34,633 --> 00:41:37,400
WOMAN COPS.

906
00:41:37,400 --> 00:41:39,967
HEY, CHECK IT OUT.
LOOKS LIKE GOD’S

907
00:41:39,967 --> 00:41:43,467
- DOING ALL RIGHT
FOR HIMSELF.
- YEAH.

908
00:41:43,467 --> 00:41:44,733
DEARLY BELOVED,
WE ARE GATHERED HERE

909
00:41:44,733 --> 00:41:47,167
- TO GET THROUGH
THIS THING CALLED LIFE.
- LIFE.

910
00:41:47,167 --> 00:41:50,433
[SERVO MIMICS DRUMS]

911
00:41:50,433 --> 00:41:54,100
OH, GREAT.
THERE’S ANNOUNCEMENTS.

912
00:41:54,100 --> 00:41:56,867
OUR NEW ARCHBISHOP’S CUTE.

913
00:42:00,433 --> 00:42:01,967
I HEAR THE HOSTS
ARE DELICIOUS HERE.

914
00:42:01,967 --> 00:42:03,433
DO YOU SEE HIM?

915
00:42:03,433 --> 00:42:04,600
NO, I DON’T KNOW
WHERE HE WENT.

916
00:42:04,600 --> 00:42:07,500
UH-OH. HE ASCENDED
INTO HEAVEN.

917
00:42:10,333 --> 00:42:11,533
TAKE A LOOK AROUND.

918
00:42:11,533 --> 00:42:14,800
UH, YOU KNOW. GO AHEAD ON.

919
00:42:14,800 --> 00:42:16,433
YOU KNOW,
THE PROBLEM WITH CHURCH

920
00:42:16,433 --> 00:42:18,833
IS THAT THEY WEAR THEIR RELIGION
ON THEIR SLEEVES.

921
00:42:18,833 --> 00:42:20,633
I MEAN, I GO INTO A CHURCH.
I DON’T WANNA BE

922
00:42:20,633 --> 00:42:26,900
ASSAULTED WITH
GOD-GOD-GOD ALL THE TIME.

923
00:42:26,900 --> 00:42:32,400
GOTTA BUNDLE UP
BEFORE I WHACK THAT GUY.

924
00:42:32,400 --> 00:42:35,633
LORD, PLEASE MAKE MY HAIR
A TANGLED GRAY MASS.

925
00:42:35,633 --> 00:42:38,667
THANK YOU.

926
00:42:38,667 --> 00:42:40,000
I’M JUST GOING TO READ FROM

927
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:42,267
THE ROBERT JAMES
WALLER BOOK TODAY.

928
00:42:45,867 --> 00:42:48,933
YOUR HOMILY WAS DIRECTED AT ME
LAST WEEK, WASN’T IT?

929
00:42:50,067 --> 00:42:51,967
OH. HI, MA.

930
00:42:55,367 --> 00:42:57,567
UH, DOMINOS PIZZA DELIVERS.

931
00:42:57,567 --> 00:43:00,333
I DON’T KNOW.

932
00:43:00,333 --> 00:43:04,133
PLEASE LET ME KILL
A LOT OF PEOPLE.

933
00:43:04,133 --> 00:43:06,967
WOW. APPARENTLY
THE MALTA VIKINGS
ARE PLAYING TODAY.

934
00:43:06,967 --> 00:43:08,200
EVERYBODY’S
GOING OUT TO THOSE

935
00:43:08,200 --> 00:43:11,367
BIG MEGA-CATHEDRALS
IN THE SUBURBS NOW.

936
00:43:11,367 --> 00:43:13,233
FATHER. FATHER.

937
00:43:13,233 --> 00:43:14,867
FATHER. I WANT TO CONFESS.

938
00:43:14,867 --> 00:43:16,800
- I CAN’T.
- BUT, PLEASE, FATHER.

939
00:43:16,800 --> 00:43:18,800
- I WANT TO CONFESS.
- NO, PLEASE.

940
00:43:18,800 --> 00:43:20,967
GOD IS DEAD. WE’RE CLOSED.

941
00:43:23,267 --> 00:43:25,567
I OVERCOOKED MY BRACIOLES.

942
00:43:25,567 --> 00:43:27,400
OKAY, FATHER.
I AM AFRAID OF--

943
00:43:27,400 --> 00:43:29,200
YES, YES, DON’T WORRY.
DON’T WORRY.

944
00:43:29,200 --> 00:43:31,867
EUNICE PLOROSSO CONFESSES.

945
00:43:31,867 --> 00:43:33,933
YES. DON’T WORRY.
ANYTHING YOU WANT.

946
00:43:33,933 --> 00:43:36,667
ANYTHING YOU SAY.
ANYTHING YOU SAY.

947
00:43:36,667 --> 00:43:38,200
ANYTHING YOU SAY?

948
00:43:38,200 --> 00:43:40,400
FATHER... BUT--

949
00:43:40,400 --> 00:43:44,267
DON’T WORRY, SISTER.
PLEASE, PLEASE JUST RELAX.

950
00:43:44,267 --> 00:43:45,600
I’M GONNA LIGHT A CANDLE

951
00:43:45,600 --> 00:43:48,967
TO SAINT TOM LANDRY.

952
00:43:48,967 --> 00:43:52,467
AND THEN I SHOT HIM
30 TIMES.

953
00:43:55,033 --> 00:43:58,133
WE GOTTA LOOK BEHIND
THESE SIDE DOORS.

954
00:43:58,133 --> 00:43:59,433
WE NEED A PRIEST?
THEY LOCKED OR WHAT?

955
00:43:59,433 --> 00:44:01,500
NO, THEY WON’T BE LOCKED.

956
00:44:01,500 --> 00:44:03,733
LOOK, JUST STOP SINNING,
ALL RIGHT?

957
00:44:03,733 --> 00:44:05,733
FATHER, I REMEMBER
SOMETHING.

958
00:44:05,733 --> 00:44:09,033
I HAVE MORE SINS TO CONFESS.

959
00:44:09,033 --> 00:44:11,400
HOLD IT THERE, PAL.

960
00:44:11,400 --> 00:44:14,000
WAIT A MINUTE!

961
00:44:14,000 --> 00:44:15,733
GUESS HE’S A FELONIOUS MONK.

962
00:44:15,733 --> 00:44:18,400
OH, MAN.

963
00:44:18,400 --> 00:44:19,967
PLEASE HAVE HOSTS
AT WALGREENS!

964
00:44:19,967 --> 00:44:23,533
PLEASE HAVE HOSTS
AT WALGREENS, PLEASE!

965
00:44:23,533 --> 00:44:25,100
♪ HE’S A BEEFTOWN CHUNK ♪

966
00:44:25,100 --> 00:44:27,233
♪ ON A SATURDAY NIGHT ♪

967
00:44:27,233 --> 00:44:30,100
[CROW HUMS]

968
00:44:32,333 --> 00:44:35,367
BILL’S HARBOR.

969
00:44:35,367 --> 00:44:37,500
HEY, AND THERE’S
THE MALTA NAVY.

970
00:44:37,500 --> 00:44:39,967
THAT’S IT. ALL OF IT.

971
00:44:42,267 --> 00:44:44,067
♪ HELLO, MAJOR TOM ♪

972
00:44:44,067 --> 00:44:45,467
♪ HELLO THERE, MAJOR TOM ♪

973
00:44:45,467 --> 00:44:48,733
♪ HOW’S IT GOING, TOM? ♪

974
00:44:48,733 --> 00:44:55,400
OH, I HATE RUNNING
IN LONG DRESS AND HEELS.

975
00:44:55,400 --> 00:44:57,733
I’M GONNA NAIL SOME THESES
TO HIS HEAD.

976
00:44:59,500 --> 00:45:01,833
IT’S SO SAD.
THE OPERATION PETTICOAT SET

977
00:45:01,833 --> 00:45:05,167
SITTING OUT THERE RUSTING.

978
00:45:05,167 --> 00:45:07,600
YOU’LL HAVE TO GREASE ME
AND PUSH ME THROUGH HERE.

979
00:45:12,767 --> 00:45:16,500
GOOD PROPS IN THIS MOVIE.

980
00:45:16,500 --> 00:45:17,833
I HAD TO CHASE A MONK ONCE.

981
00:45:17,833 --> 00:45:19,967
SOLD ME MOLDY BREAD,
THE SON OF A...

982
00:45:19,967 --> 00:45:21,300
AH, LOOK.
I’M OUT OF BULLETS.

983
00:45:21,300 --> 00:45:24,967
I’M GONNA RUN
A BLUFF ON HIM.

984
00:45:24,967 --> 00:45:28,600
GOD? GOD?
THERE’S A GUY CHASING ME.

985
00:45:30,767 --> 00:45:33,300
A FRANCISCAN 10K RACE!

986
00:45:33,300 --> 00:45:34,867
YEAH, THE WINNER
GETS TO RELINQUISH

987
00:45:34,867 --> 00:45:38,700
MORE OF HIS WORLDLY GOODS.

988
00:45:38,700 --> 00:45:47,367
LOOK, THEY’RE GOING BY
A HOUSE OF BLUES.

989
00:45:47,367 --> 00:45:49,100
YOU SON OF A--

990
00:45:49,100 --> 00:45:51,100
YOU’RE THE SON OF A--

991
00:45:54,733 --> 00:45:56,600
♪ WAKA-CHIKA WAKA-CHIKA ♪

992
00:45:56,600 --> 00:45:59,033
YES, EVERY EXCITING
ANGSTROM OF THEIR CHASE

993
00:45:59,033 --> 00:46:03,033
WILL BE SHOWN.

994
00:46:03,033 --> 00:46:05,533
[SERVO MIMICS ELECTRIC GUITAR]

995
00:46:07,767 --> 00:46:11,200
THIS IS PAPAL BULL, MAN.

996
00:46:11,200 --> 00:46:13,800
[SERVO MIMICS ELECTRIC GUITAR]

997
00:46:13,800 --> 00:46:17,100
UGH. I GOTTA QUIT PUTTING OFF
THAT BYPASS SURGERY.

998
00:46:20,167 --> 00:46:21,500
WAIT-- HOLD ON!

999
00:46:21,500 --> 00:46:23,333
WHY? WE’RE BOTH
OUT OF BULLETS.

1000
00:46:23,333 --> 00:46:25,233
I’M GONNA LOOK UP HIS DRESS.

1001
00:46:29,633 --> 00:46:30,967
YES, ASSES.

1002
00:46:30,967 --> 00:46:32,567
SPLASHED ACROSS THE SCREEN.

1003
00:46:32,567 --> 00:46:35,300
THANK YOU.

1004
00:46:35,300 --> 00:46:36,633
I’M SCARED OF HEIGHTS

1005
00:46:36,633 --> 00:46:39,767
WHERE THERE’S NO FOOD.

1006
00:46:39,767 --> 00:46:41,600
MARIA. DO YOU SEE HIM?

1007
00:46:41,600 --> 00:46:44,267
NO, I DON’T KNOW
WHERE HE IS.

1008
00:46:44,267 --> 00:46:47,200
- WELL, KEEP LOOKING.
- I’M GONNA LAY DOWN
FOR A WHILE.

1009
00:46:51,233 --> 00:46:52,567
OH, HE WAS DOWN JIGGING

1010
00:46:52,567 --> 00:46:54,800
WITH THE LOSERS IN STEERAGE.

1011
00:47:00,133 --> 00:47:01,667
OOH, RIGHT IN THE LUNCH.

1012
00:47:01,667 --> 00:47:03,933
LIKE PUNCHING A BAG
OF IRISH OATMEAL.

1013
00:47:08,733 --> 00:47:11,933
HE’S BATTLING
THE GHOST OF CHRISTMAS FUTURE.

1014
00:47:11,933 --> 00:47:14,633
YOU SCREWED ME ON THE ROYALTIES
TO THAT CHANT ALBUM!

1015
00:47:20,533 --> 00:47:23,000
I’LL FLAGELLATE MYSELF,
THANK YOU.

1016
00:47:24,733 --> 00:47:27,633
OH, THANK YOU FOR SAVING ME,
TINY WOMAN.

1017
00:47:31,833 --> 00:47:36,333
DAMN IT, I FORGOT
ABOUT VESPERS.

1018
00:47:36,333 --> 00:47:39,400
I’M GONNA GO
CUT SOME MONK FISH.

1019
00:47:39,400 --> 00:47:42,833
[SERVO HUMS]

1020
00:47:42,833 --> 00:47:44,867
OH, I REMEMBER
THIS EPISODE OF SUPERMONK.

1021
00:47:44,867 --> 00:47:46,667
SUPERMONK WENT BAD
FOR A WHILE,

1022
00:47:46,667 --> 00:47:51,100
- BUT THEN HE GOT BETTER.
- YEAH.

1023
00:47:51,100 --> 00:47:52,433
DAMN BOAT LOAD LIMITS.

1024
00:47:52,433 --> 00:47:56,233
I’M ALWAYS EXCEEDING ’EM.

1025
00:47:56,233 --> 00:47:59,067
I’M TAKING ON WATER!
OH, THAT’S JUST ME SWEATING.

1026
00:48:03,133 --> 00:48:05,833
JUST A BUNCH OF ARMED NUNS
ON JET SKIS OUT THERE.

1027
00:48:05,833 --> 00:48:07,700
WAITING FOR HIM.

1028
00:48:11,233 --> 00:48:13,867
OW OW OW-OW-OW-OW-OW-OW.

1029
00:48:13,867 --> 00:48:16,333
OW-OW-OW-OW-OW-OW-OW-OW-OW.

1030
00:48:16,333 --> 00:48:18,667
MY ROBE DOES
WICK AWAY MOISTURE.

1031
00:48:21,700 --> 00:48:24,067
HE’S LEAVING
A FRANGELICO SLICK.

1032
00:48:24,067 --> 00:48:26,767
[PALERMO CHUCKLES]

1033
00:48:26,767 --> 00:48:28,733
♪ WAKA-CHIKA WAKA-CHIKA... ♪

1034
00:48:28,733 --> 00:48:31,700
HI, CITY OF THE INCAS.

1035
00:48:34,800 --> 00:48:36,733
OW-OW-OW-OW...

1036
00:48:41,000 --> 00:48:43,133
OW-OW-OW-OW...

1037
00:48:46,400 --> 00:48:49,233
THERE’S THOMAS MERTON
PILOTING THIS BUDWEISER!

1038
00:48:49,233 --> 00:48:52,100
[CROW MIMICS CROWD]

1039
00:48:52,100 --> 00:48:54,233
THIS WAS ALL TO GET
A SHOT OF THE PACNORSE.

1040
00:48:54,233 --> 00:48:56,300
YEAH.

1041
00:48:56,300 --> 00:48:58,933
WOW, THIS MOVIE’S
REALLY DRAWING ME IN...

1042
00:48:58,933 --> 00:49:02,100
TO A DEEP WELL OF DESPAIR.

1043
00:49:02,100 --> 00:49:05,200
♪ WAKA-CHIKA WAKA-CHIKA ♪

1044
00:49:05,200 --> 00:49:06,667
AH, MAN.

1045
00:49:06,667 --> 00:49:09,933
THIS ISN’T GONNA END UNTIL
THEY ROUND CAPE HORN, IS IT?

1046
00:49:11,533 --> 00:49:14,033
[SERVO MIMICS ELECTRIC GUITAR]

1047
00:49:14,033 --> 00:49:16,500
OH, WERE YOU LOOKING FOR ME?

1048
00:49:19,667 --> 00:49:21,533
WHY DON’T MEN WANNA
JOIN THE PRIESTHOOD ANYMORE?

1049
00:49:21,533 --> 00:49:22,867
IT LOOKS LIKE A BLAST.

1050
00:49:22,867 --> 00:49:26,200
YEAH.

1051
00:49:26,200 --> 00:49:28,033
DANGEROUS FOR JOE DON
TO BE IN THE WATER.

1052
00:49:28,033 --> 00:49:31,900
SOMEONE’S
BOUND TO HARPOON HIM.

1053
00:49:31,900 --> 00:49:34,267
UGH, BIG GAS BUBBLE.

1054
00:49:37,700 --> 00:49:39,700
EH, THE HOLY SEA
PROMISED AIR SUPPORT

1055
00:49:39,700 --> 00:49:41,667
BUT NEVER CAME THROUGH.

1056
00:49:45,300 --> 00:49:47,700
THIS IS HOW THE CRUSADES
WERE FOUGHT TOO, RIGHT?

1057
00:49:47,700 --> 00:49:52,300
YEAH.

1058
00:49:52,300 --> 00:49:54,633
TE DEUM!

1059
00:49:56,833 --> 00:49:58,500
YOU KNOW, AT ANY TIME,
JOE DON COULD

1060
00:49:58,500 --> 00:50:00,167
LAY DOWN A TORPEDO.
I KNOW THAT.

1061
00:50:00,167 --> 00:50:03,067
[BOTS LAUGH]

1062
00:50:03,067 --> 00:50:04,800
AH, YES. AND NOW,

1063
00:50:04,800 --> 00:50:06,733
BACK TO THE BEGINNING
OF THE CHASE.

1064
00:50:06,733 --> 00:50:09,300
HEY.

1065
00:50:09,300 --> 00:50:12,267
[CROW SIGHS]
WHERE’S THE PERFECT STORM
WHEN YOU NEED IT?

1066
00:50:12,267 --> 00:50:14,400
INDEED.

1067
00:50:16,633 --> 00:50:19,467
WOW, IF THAT’S NOT
A SEXUAL METAPHOR.

1068
00:50:19,467 --> 00:50:22,967
[SERVO CHUCKLES]

1069
00:50:22,967 --> 00:50:25,200
IT’S ILLEGAL TO NET MONKS.

1070
00:50:27,500 --> 00:50:29,633
YOU KNOW, NETS ARE
OVERRATED WEAPONS.

1071
00:50:29,633 --> 00:50:31,400
YEAH, THROW A DANISH AT HIM.

1072
00:50:31,400 --> 00:50:33,200
THAT WOULD WORK BETTER.

1073
00:50:35,467 --> 00:50:37,833
[SERVO LAUGHS]
YES, AND AFTER ALL THAT,

1074
00:50:37,833 --> 00:50:40,567
OUR HERO IS DOWN
WITH ONE PUNCH.

1075
00:50:43,133 --> 00:50:44,800
NICE TRY, JOE DON.

1076
00:50:44,800 --> 00:50:47,867
I’M OFF TO MAKE
XEROX COMMERCIALS.

1077
00:50:47,867 --> 00:50:51,267
[SERVO HUMS WITH SCORE]

1078
00:50:51,267 --> 00:50:54,633
[BOTS HUM]

1079
00:50:54,633 --> 00:50:57,133
DON’T MOVE!

1080
00:50:57,133 --> 00:50:59,467
- YOU HAVE FAILED.
- NO! NO, NOT YET.

1081
00:50:59,467 --> 00:51:00,733
I’LL GET THIS [MUTED],
I SWEAR.

1082
00:51:00,733 --> 00:51:02,900
- I LOVE THESE GUYS.
- WE HAVE DONE MANY JOBS.

1083
00:51:02,900 --> 00:51:05,800
- THEY’RE AWESOME.
- MANY TIMES OVER THE YEARS.

1084
00:51:05,800 --> 00:51:07,567
- YOU ARE THE BEST.
- POLLEN FOR YA?

1085
00:51:07,567 --> 00:51:10,367
THE BEST BECAUSE YOU HAD
NO FEELING, NO EMOTION.

1086
00:51:10,367 --> 00:51:12,400
BUT NOW YOU ARE TRYING--

1087
00:51:12,400 --> 00:51:15,100
HE KILLED TONY.
THIS IS SPECIAL.

1088
00:51:15,100 --> 00:51:16,933
YOU’VE HAD YOUR CHANCE.

1089
00:51:16,933 --> 00:51:20,300
GIVE ME 24 HOURS.
I’LL KILL HIM, I SWEAR IT.

1090
00:51:20,300 --> 00:51:22,933
I’M AFRAID NOT, JOSEPH.

1091
00:51:22,933 --> 00:51:25,167
YOU’RE GOING
TO EURO-DISNEY TOMORROW.

1092
00:51:25,167 --> 00:51:27,200
I COULD BRING IN
SOMEBODY FROM ROME.

1093
00:51:27,200 --> 00:51:29,600
THIS IS GONNA END IN A KISS,
ISN’T IT?

1094
00:51:29,600 --> 00:51:31,567
DON LAMANNA, PLEASE.

1095
00:51:31,567 --> 00:51:34,567
THE HEAT IN THE FOREST IS
A GIFT TO YOU FOR THE AMERICAN.

1096
00:51:34,567 --> 00:51:36,233
GIVE ME 24 HOURS.
THAT’S ALL I ASK YOU.

1097
00:51:36,233 --> 00:51:38,533
NO. YOU HAVE ONE DAY.

1098
00:51:42,700 --> 00:51:45,000
24 HOURS.

1099
00:51:45,000 --> 00:51:48,267
HIM. OR YOU.

1100
00:51:48,267 --> 00:51:50,767
OFFICER CASSAR
TOLD ME WHAT HAPPENED.

1101
00:51:50,767 --> 00:51:52,033
I GUESS IT COULDN’T--

1102
00:51:52,033 --> 00:51:53,467
AKIMBO-VISION.

1103
00:51:53,467 --> 00:51:56,167
BUT YOU ARE A WALKING
DISASTER AREA, SHERIFF.

1104
00:51:56,167 --> 00:51:58,000
THE LAST VIOLENCE
WE HAD IN MALTA

1105
00:51:58,000 --> 00:52:00,900
WAS SOME KIDS BLOWING UP
THE TOILETS AT THE AIRPORT.

1106
00:52:00,900 --> 00:52:02,733
YOU COME TO OUR COUNTRY,

1107
00:52:02,733 --> 00:52:04,133
AND THERE ARE BORDERS
IN THIS CITY.

1108
00:52:04,133 --> 00:52:05,933
AND FURTHERMORE,
[SERVO SPEAKS GIBBERISH].

1109
00:52:05,933 --> 00:52:09,033
--USE OUR COUNTRY LIKE
YOUR OWN PRIVATE SHOOTING RANGE.

1110
00:52:09,033 --> 00:52:10,867
I REALIZE THAT YOUR NAME
IS THAT OF A GREAT

1111
00:52:10,867 --> 00:52:14,200
AMERICAN INDIAN WARRIOR.
BUT THIS WILDNESS MUST STOP.

1112
00:52:14,200 --> 00:52:16,033
WELL, I COULDN’T
AGREE WITH YOU MORE.

1113
00:52:16,033 --> 00:52:18,300
PALERMO’S MEN
STARTED SHOOTING AT ME.

1114
00:52:18,300 --> 00:52:19,633
I HAD TO DEFEND MYSELF.

1115
00:52:19,633 --> 00:52:22,367
- YES, YES YES.
- I CAVE IN.

1116
00:52:22,367 --> 00:52:24,233
LOOK, I STILL THINK
I CAN HELP YOU GUYS.

1117
00:52:24,233 --> 00:52:26,067
I MEAN, I TRACKED HIM IN TEXAS.
I CHASED HIM ALL OVER

1118
00:52:26,067 --> 00:52:27,367
THIS ISLAND OF YOURS.

1119
00:52:27,367 --> 00:52:28,867
I KNOW HIM.
I KNOW HOW HE THINKS.

1120
00:52:28,867 --> 00:52:30,133
I CAN GET THAT [MUTED].

1121
00:52:30,133 --> 00:52:31,800
SHERIFF GERONIMO.

1122
00:52:31,800 --> 00:52:34,833
- GERONIMO!
- IF THERE IS ONE MORE
INCIDENT--

1123
00:52:34,833 --> 00:52:36,600
- JUST ONE MORE--
- JUST A JOKE.

1124
00:52:36,600 --> 00:52:38,667
CAUSED BY YOU OR NOT.

1125
00:52:38,667 --> 00:52:41,400
AS GOD IS MY JUDGE,
I WILL KEEP YOU IN CUSTODY

1126
00:52:41,400 --> 00:52:42,900
UNTIL YOUR PLANE
LEAVES TOMORROW.

1127
00:52:42,900 --> 00:52:44,733
- IS THERE A MEAL?
- I WANT YOUR WORD

1128
00:52:44,733 --> 00:52:46,467
AS AN AMERICAN POLICE OFFICER,
THAT YOU WILL

1129
00:52:46,467 --> 00:52:48,267
CAUSE NO MORE PROBLEMS.

1130
00:52:48,267 --> 00:52:49,833
AS AN AMERICAN
POLICE OFFICER?

1131
00:52:49,833 --> 00:52:51,300
YES.

1132
00:52:51,300 --> 00:52:52,867
A GIANT BABY IN A HAT.

1133
00:52:52,867 --> 00:52:56,167
YOU GOT MY WORD.

1134
00:52:56,167 --> 00:52:57,500
EH, THERE WAS
NO BUFFET IN THERE.

1135
00:52:57,500 --> 00:52:59,067
WHAT THE HELL IS THE DEAL?

1136
00:52:59,067 --> 00:53:01,767
YOUR BOSS IS WRONG, MARIA.
THIS AIN’T GONNA STOP.

1137
00:53:01,767 --> 00:53:04,700
LOOK, THAT [MUTED]
KILLED MY PARTNER.

1138
00:53:04,700 --> 00:53:06,433
I KILLED HIS BROTHER.

1139
00:53:06,433 --> 00:53:07,733
AIN’T NO WAY
THIS IS GONNA END UP

1140
00:53:07,733 --> 00:53:09,200
WITH BOTH OF US
WALKING AROUND.

1141
00:53:09,200 --> 00:53:11,600
BUT YOU GAVE YOUR WORD
TO SUPERINTENDENT MIFSUD.

1142
00:53:11,600 --> 00:53:13,900
I GAVE MY WORD AS
AN AMERICAN POLICE OFFICER.

1143
00:53:13,900 --> 00:53:15,667
- HELL, I’M A TEXAS LAWMAN.
- D’OH.

1144
00:53:15,667 --> 00:53:17,067
PLEASE DON’T DO
ANYTHING ELSE.

1145
00:53:17,067 --> 00:53:19,300
SUPERINTENDENT MIFSUD WILL
SURELY PUT YOU AWAY THIS TIME.

1146
00:53:19,300 --> 00:53:21,500
- BELIEVE ME.
- I BELIEVE YOU, BUT THAT
AIN’T THE PROBLEM.

1147
00:53:21,500 --> 00:53:23,167
NOW, THE PROBLEM IS,
I GOTTA FIND PALERMO

1148
00:53:23,167 --> 00:53:24,433
BEFORE HE FINDS ME.

1149
00:53:24,433 --> 00:53:26,100
TAKE YOUR PIG MASK OFF.

1150
00:53:26,100 --> 00:53:27,733
ONLY LEAD WE GOT
IS THAT HONKY-TONK

1151
00:53:27,733 --> 00:53:29,767
CALLED SMUGGLERS’ TAVERN,
WHERE HE SET ME UP.

1152
00:53:29,767 --> 00:53:32,433
I’M GONNA GO TALK TO THEM
GOOD OLD BOYS.

1153
00:53:32,433 --> 00:53:34,100
SMUGGLERS’ TAVERN.
WE HAVE STRIPPERS

1154
00:53:34,100 --> 00:53:35,900
AND SKILLET BREAKFASTS.

1155
00:53:35,900 --> 00:53:37,867
YOU KNOW, I PREFER
THE EMBEZZLERS’ TAVERN.

1156
00:53:37,867 --> 00:53:40,533
YEAH.

1157
00:53:40,533 --> 00:53:43,533
THAT’S JOE DON BAKER. HUH.

1158
00:53:45,667 --> 00:53:47,067
A SHAVED BEAR.

1159
00:53:47,067 --> 00:53:49,500
WHAT WILL IT BE, TEX?

1160
00:53:49,500 --> 00:53:50,767
ANY MAALOX?

1161
00:53:50,767 --> 00:53:53,233
MAALOX?
WHAT THE HELL IS THAT?

1162
00:53:53,233 --> 00:53:54,767
JUST GIVE ME
A TALL GLASS OF MILK.

1163
00:53:54,767 --> 00:53:56,033
MILK.

1164
00:53:56,033 --> 00:53:59,467
HEY. WE GOT A REAL
AMERICAN COWBOY HERE.

1165
00:53:59,467 --> 00:54:02,733
SORRY, TEX. NO MILK.

1166
00:54:02,733 --> 00:54:04,167
MAYBE YOU CAN HELP ME.

1167
00:54:04,167 --> 00:54:06,600
I’M LOOKING FOR THIS ITALIAN GUY
NAMED JOE PALERMO.

1168
00:54:06,600 --> 00:54:08,133
UH, THAT’S HIM DANCING.

1169
00:54:08,133 --> 00:54:10,233
ABOUT SIX FEET TALL.
180 POUNDS.

1170
00:54:10,233 --> 00:54:12,667
UH, BREASTS A LITTLE BIGGER
THAN HERS.

1171
00:54:12,667 --> 00:54:14,300
HE’S A NICE DRESSER.

1172
00:54:14,300 --> 00:54:15,933
I JUST SELL DRINKS.

1173
00:54:15,933 --> 00:54:18,800
I DON’T PAY ATTENTION
WHO DRINKS THEM.

1174
00:54:18,800 --> 00:54:21,400
I WOULDN’T LIKE IT IF I FOUND
OUT YOU WAS LYING TO ME.

1175
00:54:21,400 --> 00:54:25,200
- WELL, YOU’RE FAT.
- I KNOW A LOT OF ITALIANS.

1176
00:54:25,200 --> 00:54:26,567
I’M TALKING TO THIS MAN.

1177
00:54:26,567 --> 00:54:28,367
YOU JUST MIND YOUR BUSINESS
AND DRINK YOUR BEER.

1178
00:54:28,367 --> 00:54:31,167
YOU DON’T LIKE BEER, TEX?

1179
00:54:31,167 --> 00:54:34,833
HE LIKES MILK.

1180
00:54:34,833 --> 00:54:38,133
HAVE SOME OF MY BEER.

1181
00:54:38,133 --> 00:54:41,800
IT’S A BAR
FULL OF STUART MARGOLIS’S.

1182
00:54:41,800 --> 00:54:44,867
OH, DON, WHAT ARE YOU--
OH, IT’S THE BEER.

1183
00:54:48,233 --> 00:54:50,233
IT DON’T MATTER.
I HAD ’EM BEER-PROOFED.

1184
00:54:50,233 --> 00:54:52,300
TELL YOU WHAT,
[MUTED]-FOR-BRAINS.

1185
00:54:52,300 --> 00:54:54,167
WHY DON’T YOU JUST GET
DOWN THERE AND CLEAN THEM BOOTS?

1186
00:54:54,167 --> 00:54:55,533
THEN WE’LL
TALK ABOUT ITALIANS.

1187
00:54:55,533 --> 00:54:59,467
DID I MENTION HE LIKES MILK?

1188
00:54:59,467 --> 00:55:03,033
WELL, NO, HOLD IT!
HOLD IT! JUST A MINUTE.

1189
00:55:03,033 --> 00:55:04,967
LET’S GO CORRAL HORSES.

1190
00:55:04,967 --> 00:55:06,633
I DON’T WANT
ANY TROUBLE HERE.

1191
00:55:06,633 --> 00:55:08,667
GET THE MILK-LOVER!

1192
00:55:11,600 --> 00:55:14,400
STOP THIS FIGHTING!

1193
00:55:14,400 --> 00:55:16,567
WELL, I DID ALL I COULD.

1194
00:55:21,500 --> 00:55:22,800
WHAT’S THE MATTER,
YOU GUYS? HUH?

1195
00:55:22,800 --> 00:55:25,533
YOU DON’T WANT JOE DON
THROWING A STOOL AT YOU.

1196
00:55:29,500 --> 00:55:32,767
UH, OKAY, I’LL WAIT.

1197
00:55:32,767 --> 00:55:35,433
LOOK OUT, MEN.
HE HAS AN INNER TUBE!

1198
00:55:40,800 --> 00:55:43,433
ZING!

1199
00:55:43,433 --> 00:55:45,667
HE’S WINNING,
BUT THESE GUYS ARE MALTESE.

1200
00:55:45,667 --> 00:55:49,000
YEAH, THERE’S THAT.

1201
00:55:49,000 --> 00:55:51,367
HE’S BATTLING
A RED HOT CHILI PEPPER!

1202
00:55:56,767 --> 00:56:00,033
OH, THE HALL MONITORS
ARE HERE.

1203
00:56:00,033 --> 00:56:02,600
I JUST CAME HERE
FOR SOME MILK. SORRY.

1204
00:56:05,967 --> 00:56:07,500
[SERVO˯ RASPBERRIES]

1205
00:56:07,500 --> 00:56:08,833
SUPERINTENDENT MIFSUD
WANTS TO SEE ME.

1206
00:56:08,833 --> 00:56:10,467
I KNOW THE WAY.

1207
00:56:10,467 --> 00:56:11,933
DING-DING. BRIDGE UP.

1208
00:56:11,933 --> 00:56:14,433
STOP IT, CARL.

1209
00:56:16,833 --> 00:56:19,133
LET’S WATCH HIM
Q-TIP HIS EARS NOW.

1210
00:56:19,133 --> 00:56:21,200
EXCUSE ME, SIR.
THE AMERICAN.

1211
00:56:21,200 --> 00:56:23,767
OH. IT HAS BEEN
A LONG DAY, SHERIFF.

1212
00:56:23,767 --> 00:56:25,100
[MIMICKING ACCENT]
HYES, IT HAS.

1213
00:56:25,100 --> 00:56:26,967
WE IN MALTA WILL
TELL STORIES OF YOU

1214
00:56:26,967 --> 00:56:28,200
TO OUR GREAT-GRANDCHILDREN.

1215
00:56:28,200 --> 00:56:29,900
WAIT A MINUTE.
I DIDN’T START THAT RUCKUS.

1216
00:56:29,900 --> 00:56:31,867
RUCKUS? THAT’S
WHAT YOU CALL IT?

1217
00:56:31,867 --> 00:56:33,133
I PREFER FRACAS.

1218
00:56:33,133 --> 00:56:34,900
MY SUPERIORS FEEL THAT
YOU SHOULD BE LOCKED UP

1219
00:56:34,900 --> 00:56:36,800
FOR A VERY LONG TIME.

1220
00:56:36,800 --> 00:56:38,133
HOW WOULD YOU FEEL
ABOUT THAT?

1221
00:56:38,133 --> 00:56:39,400
I WOULDN’T LIKE IT, SIR.

1222
00:56:39,400 --> 00:56:41,767
NO. I SUPPOSE YOU WOULDN’T.

1223
00:56:41,767 --> 00:56:43,500
OUR JAILS ARE
NOT AS COMFORTABLE

1224
00:56:43,500 --> 00:56:45,033
AS YOURS IN AMERICA,
ARE THEY?

1225
00:56:45,033 --> 00:56:47,300
WELL, ACTUALLY, I WISH OURS
WERE A LOT MORE LIKE YOURS.

1226
00:56:47,300 --> 00:56:50,567
MM, FLATTERY WILL NOT HELP
YOUR SITUATION HERE, SHERIFF.

1227
00:56:50,567 --> 00:56:53,333
- [MIMICKING ACCENT] HERONIMO.
- ACTUALLY, I AM TO BLAME.

1228
00:56:53,333 --> 00:56:55,400
IF OFFICER MARIA CASSAR
HAD BEEN WITH YOU,

1229
00:56:55,400 --> 00:56:57,633
THIS WOULD NOT
HAVE HAPPENED.

1230
00:56:57,633 --> 00:57:00,467
I GUESS SHE WAS NOT READY FOR
THIS ASSIGNMENT.

1231
00:57:00,467 --> 00:57:02,133
WAIT A MINUTE.
IT WASN’T HER FAULT.

1232
00:57:02,133 --> 00:57:03,500
SHE DIDN’T HAVE A THING
TO DO WITH THIS.

1233
00:57:03,500 --> 00:57:05,367
OH, DON’T TROUBLE YOURSELF.

1234
00:57:05,367 --> 00:57:06,900
OFFICER CASSAR
HAS BEEN RELIEVED

1235
00:57:06,900 --> 00:57:08,500
OF FURTHER RESPONSIBILITY
REGARDING THIS CASE--

1236
00:57:08,500 --> 00:57:11,067
- YOU MEAN
SHE’S BEEN REASSIGNED?
- THAT IS CORRECT.

1237
00:57:11,067 --> 00:57:12,500
WELL, IT’S YOUR BUSINESS,
BUT LET ME TELL YOU.

1238
00:57:12,500 --> 00:57:13,967
SHE’S ONE HELL
OF A FINE OFFICER.

1239
00:57:13,967 --> 00:57:15,467
- THANK YOU.
- SAY.

1240
00:57:15,467 --> 00:57:17,333
HOW ABOUT GIVING ME ABOUT
TEN MINUTES WITH THAT BARTENDER?

1241
00:57:17,333 --> 00:57:18,833
NOW, I CAN GET
THE INFORMATION OUT OF HIM--

1242
00:57:18,833 --> 00:57:21,233
I’M NOT SURE IF YOU UNDERSTAND
THE POSITION HERE, SHERIFF.

1243
00:57:21,233 --> 00:57:22,767
- YEAH.
- MY SUPERIORS

1244
00:57:22,767 --> 00:57:24,467
HAVE INSTRUCTED ME
IN CLEAR TERMS.

1245
00:57:24,467 --> 00:57:26,800
YOU ARE NO LONGER
INVOLVED IN THIS CASE.

1246
00:57:26,800 --> 00:57:29,167
I HAVE PERSONALLY
QUESTIONED THE BARTENDER.

1247
00:57:29,167 --> 00:57:31,133
MAN HAS NO KNOWLEDGE
OF MR. PALERMO.

1248
00:57:31,133 --> 00:57:32,800
YEAH, WELL, LET ME TALK TO HIM.
I CAN GET THE INFORMATION--

1249
00:57:32,800 --> 00:57:34,500
YOUR PLANE LEAVES
IN LESS THAN TEN HOURS.

1250
00:57:34,500 --> 00:57:37,033
- YEAH.
- I SUGGEST YOU STAY
IN YOUR HOTEL,

1251
00:57:37,033 --> 00:57:39,100
AND YOU WILL BE ESCORTED
TO THE AIRPORT TOMORROW.

1252
00:57:39,100 --> 00:57:41,400
- I’M UNDER HOUSE ARREST?
- YOU COULD STAY IN YOUR CELL

1253
00:57:41,400 --> 00:57:42,667
- IF YOU PREFER.
- HEY, CUT ME SOME SLACK!

1254
00:57:42,667 --> 00:57:44,300
- SHERIFF GERONIMO!
- YOU HAVE FLESHY WRISTS.

1255
00:57:44,300 --> 00:57:45,667
THE CHOICE IS YOURS.

1256
00:57:45,667 --> 00:57:48,700
YOUR HOTEL OR YOUR CELL.

1257
00:57:48,700 --> 00:57:50,267
WELL, THE HOTEL, BUT--
HEY, PAL. COME HERE.

1258
00:57:50,267 --> 00:57:51,600
I WANNA TALK TO YOU.
WAIT A MINUTE.

1259
00:57:51,600 --> 00:57:55,333
- LISTEN!
- PAL?

1260
00:57:55,333 --> 00:57:57,533
DAY SEVEN OF HIS SHIRT.

1261
00:58:00,900 --> 00:58:02,733
SAY, PAL, TELL ME SOMETHING.

1262
00:58:02,733 --> 00:58:05,400
ABOUT MALTA.
WAS THERE REALLY A FALCON?

1263
00:58:05,400 --> 00:58:07,067
WELL, YES.
AS A MATTER OF FACT, THERE WAS.

1264
00:58:07,067 --> 00:58:09,200
- [GERONIMO STRAINS]
- YOU OKAY?

1265
00:58:09,200 --> 00:58:10,600
NO.

1266
00:58:10,600 --> 00:58:13,367
HEART ATTACK. IT’S THE
ONLY EXERCISE HE EVER GETS.

1267
00:58:13,367 --> 00:58:14,800
HEY-- HEY!

1268
00:58:14,800 --> 00:58:16,933
- LOOK, I GOT WORK TO DO NOW.
- OOH, HEY.

1269
00:58:16,933 --> 00:58:19,133
SORRY ABOUT THIS.

1270
00:58:19,133 --> 00:58:20,400
I HATE IT WHEN
YOU THROW A FIGHT,

1271
00:58:20,400 --> 00:58:23,833
AND NOBODY STAYS
TO HELP YOU CLEAN UP.

1272
00:58:23,833 --> 00:58:25,500
GO AWAY. WE’RE CLOSED.

1273
00:58:25,500 --> 00:58:28,633
OOH. WE’RE NOT CLOSED
FOR YOU.

1274
00:58:28,633 --> 00:58:30,000
I DON’T WANT
ANY MORE TROUBLE.

1275
00:58:30,000 --> 00:58:31,967
WELL, THAT’S EXACTLY
WHAT YOU’RE GONNA GET,

1276
00:58:31,967 --> 00:58:35,600
UNLESS I GET SOME ANSWERS
ABOUT THAT ITALIAN.

1277
00:58:35,600 --> 00:58:37,633
NOW LOOK AT THAT.

1278
00:58:37,633 --> 00:58:38,967
YOU KNOW, MY ANCESTORS--

1279
00:58:38,967 --> 00:58:40,967
WERE LARGE, SOFT ROCKS.

1280
00:58:40,967 --> 00:58:43,233
THEY USED TO SKIN
THEIR ENEMIES.

1281
00:58:43,233 --> 00:58:45,600
JUST PEEL THE SKIN
RIGHT OFF THE BONE.

1282
00:58:45,600 --> 00:58:47,933
THE TRICK WAS TO GET IT
ALL IN ONE PEEL LIKE THIS.

1283
00:58:47,933 --> 00:58:50,767
TAKE A SHARP KNIFE
AND JUST CUT LAYER AFTER LAYER

1284
00:58:50,767 --> 00:58:52,267
OF FLESH.

1285
00:58:52,267 --> 00:58:54,533
REAL EXPERTS. THE APACHES.

1286
00:58:54,533 --> 00:58:57,000
- YOU’VE HEARD OF
THE APACHES, HAVEN’T YOU?
- THE CABBAGE PATCHIES?

1287
00:58:57,000 --> 00:58:59,467
SAY, MAYBE YOU WANNA TELL ME
WHERE I CAN FIND THIS...

1288
00:58:59,467 --> 00:59:01,433
JOE PALERMO?

1289
00:59:01,433 --> 00:59:03,400
- WOW. PAIN.
- MAYBE YOU PREFER I SHOW YOU--

1290
00:59:03,400 --> 00:59:05,933
- HOW TO SKIN SOMEBODY.
- FELONIOUS MONK.
- ALL RIGHT.

1291
00:59:05,933 --> 00:59:09,733
AN OLD ITALIAN GUY WHO’S BEEN
MESSING WITH ONE OF MY DANCERS.

1292
00:59:09,733 --> 00:59:11,100
THAT’S ALL.

1293
00:59:11,100 --> 00:59:12,800
WHERE IS SHE?

1294
00:59:12,800 --> 00:59:14,700
IN THERE.
IN THE DRESSING ROOM.

1295
00:59:14,700 --> 00:59:16,200
BETTER NOT BE LYING TO ME.

1296
00:59:16,200 --> 00:59:19,000
OR YOU WON’T HAVE
AN UNPEELED ORANGE IN THE PLACE.

1297
00:59:21,000 --> 00:59:23,033
I’D BETTER CALL MY MOTHER.
SHE CAN DEFEND ME

1298
00:59:23,033 --> 00:59:25,300
FROM THIS BIG MAN.

1299
00:59:33,000 --> 00:59:34,333
- I TOLD YOU.
- WE’RE NOT HIRING.

1300
00:59:34,333 --> 00:59:36,067
I DO NOT KNOW
WHAT YOU ARE TALKING ABOUT.

1301
00:59:36,067 --> 00:59:37,533
I THINK YOU DO.

1302
00:59:37,533 --> 00:59:39,200
IF I CAN JUST
MAKE YOU REALIZE

1303
00:59:39,200 --> 00:59:41,367
THAT YOU’RE BETTER OFF
TELLING ME WHAT I WANNA KNOW

1304
00:59:41,367 --> 00:59:44,367
- MM.
- THAN NOT TELLING ME
WHAT I WANNA KNOW.

1305
00:59:44,367 --> 00:59:46,333
THEN YOU’RE GONNA TELL ME
WHAT I WANNA KNOW.

1306
00:59:46,333 --> 00:59:48,367
WHERE DO YOU GO FOR
PRIME RIB IN THIS TOWN?

1307
00:59:48,367 --> 00:59:51,500
BUT I DON’T NEED
THIS TROUBLE.

1308
00:59:51,500 --> 00:59:53,933
WHY YOU CAN’T SPEAK
OF SOMETHING ELSE?

1309
00:59:53,933 --> 00:59:55,567
HUH?

1310
00:59:55,567 --> 00:59:58,600
WHAT YOU DON’T NEED
IS TROUBLE FROM ME.

1311
00:59:58,600 --> 01:00:00,667
BUT THAT ITALIAN’S A PUSSYCAT
COMPARED TO ME.

1312
01:00:00,667 --> 01:00:02,133
OUR HERO. A MURDEROUS OAF

1313
01:00:02,133 --> 01:00:04,633
WHO THREATENS WOMEN
WITH COAT HANGERS.

1314
01:00:04,633 --> 01:00:06,867
LOOK, BUT--

1315
01:00:06,867 --> 01:00:08,633
I AM A DEAD LADY

1316
01:00:08,633 --> 01:00:11,133
IF I’M BEING SEEN WITH YOU.

1317
01:00:11,133 --> 01:00:12,467
LOOK, I’LL PROTECT YOU.

1318
01:00:12,467 --> 01:00:14,833
YOU CAN HIDE IN MY HAT.

1319
01:00:14,833 --> 01:00:16,467
I HEAR
YOU’RE LOOKING FOR ME.

1320
01:00:16,467 --> 01:00:19,133
HMM?

1321
01:00:19,133 --> 01:00:21,333
YOU’RE GONNA HAVE
SOME FUN, COWBOY.

1322
01:00:21,333 --> 01:00:23,333
WELL, USUALLY
THE DOCTOR JUST JABS

1323
01:00:23,333 --> 01:00:25,000
MY VAST WHITE BUTTOCKS.

1324
01:00:25,000 --> 01:00:28,367
[PALERMO LAUGHS]

1325
01:00:28,367 --> 01:00:30,133
YOU KNOW, I THINK
IT WAS JUICED VEGETABLES.

1326
01:00:30,133 --> 01:00:33,033
HE JUST CAN’T HANDLE IT.

1327
01:00:33,033 --> 01:00:35,467
COME ON, COWBOY. FIGHT.

1328
01:00:37,500 --> 01:00:39,500
NOW LET’S LOOK AT THIS.

1329
01:00:44,067 --> 01:00:47,600
AH. HERE’S WHERE I LEFT
MY ICE CREAM CONE.

1330
01:00:47,600 --> 01:00:49,333
HMM.

1331
01:00:49,333 --> 01:00:51,667
GUESS WHERE THIS
IS GOING, JOE DON.

1332
01:00:56,733 --> 01:00:59,533
NOW PUT YOUR HAND
IN THIS BOWL OF EYEBALLS.

1333
01:00:59,533 --> 01:01:01,400
[SERVO GASPS]

1334
01:01:05,533 --> 01:01:08,133
FIRE BAD. [GRUNTS]

1335
01:01:08,133 --> 01:01:09,433
[GERONIMO GRUNTS]

1336
01:01:09,433 --> 01:01:11,533
JOE DON BAKER
IS CARRIED TO THE SET

1337
01:01:11,533 --> 01:01:16,500
OF FINAL JUSTICE.

1338
01:01:16,500 --> 01:01:19,033
[MIKE RASPBERRIES, BELCHES]

1339
01:01:21,200 --> 01:01:25,700
THEY’RE GOING
TO GRANDPA’S LABORATORY.

1340
01:01:25,700 --> 01:01:29,167
[GERONIMO GRUNTS]

1341
01:01:29,167 --> 01:01:30,733
SEE, THAT’S THE CANDLE
THEY HAVE TO LIGHT

1342
01:01:30,733 --> 01:01:34,933
WHEN JOE DON
USES THE BATHROOM.

1343
01:01:34,933 --> 01:01:38,200
EH, WE’LL SEE WHAT COUNT CHOCULA
HAS TO SAY ABOUT THIS.

1344
01:01:38,200 --> 01:01:39,933
WAIT A MINUTE.

1345
01:01:39,933 --> 01:01:42,767
YOUR HOURS ARE
NUMBERED, COWBOY.

1346
01:01:42,767 --> 01:01:45,067
I’M GONNA MAKE
YOUR DEATH REAL SLOW.

1347
01:01:45,067 --> 01:01:46,800
EH, ’CAUSE I’M DRUNK.

1348
01:01:46,800 --> 01:01:49,267
YOU’RE GONNA PAY
FOR MY BROTHER.

1349
01:01:49,267 --> 01:01:50,667
YOU’RE GONNA PAY FOR HIM.

1350
01:01:50,667 --> 01:01:52,700
I’M GONNA HAVE A LOT OF FUN.

1351
01:01:52,700 --> 01:01:54,067
AT LEAST HE HAS
GOOD EXPECTATIONS
AND EVERYTHING.

1352
01:01:54,067 --> 01:01:55,533
AH, [MUTED].

1353
01:01:55,533 --> 01:01:57,533
UH, JOE DON. JOE DON,
WE’RE NOT DONE WITH THE SCENE.

1354
01:01:57,533 --> 01:01:59,267
JOE DONE. UH-- OH.

1355
01:01:59,267 --> 01:02:02,367
BOY, I’M GLAD WE SKIPPED
THE CAVITY SEARCH.

1356
01:02:05,300 --> 01:02:07,167
DON LAMANNA,
DID YOU WANT TO SEE ME?

1357
01:02:07,167 --> 01:02:08,600
YEAH. SIT DOWN.

1358
01:02:08,600 --> 01:02:11,033
OH, HE’S BEEN
INVITED TO PANEL.

1359
01:02:11,033 --> 01:02:14,933
IT WAS NOT WISE
TO BRING THE AMERICAN HERE.

1360
01:02:14,933 --> 01:02:18,133
HE’LL BE DEAD IN 24 HOURS,
JUST LIKE I PROMISED.

1361
01:02:18,133 --> 01:02:20,433
THEN KILL HIM
AND BE DONE WITH IT.

1362
01:02:20,433 --> 01:02:21,733
RUN HIM OVER
WITH YOUR VESPA.

1363
01:02:21,733 --> 01:02:23,133
A QUICK DEATH IS TOO EASY.

1364
01:02:23,133 --> 01:02:25,133
I WANT TO MAKE IT
SLOW FOR HIM.

1365
01:02:25,133 --> 01:02:28,900
JUST SEE TO IT MR. GERONIMO
IS DEAD BY TOMORROW.

1366
01:02:28,900 --> 01:02:30,367
- GERONIMO!
- YOU HAVE MY WORD.

1367
01:02:30,367 --> 01:02:31,767
THERE HE GOES AGAIN.

1368
01:02:31,767 --> 01:02:35,200
I’M AWARE OF THAT, JOSEPH.

1369
01:02:35,200 --> 01:02:37,333
[GERONIMO CHANTS]

1370
01:02:37,333 --> 01:02:40,900
THE HELL?

1371
01:02:40,900 --> 01:02:42,967
- WHAT?
- DRUNK AGAIN?

1372
01:02:45,867 --> 01:02:48,100
WELL, I GOT THE MIDNIGHT
TO 8:00 STRIP SHIFT.

1373
01:02:48,100 --> 01:02:50,167
SO.

1374
01:02:52,267 --> 01:02:55,000
MM, I LEFT A LOAD
OF TRIANGLES IN THE DRYER.

1375
01:03:01,200 --> 01:03:03,633
TAKE ME AWAY, PEIGNOIR.

1376
01:03:10,400 --> 01:03:13,467
I GUESS I’D BETTER STUDY
FOR MY STRIPPER’S BOARD EXAMS.

1377
01:03:16,800 --> 01:03:19,333
WHY DID SHE WEAR
HER PROM DRESS TO BED?

1378
01:03:22,333 --> 01:03:24,167
CHRISTIAN SLATER’S
GONNA FLY TOMORROW.

1379
01:03:24,167 --> 01:03:26,933
I’D BETTER GET THIS
BACK TO HIM.

1380
01:03:26,933 --> 01:03:29,433
HMM. I SENSE CHEESEBURGERS.

1381
01:03:31,967 --> 01:03:34,500
LAP DANCE HOME DELIVERY?

1382
01:03:34,500 --> 01:03:36,167
YOU SAID YOU’D PROTECT ME.

1383
01:03:36,167 --> 01:03:37,433
DID YOU MEAN IT?

1384
01:03:37,433 --> 01:03:39,233
I KNOW PALERMO.

1385
01:03:39,233 --> 01:03:41,300
I WON’T
UNDERESTIMATE HIM AGAIN.

1386
01:03:41,300 --> 01:03:43,667
YOU’VE GOT MY WORD.

1387
01:03:43,667 --> 01:03:46,633
OKAY.

1388
01:03:46,633 --> 01:03:48,300
YOU KNOW, I REALLY
DON’T CARE FOR THIS REMAKE

1389
01:03:48,300 --> 01:03:50,400
OF A LION IN WINTER.

1390
01:03:53,300 --> 01:03:56,233
TORCH HOLDERS ARE
AN OPTION ON NEWER HOMES.

1391
01:03:58,733 --> 01:04:00,633
I SHOULD LET YOU KNOW.
I ATE THE MATTRESS

1392
01:04:00,633 --> 01:04:04,933
IN MY CELL. YOU’LL WANT
TO REPLACE THAT.

1393
01:04:04,933 --> 01:04:06,633
CHANGE INTO
ONE OF MY NIGHTGOWNS

1394
01:04:06,633 --> 01:04:07,967
AND DISGUISE YOURSELF AS ME.

1395
01:04:07,967 --> 01:04:09,833
- WHERE IS HE?
- UPSTAIRS.

1396
01:04:09,833 --> 01:04:11,433
USUALLY I HAVE
NIGHT-VISION GOGGLES

1397
01:04:11,433 --> 01:04:12,867
FOR READING THE FRIDGE,
BUT I FORGOT

1398
01:04:12,867 --> 01:04:15,200
TO BRING ’EM WITH ME.

1399
01:04:20,300 --> 01:04:22,400
UH. PLEASE DON’T
USE THE GUEST TOWELS

1400
01:04:22,400 --> 01:04:24,333
FOR TOILET PAPER
LIKE YOU DID LAST TIME.

1401
01:04:24,333 --> 01:04:27,067
- UGH.
- THANK YOU.

1402
01:04:40,767 --> 01:04:42,133
AH, THANK YOU FOR COMING.

1403
01:04:42,133 --> 01:04:44,433
I’M READY TO PRESENT
MY REPORT ON MALTA.

1404
01:04:44,433 --> 01:04:46,167
[CLEARS THROAT]

1405
01:04:46,167 --> 01:04:48,933
MALTA. A NATION
AND A COUNTRY.

1406
01:04:48,933 --> 01:04:50,833
MALTA IS A SMALL ARCHIPELAGO

1407
01:04:50,833 --> 01:04:52,900
IN THE MEDITERRANEAN SEA
NEAR SICILY.

1408
01:04:52,900 --> 01:04:54,800
THE KNIGHTS OF ST. JOHN
FOUNDED MALTA

1409
01:04:54,800 --> 01:04:56,233
IN THE MIDDLE AGES.

1410
01:04:56,233 --> 01:04:59,767
INDUSTRIES ARE SHIP-BUILDING,
MANUFACTURING, AND TOURISM.

1411
01:04:59,767 --> 01:05:01,100
HUH.

1412
01:05:01,100 --> 01:05:03,300
WELL, THANK YOU, CROW.
THAT WAS VERY INFORMATIVE.

1413
01:05:03,300 --> 01:05:05,900
WELL, THAT’S ALL THE HARD DATA.
NOW ONTO THE GOOD STUFF.

1414
01:05:05,900 --> 01:05:08,067
IT’S INTERESTING TO NOTE
THAT THE COUNTRY’S POPULATION

1415
01:05:08,067 --> 01:05:11,133
OF 350,000 CONTAINS
MORE WOMEN THAN MEN.

1416
01:05:11,133 --> 01:05:13,800
ESPECIALLY SINCE
THE MEN ARE SO WOMANY

1417
01:05:13,800 --> 01:05:15,067
IN THE FIRST PLACE.

1418
01:05:15,067 --> 01:05:17,133
- UH. CROW?
- HANG ON, MIKE.

1419
01:05:17,133 --> 01:05:18,600
IT’S NO WONDER MALTA IS

1420
01:05:18,600 --> 01:05:20,567
ONE OF THE MOST CONQUERED
ISLANDS IN HISTORY.

1421
01:05:20,567 --> 01:05:22,167
WHAT WITH THE MALTESE MEN

1422
01:05:22,167 --> 01:05:23,733
WHO CONSISTENTLY
WET THEMSELVES--

1423
01:05:23,733 --> 01:05:25,000
- WOW!
- AND SURRENDER AT THE SIGHT

1424
01:05:25,000 --> 01:05:26,700
OF ANYONE REMOTELY
BIGGER THAN THEM.

1425
01:05:26,700 --> 01:05:29,167
- NOW THIS IS INTERESTING.
- YOU BET.

1426
01:05:29,167 --> 01:05:31,867
THIS POPULATION
OF SO-CALLED "MEN"

1427
01:05:31,867 --> 01:05:33,200
IS KNOWN
THROUGHOUT THE WORLD

1428
01:05:33,200 --> 01:05:35,000
AS A GAGGLE
OF FLACCID NINNIES.

1429
01:05:35,000 --> 01:05:37,100
- WHOO.
- WHOSE DELICATE FINGERS
CAN BARELY HOLD UP

1430
01:05:37,100 --> 01:05:38,933
THEIR STINKY
MALTESE CIGARETTES.

1431
01:05:38,933 --> 01:05:40,800
- CROW, WHAT ARE YOU SAYING?
- WAIT, IT GETS BETTER.

1432
01:05:40,800 --> 01:05:42,900
- OH BOY.
- FAMOUS FOR BREATH SO BAD

1433
01:05:42,900 --> 01:05:44,467
- IT COULD MELT STEEL--
- WOW!

1434
01:05:44,467 --> 01:05:46,633
THESE GREASY
GOAT-LOVING MAMA’S BOYS

1435
01:05:46,633 --> 01:05:48,467
ARE KNOWN IN
THE EUROPEAN COMMUNITY

1436
01:05:48,467 --> 01:05:50,600
FOR HAVING THE TINIEST,
MOST SHRIVELED-UP--

1437
01:05:50,600 --> 01:05:52,900
OKAY, CROW, ALL RIGHT!
STOP, PLEASE. COME ON.

1438
01:05:52,900 --> 01:05:54,567
WHAT, MIKE, COME ON.
DON’T TELL ME YOU’RE GONNA

1439
01:05:54,567 --> 01:05:56,667
DEFEND THESE WITLESS
TIGHT-SHIRTED

1440
01:05:56,667 --> 01:05:58,100
CLOUDS OF WALKING B.O.?

1441
01:05:58,100 --> 01:05:59,567
OKAY-- LISTEN, STOP IT.
OKAY.

1442
01:05:59,567 --> 01:06:00,833
THERE MUST BE SOMETHING
WRONG WITH YOU.

1443
01:06:00,833 --> 01:06:02,600
- LET ME TAKE A LOOK AT YOU.
- HEY, SINCE WHEN

1444
01:06:02,600 --> 01:06:05,133
HAVE YOU HAD THIS SEETHING
HATRED OF MALTESE MEN?

1445
01:06:05,133 --> 01:06:07,633
WELL, EVER SINCE
I WAS A LITTLE BOY, SERVO.

1446
01:06:07,633 --> 01:06:09,667
SOME FORGOTTEN
MALTESE HORROR

1447
01:06:09,667 --> 01:06:11,800
DEEPLY WOUNDED
MY TENDER YOUNG PSYCHE.

1448
01:06:11,800 --> 01:06:14,067
UH, YOU WERE
NEVER A LITTLE BOY, CROW.

1449
01:06:14,067 --> 01:06:16,667
YOU WERE BUILT IN SPACE.

1450
01:06:16,667 --> 01:06:18,700
WELL, THAT’S
PRETTY TRAUMATIC.

1451
01:06:18,700 --> 01:06:20,733
MAYBE I WAS BUILT
BY SOME SWEATY,

1452
01:06:20,733 --> 01:06:22,700
TINY-BATCHED
MALTESE CAPITULATOR--

1453
01:06:22,700 --> 01:06:25,433
OKAY, STOP IT. NOW, I THINK
I FOUND THE PROBLEM.

1454
01:06:25,433 --> 01:06:27,400
I THINK THERE’S A TINY FLAW

1455
01:06:27,400 --> 01:06:30,433
IN THE CODING SUBSTRUCTURE
OF THE RISK PROCESSOR.

1456
01:06:30,433 --> 01:06:31,800
- THERE IT IS.
- NO DOUBT PUT THERE BY

1457
01:06:31,800 --> 01:06:33,300
A LISPING, CHEESE-GORGED

1458
01:06:33,300 --> 01:06:34,667
MALTESE EUNUCH.

1459
01:06:34,667 --> 01:06:36,767
ALL RIGHT.
I’LL JUST SWAP THIS OUT,

1460
01:06:36,767 --> 01:06:38,767
AND YOU SHOULD BE
RIGHT AS RAIN, OKAY?

1461
01:06:38,767 --> 01:06:41,167
ALL RIGHT, UH. HERE WE GO.

1462
01:06:41,167 --> 01:06:43,233
THERE. NOW...

1463
01:06:43,233 --> 01:06:45,700
CROW, WHAT DO YOU THINK
ABOUT MALTESE MEN?

1464
01:06:45,700 --> 01:06:47,300
UH, WHO?

1465
01:06:47,300 --> 01:06:48,867
- MALTESE MEN?
- AH.

1466
01:06:48,867 --> 01:06:50,367
I DON’T KNOW.
I NEVER REALLY MET ONE.

1467
01:06:50,367 --> 01:06:52,533
OKAY. THERE WE GO.
BACK TO NORMAL.

1468
01:06:52,533 --> 01:06:54,933
- UH, WE’LL BE RIGHT BACK.
- OH, MALTESE MEN!

1469
01:06:54,933 --> 01:06:56,900
HAH! LET ME TELL YOU
ABOUT THOSE

1470
01:06:56,900 --> 01:06:58,633
PUKING HAIRY-NECKED FREAKS!

1471
01:06:58,633 --> 01:07:00,067
- GRAB HIM!
- I JUST--

1472
01:07:00,067 --> 01:07:01,667
STOP, LET ME JUST GET--

1473
01:07:12,667 --> 01:07:15,133
UH, DON’T WORRY. I’LL SUBDUE HIM
BY LAYING ON HIM.

1474
01:07:18,867 --> 01:07:21,700
IF I DIE, I WANNA BE
BURIED NEXT TO THE SIZZLER.

1475
01:07:30,233 --> 01:07:31,967
HE BECAME A PILLOW.

1476
01:07:31,967 --> 01:07:33,300
[WOMAN GROANS]

1477
01:07:33,300 --> 01:07:35,833
YOUR PERSONAL FUNK
IS GETTING TO ME.

1478
01:07:40,000 --> 01:07:41,533
I FELL ON MY SMUCKERS.

1479
01:07:41,533 --> 01:07:44,700
[WOMAN GASPS]

1480
01:07:44,700 --> 01:07:47,933
WELL, TO BE FAIR, HE NEVER SAID
HE’D PROTECT HER NECK.

1481
01:07:47,933 --> 01:07:49,833
[MIKE LAUGHS]

1482
01:07:49,833 --> 01:07:53,133
WOW, THEY HAVE A STRICT
EARLY CHECK-OUT POLICY.

1483
01:07:53,133 --> 01:07:55,367
♪♪ [SYNTH SCORE]

1484
01:07:55,367 --> 01:07:58,567
♪ OUT HERE IN THE FIELDS ♪

1485
01:07:58,567 --> 01:08:00,700
AAH!

1486
01:08:00,700 --> 01:08:02,533
GIVE IT UP, COWBOY!

1487
01:08:02,533 --> 01:08:05,200
YOU GOT NOWHERE TO GO!

1488
01:08:05,200 --> 01:08:06,933
SHE GOT WHAT SHE DESERVED.

1489
01:08:06,933 --> 01:08:08,333
COME INSIDE.

1490
01:08:08,333 --> 01:08:10,767
I’M GOING TO MAKE IT
EASY ON YOU.

1491
01:08:10,767 --> 01:08:14,233
THAT LETHAL INJECTION I GAVE YOU
WASN’T SO BAD NOW, WAS IT?

1492
01:08:14,233 --> 01:08:17,400
MAYBE YOU’D LIKE TO DO MORE.

1493
01:08:17,400 --> 01:08:20,033
AH-HA! OH-- OOH.

1494
01:08:20,033 --> 01:08:21,900
[GERONIMO SHOUTS]

1495
01:08:21,900 --> 01:08:23,900
GERONIMO-- I MEAN, ME!

1496
01:08:23,900 --> 01:08:25,800
[SERVO CHUCKLES]

1497
01:08:25,800 --> 01:08:28,200
FINALLY PAID OFF.

1498
01:08:28,200 --> 01:08:30,233
THERE HE IS! GET HIM!

1499
01:08:30,233 --> 01:08:31,900
OH, RIGHT. LIKE HIS SHINS

1500
01:08:31,900 --> 01:08:33,633
WOULDN’T BE PROTRUDING
THROUGH HIS STOMACH

1501
01:08:33,633 --> 01:08:35,500
AFTER THAT JUMP.

1502
01:08:35,500 --> 01:08:37,033
HE’S HEADING TO THE BOAT.
LET’S GO!

1503
01:08:37,033 --> 01:08:39,533
[CROW MUMBLES]

1504
01:08:39,533 --> 01:08:43,100
I’M GLAD THAT’S A NUDIE SUIT
IN NAME ONLY.

1505
01:08:43,100 --> 01:08:45,567
THANKFULLY.

1506
01:08:45,567 --> 01:08:48,967
UH, NO, I THINK
I’LL NEED A FREIGHTER.

1507
01:08:48,967 --> 01:08:51,267
ALL RIGHT, NOW THE SCREENWRITERS
ARE ASKING THEMSELVES,

1508
01:08:51,267 --> 01:08:53,067
"HAVE WE HAD
A BOAT CHASE YET?"

1509
01:08:53,067 --> 01:08:54,467
"UH, NO, I DON’T THINK SO."

1510
01:08:54,467 --> 01:08:55,800
"WELL, SHOULD WE LOOK BACK

1511
01:08:55,800 --> 01:08:57,300
AT WHAT WE’VE WRITTEN
JUST TO MAKE SURE?"

1512
01:08:57,300 --> 01:08:58,733
"I THINK I’D REMEMBER
IF WE’D DONE THAT."

1513
01:08:58,733 --> 01:09:01,500
"WELL, IF WE HAVEN’T DONE ONE,
WE SHOULD PUT ONE IN.

1514
01:09:01,500 --> 01:09:03,533
PEOPLE WILL LOVE IT."

1515
01:09:03,533 --> 01:09:06,067
YEP. THAT’S WHAT
THE SCREENWRITERS ARE SAYING.

1516
01:09:06,067 --> 01:09:07,833
SCREENWRITERS SAY THAT.

1517
01:09:07,833 --> 01:09:09,233
LET’S GET THEM!

1518
01:09:09,233 --> 01:09:12,033
THAT WAS CLOSE.

1519
01:09:12,033 --> 01:09:13,833
GET THE SON OF A [MUTED]!
COME ON!

1520
01:09:13,833 --> 01:09:17,567
[CROW MUMBLES]

1521
01:09:17,567 --> 01:09:20,700
THE MOVIE MIDWAY HAD
FEWER BOATS THAN THIS.

1522
01:09:26,400 --> 01:09:29,333
AH, HE FINALLY EXPLODED.

1523
01:09:33,533 --> 01:09:35,633
PACKERS!

1524
01:09:37,867 --> 01:09:40,167
I KILLED
THE SON OF A [MUTED]!

1525
01:09:40,167 --> 01:09:41,633
I KILLED HIM!

1526
01:09:41,633 --> 01:09:44,300
YES, I KILLED
[SERVO GIBBERS].

1527
01:09:46,200 --> 01:09:47,500
I GUESS.

1528
01:09:47,500 --> 01:09:51,033
DON’T WORRY.
HIS HEART WILL GO AHEAD ON.

1529
01:09:51,033 --> 01:09:52,300
I DON’T SEE HIM.

1530
01:09:52,300 --> 01:09:54,200
THERE’S AN ELEPHANT SEAL--
OH, THAT’S HIM.

1531
01:09:54,200 --> 01:09:55,767
HE LIVES WITH THE FISHES.

1532
01:09:55,767 --> 01:09:59,733
ALTHOUGH THEY’RE ACTUALLY
TRYING TO KICK HIM OUT.

1533
01:09:59,733 --> 01:10:01,467
GOODBYE, COWBOY.

1534
01:10:01,467 --> 01:10:03,733
MEANWHILE, THERE’S TSUNAMIS
SLAMMING INTO ITALY.

1535
01:10:03,733 --> 01:10:05,367
THIS TIME I’M SURE
THAT HE’S DEAD.

1536
01:10:05,367 --> 01:10:06,833
I GOT HIM.

1537
01:10:06,833 --> 01:10:08,567
WHERE IS THE BODY?

1538
01:10:08,567 --> 01:10:11,000
AT THE BOTTOM
OF THE MEDITERRANEAN.

1539
01:10:11,000 --> 01:10:12,967
HOW CAN YOU BE SO CERTAIN?

1540
01:10:12,967 --> 01:10:15,333
DON LAMANNA,
WE WERE SEVERAL MILES AT SEA.

1541
01:10:15,333 --> 01:10:17,000
THE EXPLOSION
WOULD’VE KILLED ANYONE.

1542
01:10:17,000 --> 01:10:19,400
LET’S GET OUT
OF THIS JUKEBOX.

1543
01:10:19,400 --> 01:10:20,900
THE AMERICAN HAS PROVEN

1544
01:10:20,900 --> 01:10:24,167
HE IS JUST NOT ANYONE.

1545
01:10:24,167 --> 01:10:26,200
WELL.

1546
01:10:26,200 --> 01:10:28,167
LET’S HOPE THAT
THIS IS DONE.

1547
01:10:28,167 --> 01:10:30,667
YOU’RE WELCOME!

1548
01:10:30,667 --> 01:10:33,200
JEEZ.

1549
01:10:33,200 --> 01:10:36,067
EVERY SHARK IN THE OCEAN,
AND THEY STILL CAN’T FINISH HIM.

1550
01:10:39,500 --> 01:10:41,000
HE HAS BEEN MISSING

1551
01:10:41,000 --> 01:10:42,800
FOR FIVE DAYS, MR. WILSON.

1552
01:10:42,800 --> 01:10:45,667
WE HAVE COMBED
THE ISLAND FOR HIM.

1553
01:10:45,667 --> 01:10:47,700
IF THIS MAN PALERMO GOT HIM,

1554
01:10:47,700 --> 01:10:50,433
I’M AFRAID HE MUST BE DEAD.

1555
01:10:50,433 --> 01:10:52,900
PROBABLY BURIED
SOMEWHERE FAR OUT AT SEA.

1556
01:10:52,900 --> 01:10:54,800
WE’LL NEVER FIND HIS BODY.

1557
01:10:54,800 --> 01:10:56,233
I DON’T THINK SO, SIR.

1558
01:10:56,233 --> 01:10:58,000
WHAT MAKES YOU SAY THAT?

1559
01:10:58,000 --> 01:11:00,800
I’M JUST NOT CONVINCED
THAT SHERIFF GERONIMO IS DEAD.

1560
01:11:00,800 --> 01:11:01,967
BUT I’M DICK CAVETT.

1561
01:11:01,967 --> 01:11:03,800
ME TOO, SIR.
THAT INDIAN’S STILL ALIVE.

1562
01:11:03,800 --> 01:11:05,233
HEY, SHUT UP!

1563
01:11:05,233 --> 01:11:09,033
I FEEL IT.

1564
01:11:09,033 --> 01:11:11,300
TWO FULLY DRESSED SILKIES.

1565
01:11:16,500 --> 01:11:18,867
HEY, MALTA! GET A TREE!

1566
01:11:23,433 --> 01:11:26,233
SADLY, HIS ARM
WAS STILL IN THERE.

1567
01:11:30,400 --> 01:11:32,767
HEY, MY DRY CLEANING
DONE YET?

1568
01:11:37,067 --> 01:11:39,433
HERE. IT IS LIQUID BEEF.

1569
01:11:42,400 --> 01:11:43,800
[GERONIMO GRUNTS]

1570
01:11:43,800 --> 01:11:46,033
CAN I HAVE MY NOOK?

1571
01:11:46,033 --> 01:11:48,867
[CROW MUTTERS]

1572
01:11:48,867 --> 01:11:51,500
I HOPE THEY’RE HIRING
TRIANGLE-BUTTED DANCERS.

1573
01:11:57,300 --> 01:11:58,633
EXCUSE ME.

1574
01:11:58,633 --> 01:12:00,100
NO, LISTEN.

1575
01:12:00,100 --> 01:12:01,967
I’VE ALREADY TOLD YOU
ALL I KNOW.

1576
01:12:01,967 --> 01:12:03,467
JUST ONE LAST TIME, OKAY?

1577
01:12:03,467 --> 01:12:06,433
ARE YOU SURE THE AMERICAN
DIDN’T COME BACK HERE?

1578
01:12:06,433 --> 01:12:08,300
- AFTER THE FIGHT?
- THAT’S RIGHT.

1579
01:12:08,300 --> 01:12:09,967
AND I’VE GOT
SOME DAMAGES WHICH

1580
01:12:09,967 --> 01:12:12,700
SOMEBODY MUST PAY FOR.

1581
01:12:12,700 --> 01:12:14,733
- HEY.
- I’M FROM MALTA!

1582
01:12:14,733 --> 01:12:16,033
IF YOU SEE THAT COWBOY,
TELL HIM

1583
01:12:16,033 --> 01:12:19,433
I’M LOOKING FOR HIM, TOO.

1584
01:12:19,433 --> 01:12:20,767
EXCUSE ME, SIR, YOU WANTED

1585
01:12:20,767 --> 01:12:22,900
MY FINAL REPORT
ON SHERIFF GERONIMO?

1586
01:12:22,900 --> 01:12:24,267
YES, I DO.

1587
01:12:24,267 --> 01:12:26,367
WELL, I STILL DON’T
BELIEVE IT, BUT...

1588
01:12:26,367 --> 01:12:28,700
NOBODY’S SEEN OR HEARD FROM HIM
ON THE WHOLE ISLAND.

1589
01:12:28,700 --> 01:12:30,400
WE’RE DOING
OUR BRIDAL REGISTRY.

1590
01:12:30,400 --> 01:12:33,200
I CAN’T STAY HERE ANY LONGER.
I GOTTA GET BACK TO THE STATES.

1591
01:12:33,200 --> 01:12:35,500
I’LL BE LEAVING TOMORROW.

1592
01:12:35,500 --> 01:12:37,133
AS FAR AS I’M CONCERNED,

1593
01:12:37,133 --> 01:12:39,800
THOMAS JEFFERSON GERONIMO
THE THIRD IS DEAD.

1594
01:12:39,800 --> 01:12:43,567
MM, SUN-DRIED CANS.

1595
01:12:43,567 --> 01:12:46,800
YOU NEARLY HIT IT.
A LITTLE MORE PRACTICE.

1596
01:12:46,800 --> 01:12:48,200
PULL IT BACK HARD.

1597
01:12:48,200 --> 01:12:50,200
BUT I AM A MALTESE MALE.

1598
01:12:50,200 --> 01:12:51,833
SORRY.

1599
01:12:51,833 --> 01:12:54,100
- SORRY.
- LET ME TRY.

1600
01:12:54,100 --> 01:12:56,533
THEY’RE SAVING ROCKS IN CASE
THERE’S A ROCK SHORTAGE.

1601
01:13:01,433 --> 01:13:02,933
I USED TO HUNT
SQUIRRELS AND JACKRABBITS

1602
01:13:02,933 --> 01:13:04,300
BACK IN TEXAS.

1603
01:13:04,300 --> 01:13:05,567
THAT’S HOW WE ATE.

1604
01:13:05,567 --> 01:13:08,000
WE STUFFED DEAD RAW SQUIRRELS
INTO OUR MOUTHS.

1605
01:13:11,633 --> 01:13:14,600
WAIT! I BLOCKED YOUR HAT.

1606
01:13:18,167 --> 01:13:20,567
WELL, THEY HUSTLED HIM
OUT OF THE VILLAGE
PRETTY QUICKLY.

1607
01:13:20,567 --> 01:13:22,200
BUT WAIT, I’M STILL
SICK AND WOUNDED.

1608
01:13:22,200 --> 01:13:24,700
UH-HUH, GOODBYE!

1609
01:13:24,700 --> 01:13:27,100
GOODBYE!
THANKS A MILLION!

1610
01:13:27,100 --> 01:13:30,267
THAT’S THANKS A TEN
WITH THE EXCHANGE RATE.

1611
01:13:32,333 --> 01:13:34,567
♪ EVERYBODY’S
BURPING AT ME ♪

1612
01:13:34,567 --> 01:13:37,333
♪ I CAN’T SMELL A THING
THEY’RE EATING ♪

1613
01:13:40,700 --> 01:13:44,167
HE MAKES RANDY QUAID
LOOK SUBTLE AND DIMINUTIVE.

1614
01:13:46,100 --> 01:13:48,767
EXCUSE ME. JOE DON BAKER
COMING THROUGH.

1615
01:13:48,767 --> 01:13:51,067
APPRECIATE IT.

1616
01:13:51,067 --> 01:13:53,200
JUST BECAUSE YOU WON’T
BE HERE, IT’S OKAY.

1617
01:13:53,200 --> 01:13:55,367
I WANT YOU TO KNOW
THAT I’LL FIND HIM FOR YOU.

1618
01:13:55,367 --> 01:13:59,200
MM. ALFREDO SAUCE.

1619
01:13:59,200 --> 01:14:01,567
WELL, HELL, FOR ALL WE KNOW,
HE’S ALREADY OFF THIS ISLAND.

1620
01:14:01,567 --> 01:14:03,067
OH, NO, I DON’T THINK.

1621
01:14:03,067 --> 01:14:05,567
OUR SECURITY AND CUSTOMS
ARE VERY STRICT.

1622
01:14:05,567 --> 01:14:07,067
BUT WHAT IF HE TAKES A BOAT?

1623
01:14:07,067 --> 01:14:09,433
THEY HAVE PATROL BOATS
AROUND THE ISLAND.

1624
01:14:09,433 --> 01:14:11,933
WELL, IF YOU THINK
HE’S STILL HERE,

1625
01:14:11,933 --> 01:14:14,233
I’VE GOT A COUPLE HOURS
BEFORE MY PLANE LEAVES.

1626
01:14:14,233 --> 01:14:15,733
THERE’S A MAN
I WANNA TALK TO.

1627
01:14:15,733 --> 01:14:17,100
NOW WAIT A MINUTE.

1628
01:14:17,100 --> 01:14:19,800
YOU’RE UNDER STRICT ORDERS FROM
SUPERINTENDENT MIFSUD

1629
01:14:19,800 --> 01:14:21,267
NOT TO CAUSE ANY TROUBLE.

1630
01:14:21,267 --> 01:14:23,267
I PERSONALLY GUARANTEED
YOUR BEHAVIOR.

1631
01:14:23,267 --> 01:14:24,933
- ESTABLISHED.
- I’M NOT GONNA MISBEHAVE.

1632
01:14:24,933 --> 01:14:27,133
I JUST WANNA ASK THIS BARTENDER
A FEW LITTLE OLD QUESTIONS.

1633
01:14:27,133 --> 01:14:29,000
YOU STILL SAYING
YOU HAD NOTHING TO DO

1634
01:14:29,000 --> 01:14:32,433
WITH PALERMO SHOWING UP HERE?

1635
01:14:32,433 --> 01:14:34,300
I TOLD YOU! I SWEAR!

1636
01:14:34,300 --> 01:14:35,933
I JUST MET AN ITALIAN GUY--

1637
01:14:35,933 --> 01:14:37,333
[SERVO SPEAKS GIBBERISH]

1638
01:14:37,333 --> 01:14:39,767
- THAT’S ALL.
- WELL, I’M NOT CONVINCED.

1639
01:14:39,767 --> 01:14:42,567
I DON’T BELIEVE PALERMO
JUST HAPPENED TO SHOW UP.

1640
01:14:42,567 --> 01:14:44,400
YOU’RE GETTING VITALIS
ON THE TURTLES.

1641
01:14:44,400 --> 01:14:46,367
- --TELL HIM!
- NO? LOOK,

1642
01:14:46,367 --> 01:14:47,700
I PROMISE THAT LITTLE GIRL
I’D PROTECT HER.

1643
01:14:47,700 --> 01:14:49,267
I DIDN’T MAKE GOOD
ON THAT PROMISE.

1644
01:14:49,267 --> 01:14:50,900
WHERE’D HE GO, K-K-K-KEN?

1645
01:14:50,900 --> 01:14:53,567
- WHERE IS HE? WHERE IS HE?
- I DON’T KNOW!

1646
01:14:53,567 --> 01:14:56,100
- WHERE IS HE?
- TAKE IT EASY, SHERIFF.

1647
01:14:56,100 --> 01:14:57,933
I UNDERSTAND
YOUR FRUSTRATION.

1648
01:14:57,933 --> 01:15:00,133
I DON’T UNDERSTAND
HOW YOU GOT A MOVIE ROLE.

1649
01:15:00,133 --> 01:15:03,000
SHERIFF. THIS IS NOT
THE WILD WEST.

1650
01:15:03,000 --> 01:15:04,833
WE HAVE LAWS HERE.
YOU WILL SPEND THE NIGHT

1651
01:15:04,833 --> 01:15:06,233
- INCARCERATED.
- OH.

1652
01:15:06,233 --> 01:15:07,833
AND I WILL
PERSONALLY ESCORT YOU

1653
01:15:07,833 --> 01:15:10,700
TO THE AIRPORT
TOMORROW MORNING.

1654
01:15:10,700 --> 01:15:13,700
BUT MY BUTT
DOUBLES AS MY FACE.

1655
01:15:15,600 --> 01:15:18,700
I’M SORRY. I WAS
JUST FOLLOWING ORDERS.

1656
01:15:18,700 --> 01:15:20,233
YEAH, I UNDERSTAND ORDERS.

1657
01:15:20,233 --> 01:15:21,867
YOU KNOW,
THERE’S AN OLD SAYING.

1658
01:15:21,867 --> 01:15:23,367
YOU KNOW YOU’RE RIGHT,
GO AHEAD ON.

1659
01:15:23,367 --> 01:15:24,867
’CAUSE RIGHT MAKES MIGHT.

1660
01:15:24,867 --> 01:15:27,500
NOW, THAT [MUTED] RIGHT THERE
KNOWS WHERE PALERMO IS.

1661
01:15:27,500 --> 01:15:29,233
AND I COULD’VE
GOT IT OUT OF HIM.

1662
01:15:29,233 --> 01:15:31,767
CAN YOU, MARIA?

1663
01:15:31,767 --> 01:15:33,333
HE’S GIVEN ME
A LOT TO THINK ABOUT.

1664
01:15:33,333 --> 01:15:36,300
LIKE HOW CAN ONE MAN
BE THAT SWEATY?

1665
01:15:38,633 --> 01:15:41,467
AAH, I’M STUCK IN
A MOBIUS STRIP OF A MOVIE.

1666
01:15:41,467 --> 01:15:44,033
[CROW SOBS]

1667
01:15:44,033 --> 01:15:45,933
[SPEAKING DISTANTLY]

1668
01:15:45,933 --> 01:15:47,700
NO ONE TOLD ME ABOUT IT.

1669
01:15:47,700 --> 01:15:50,667
I HAVE THE ORDERS
RIGHT HERE IN MY PURSE.

1670
01:15:50,667 --> 01:15:52,167
NOW, LET ME SEE
THE PRISONER.

1671
01:15:52,167 --> 01:15:53,700
I’M AWFUL NERVOUS
WITH THIS THING.

1672
01:15:53,700 --> 01:15:57,000
SO DON’T DO ANYTHING FOOLISH.
JUST OPEN UP THE CELL.

1673
01:15:57,000 --> 01:15:58,933
HURRY UP. QUICK. OPEN UP.

1674
01:15:58,933 --> 01:16:01,067
I’M A MALTESE MAN.
I SURRENDER.

1675
01:16:01,067 --> 01:16:03,533
SORRY.

1676
01:16:03,533 --> 01:16:04,867
- WE’LL WORK ON THAT.
- YEAH, THANKS.

1677
01:16:04,867 --> 01:16:06,967
- ANYBODY ELSE AROUND?
- NO, I DON’T THINK SO.

1678
01:16:06,967 --> 01:16:08,333
HERE, I GOT YOUR GUN.

1679
01:16:08,333 --> 01:16:12,200
- GOOD GIRL.
- THAT’S LIEUTENANT GIRL.

1680
01:16:12,200 --> 01:16:14,967
- ALL RIGHT.
- I PUT BROWNING SERVES
IN THIS THING.

1681
01:16:14,967 --> 01:16:17,467
I HOPE THIS WORKS OUT.

1682
01:16:17,467 --> 01:16:20,233
’CAUSE LORD KNOWS
I’VE JUST RUINED MY CAREER.

1683
01:16:20,233 --> 01:16:23,233
EH, GIRLS DON’T HAVE CAREERS.
LET’S GO.

1684
01:16:23,233 --> 01:16:24,833
SLOW DOWN, SHERIFF.

1685
01:16:24,833 --> 01:16:28,567
IF ANYONE SEES US,
WE MUST NOT LOOK SUSPICIOUS.

1686
01:16:28,567 --> 01:16:30,467
YOUNG LADY,
TOOK A LOT OF GUTS

1687
01:16:30,467 --> 01:16:32,433
FOR YOU TO
BREAK ME OUT OF HERE.

1688
01:16:32,433 --> 01:16:34,433
WELL, WE HAVE
A SAYING IN MALTA.

1689
01:16:34,433 --> 01:16:36,267
LIKE YOUR SAYING IN AMERICA.

1690
01:16:36,267 --> 01:16:39,733
ONLY, HERE IT GOES,
"RIGHT IS MIGHT."

1691
01:16:39,733 --> 01:16:41,367
AND I BELIEVE
THAT GETTING PALERMO

1692
01:16:41,367 --> 01:16:42,833
IS THE RIGHT THING TO DO.

1693
01:16:42,833 --> 01:16:45,700
- YEAH, MAKE ME SOME COFFEE.
- AND I WANT TO HELP GET HIM.

1694
01:16:45,700 --> 01:16:47,033
LET’S HOPE YOUR
SUPERINTENDENT MIFSUD

1695
01:16:47,033 --> 01:16:49,367
- AGREES WITH YOU.
- HOW COULD I NOT LOVE HIM?

1696
01:16:49,367 --> 01:16:51,567
I DOUBT IT.

1697
01:16:59,900 --> 01:17:03,533
ALL RIGHT, STOP SLEEPING WITH
DAVEY JOHNSTONE.

1698
01:17:03,533 --> 01:17:06,267
NO NEED TO WAKE
THE LITTLE LADY.

1699
01:17:06,267 --> 01:17:09,233
LET’S HAVE OURSELVES
A CORRECTIVE INTERVIEW.

1700
01:17:10,800 --> 01:17:13,933
YES, I WILL GO AHEAD ON
AND LOVE HIM.

1701
01:17:13,933 --> 01:17:15,567
THE LAMANNA VILLA.

1702
01:17:15,567 --> 01:17:18,000
- KNOW WHERE IT IS?
- YEAH. SURE. WHY?

1703
01:17:18,000 --> 01:17:19,367
DO YOU KNOW WHERE IT IS?

1704
01:17:19,367 --> 01:17:21,467
YES, IT’S ONE OF THE NICEST
HOUSES ON THE ISLAND.

1705
01:17:21,467 --> 01:17:24,333
AND DON LAMANNA IS
A VERY RESPECTED BUSINESSMAN
FROM ROME.

1706
01:17:24,333 --> 01:17:26,667
OUR FRIENDLY BARTENDER
SAYS DIFFERENT.

1707
01:17:26,667 --> 01:17:28,400
NOW, WHERE’S THIS GUY LIVE?

1708
01:17:28,400 --> 01:17:29,733
WELL, YOU’LL NEVER
GET THERE BY YOURSELF.

1709
01:17:29,733 --> 01:17:31,367
- I’LL HAVE TO TAKE YOU THERE.
- JUST TELL ME

1710
01:17:31,367 --> 01:17:33,000
WHERE THE GUY LIVES.

1711
01:17:33,000 --> 01:17:34,767
NOW, LOOK. I’VE PUT
MY CAREER ON THE LINE

1712
01:17:34,767 --> 01:17:36,800
TO HELP YOU GET PALERMO.
NOW, THE LEAST YOU CAN DO

1713
01:17:36,800 --> 01:17:38,700
- IS LET ME HELP.
- ALL RIGHT.

1714
01:17:38,700 --> 01:17:41,033
THERE’S A PIER LEADING UP
THE BACK WAY TO THE VILLA.

1715
01:17:41,033 --> 01:17:42,567
NOW, IF I ONLY HAD A BOAT--

1716
01:17:42,567 --> 01:17:44,967
- A GRAVY BOAT.
- NO PROBLEM.

1717
01:17:44,967 --> 01:17:47,267
MAN, IF SHE WAS
ONLY A ROAST.

1718
01:17:50,633 --> 01:17:52,967
WHEN DID SHE CHANGE INTO HER
LEATHER ACTION SKIRT?

1719
01:17:52,967 --> 01:17:55,500
BUT I’M FINE WITH IT.

1720
01:17:55,500 --> 01:17:57,733
DO YOU BELIEVE THAT BARTENDER
WAS TELLING THE TRUTH?

1721
01:17:57,733 --> 01:17:59,467
YEAH. THIS IS THE PLACE,
ALL RIGHT.

1722
01:17:59,467 --> 01:18:02,333
THEY GOT ALL THE HAM YOU CAN EAT
WITH CHOICE OF SIDES.

1723
01:18:03,700 --> 01:18:05,500
ALL RIGHT, LET ME GUESS.
HE FAILS AGAIN.

1724
01:18:05,500 --> 01:18:06,833
THE POLICE CHIEF
THREATENS HIM.

1725
01:18:06,833 --> 01:18:08,467
HE GETS PUT IN JAIL,
AND IT’S FUNNY!

1726
01:18:08,467 --> 01:18:11,067
- [CROW LAUGHS]
- [MIKE LAUGHS]

1727
01:18:13,400 --> 01:18:16,900
[CROW HUMS]

1728
01:18:16,900 --> 01:18:18,500
ALL RIGHT, I’M GONNA
SMUGGLE YOU IN

1729
01:18:18,500 --> 01:18:20,733
IN ONE OF MY NECK FOLDS

1730
01:18:25,667 --> 01:18:29,600
STAY HERE.

1731
01:18:29,600 --> 01:18:31,633
NO WAY.

1732
01:18:31,633 --> 01:18:33,067
OKAY, THEN, STAY THERE.

1733
01:18:33,067 --> 01:18:34,633
NO, STAY THERE. THERE.

1734
01:18:34,633 --> 01:18:36,200
THERE.

1735
01:18:36,200 --> 01:18:39,467
STAY SOMEWHERE.

1736
01:18:39,467 --> 01:18:40,900
[SERVO HUMS]

1737
01:18:40,900 --> 01:18:43,500
- [GERONIMO MUTTERS]
- I’M ABLE TO HELP YOU.

1738
01:18:43,500 --> 01:18:45,600
ALL RIGHT. KEEP AN EAR OUT
WHILE I KICK THIS DOOR IN.

1739
01:18:45,600 --> 01:18:47,867
NO, WAIT-- WAIT.
LET’S TRY THIS.

1740
01:18:47,867 --> 01:18:49,867
- WHAT?
- HAIRPIN.

1741
01:18:49,867 --> 01:18:52,200
WHY WOULD I KICK A HAIRPIN?

1742
01:18:56,467 --> 01:18:58,067
HONEY, I AM IMPRESSED.

1743
01:18:58,067 --> 01:18:59,867
I’VE BEEN DOING THIS
SINCE I WAS A KID.

1744
01:18:59,867 --> 01:19:01,267
THIS IS AS FAR AS YOU GO.

1745
01:19:01,267 --> 01:19:03,367
BUT I’VE JUST PROVED
THAT I CAN HELP YOU.

1746
01:19:03,367 --> 01:19:04,733
YOU DON’T EVEN HAVE A GUN.

1747
01:19:04,733 --> 01:19:06,067
THE WAY TO HELP IS TO GET

1748
01:19:06,067 --> 01:19:07,967
SOME REINFORCEMENTS
WITH SOME WEAPONS.

1749
01:19:07,967 --> 01:19:10,600
BUT I WON’T LET YOU
GO IN THERE ALONE.

1750
01:19:10,600 --> 01:19:12,300
YOU’LL NEVER COME OUT ALIVE.

1751
01:19:12,300 --> 01:19:14,600
- YAY.
- MY BEST BET
TO GET THE JOB DONE

1752
01:19:14,600 --> 01:19:16,433
IS NOT HAVING
TO WORRY ABOUT YOU.

1753
01:19:16,433 --> 01:19:19,600
GO ON.
DO WHAT I TOLD YOU.

1754
01:19:19,600 --> 01:19:21,433
- [CROW SMOOCHES]
- GO ON.

1755
01:19:21,433 --> 01:19:22,867
BE CAREFUL.

1756
01:19:22,867 --> 01:19:24,533
DON’T TEAM UP
WITH ANY CHUBBY TEXANS

1757
01:19:24,533 --> 01:19:26,667
WHILE I’M IN HERE.

1758
01:19:32,400 --> 01:19:35,067
RIGHT INTO
THE GUARD DOGS’ KENNELS.

1759
01:19:38,367 --> 01:19:40,667
GOTTA TURN DOWN
THE PRESSURE ON THAT BIDET--

1760
01:19:40,667 --> 01:19:43,700
OOF!

1761
01:19:43,700 --> 01:19:45,233
MM, PISTOL-WHIPPING
A SUSPECT.

1762
01:19:45,233 --> 01:19:48,633
FEELS JUST LIKE TEXAS.

1763
01:19:48,633 --> 01:19:51,800
MAN, HE MAKES PORTER WAGONER
LOOK UNDER-DRESSED.

1764
01:19:55,567 --> 01:19:57,167
JUST FINISH
YOUR COFFEE, PALERMO.

1765
01:19:57,167 --> 01:19:58,633
PLEASE, IT’S COCOA.

1766
01:19:58,633 --> 01:20:00,600
MAYBE YOU’D LIKE
TO JOIN ME, COWBOY.

1767
01:20:00,600 --> 01:20:03,400
NO THANKS. I HAD MINE
IN JAIL THIS EVENING.

1768
01:20:03,400 --> 01:20:06,133
THAT’S THE WAY YOU’LL BE HAVING
YOURS TOMORROW.

1769
01:20:06,133 --> 01:20:08,000
SO THIS IS THE AMERICAN

1770
01:20:08,000 --> 01:20:09,833
WHO’S BEEN CAUSING
ALL THE TROUBLE.

1771
01:20:09,833 --> 01:20:11,233
WOULD YOU LIKE A RUB?

1772
01:20:11,233 --> 01:20:13,400
I’M VERY IMPRESSED, SHERIFF.

1773
01:20:13,400 --> 01:20:16,733
YOU SEEM TO HAVE
MORE LIVES THAN A CAT.

1774
01:20:16,733 --> 01:20:18,633
- YOU AMERICANS--
- YOUR LEO SAYER.

1775
01:20:18,633 --> 01:20:21,733
ALWAYS THINK
YOU KNOW THE ANSWERS.

1776
01:20:21,733 --> 01:20:23,167
BUT YOU’RE ALWAYS WRONG.

1777
01:20:23,167 --> 01:20:25,167
LOU FERRIGNO LOOKS ON.

1778
01:20:25,167 --> 01:20:28,400
PUT DOWN THE GUN.

1779
01:20:28,400 --> 01:20:30,767
SEE, MIKE? THAT’S WHAT HAPPENED
WHEN I SHOT YOU THAT TIME.

1780
01:20:30,767 --> 01:20:32,200
YOU WOULD NEVER BELIEVE ME.

1781
01:20:32,200 --> 01:20:35,300
I’D SAY NOT.

1782
01:20:36,933 --> 01:20:41,200
OH NO! I’M GETTING AROUSED.

1783
01:20:41,200 --> 01:20:43,967
[GERONIMO STRAINS]

1784
01:20:43,967 --> 01:20:47,867
[CROW GARGLES]

1785
01:20:47,867 --> 01:20:51,500
OH, HIS COPY OF MIRABELLA!

1786
01:20:51,500 --> 01:20:54,967
SO THIS ISN’T
IL POSTINO, RIGHT?

1787
01:20:56,933 --> 01:20:59,333
MAYBE NOW WOULD BE A GOOD TIME
TO CALL HIM A SON OF A--.

1788
01:21:01,333 --> 01:21:03,433
I CAN’T TAKE
YOU SITTING ON ME.

1789
01:21:03,433 --> 01:21:07,333
I’M GONNA OFF MYSELF.

1790
01:21:07,333 --> 01:21:08,767
FREEZE.

1791
01:21:08,767 --> 01:21:15,867
GET UP.

1792
01:21:15,867 --> 01:21:17,400
IT WAS AN ACCIDENT.

1793
01:21:17,400 --> 01:21:20,267
I DIDN’T MEAN IT.
IT WAS HIS FAULT!

1794
01:21:20,267 --> 01:21:22,600
HE’S MINE.

1795
01:21:22,600 --> 01:21:25,233
I OWE THIS.

1796
01:21:25,233 --> 01:21:26,567
YOU JUST DO
WHAT YOU’RE TOLD.

1797
01:21:26,567 --> 01:21:28,067
I’LL TAKE CARE OF
THE FAMILY ROME.

1798
01:21:28,067 --> 01:21:29,767
"I’LL TAKE YOUR OARS
TO TONY ROMA’S"?

1799
01:21:29,767 --> 01:21:32,533
FEEL LIKE A SWIM,
COWBOY? HUH?

1800
01:21:32,533 --> 01:21:35,833
[GERONIMO GRUNTS]

1801
01:21:35,833 --> 01:21:39,467
IT DOES LOOK FUN.
I HAVE TO SAY.

1802
01:21:39,467 --> 01:21:41,867
YOU SHOULD HAVE STAYED
WITH YOUR COWS, SHERIFF.

1803
01:21:41,867 --> 01:21:43,700
"SHOULD’VE
STAINED MY COWS"?

1804
01:21:43,700 --> 01:21:46,533
- --GOT HIS MIND ON...
- OH, [MUTED].

1805
01:21:46,533 --> 01:21:49,700
HEY, SOMEONE NOT HIDEOUS.

1806
01:21:49,700 --> 01:21:51,233
[GERONIMO GRUNTS]

1807
01:21:51,233 --> 01:21:55,133
[MIKE RASPBERRIES]

1808
01:21:55,133 --> 01:21:56,833
GET ON THE BOAT, COWBOY.

1809
01:21:56,833 --> 01:21:59,000
FREEZE!

1810
01:21:59,000 --> 01:22:00,200
DON’T ANYBODY MOVE!

1811
01:22:00,200 --> 01:22:03,533
I’M JERRY REED!

1812
01:22:03,533 --> 01:22:06,233
- SAW THAT MESS UPSTAIRS.
- WHAT’D YOU GUYS EAT?

1813
01:22:06,233 --> 01:22:08,267
WILSON. YOU TAKE CARE
OF THE BIG ONE.

1814
01:22:08,267 --> 01:22:10,067
I GOT THE LITTLE ONE.

1815
01:22:10,067 --> 01:22:11,600
LET’S NOT DO ANYTHING HASTY.

1816
01:22:11,600 --> 01:22:13,100
LOTS OF PEOPLE
COULD GET HURT THIS WAY.

1817
01:22:13,100 --> 01:22:14,800
PALERMO AIN’T GONNA
START NOTHING, ARE YOU,

1818
01:22:14,800 --> 01:22:16,567
YOU GUTLESS
SON OF A [MUTED].

1819
01:22:16,567 --> 01:22:18,600
ALL PALERMO DOES
IS AMBUSH PEOPLE.

1820
01:22:18,600 --> 01:22:20,400
YOU’RE NOT GONNA DO
ANYTHING FACE-TO-FACE,

1821
01:22:20,400 --> 01:22:21,733
ARE YOU, PALERMO?

1822
01:22:21,733 --> 01:22:24,433
I HAVE SOME QUESTIONS.
I’D LIKE TO HAVE ANSWERS.

1823
01:22:24,433 --> 01:22:26,567
NOW THAT LAMANNA’S DEAD,

1824
01:22:26,567 --> 01:22:28,067
WHO’S GONNA PAY ME
THE REST OF MY MONEY?

1825
01:22:28,067 --> 01:22:30,600
BUH-- HUH?!

1826
01:22:30,600 --> 01:22:32,733
YOUR MONEY’S
COMPLETELY SAFE.

1827
01:22:32,733 --> 01:22:34,733
THE FAMILY ROME
WILL TAKE CARE OF THAT.

1828
01:22:34,733 --> 01:22:36,267
OH, POPEYE.

1829
01:22:36,267 --> 01:22:38,600
I’M REALLY SORRY
ABOUT THIS, GERONIMO.

1830
01:22:38,600 --> 01:22:40,433
NOBODY WAS
SUPPOSED TO GET HURT.

1831
01:22:40,433 --> 01:22:42,133
LAMANNA PAID ME
A LOT OF MONEY

1832
01:22:42,133 --> 01:22:44,933
TO KEEP MR. PALERMO HERE
OUT OF ITALY.

1833
01:22:44,933 --> 01:22:46,633
- SO CONFUSED AND HUNGRY.
- I THOUGHT IT WOULD BE SAFE

1834
01:22:46,633 --> 01:22:49,533
USING A DUMB TEXAS SHERIFF
LIKE YOURSELF.

1835
01:22:49,533 --> 01:22:50,933
YOU FIGURED WRONG.

1836
01:22:50,933 --> 01:22:52,633
HOLD IT RIGHT THERE,
MR. WILSON.

1837
01:22:52,633 --> 01:22:53,700
DENNIS?

1838
01:22:53,700 --> 01:22:55,267
PUT YOUR GUN DOWN.

1839
01:22:55,267 --> 01:22:56,767
- ME?
- ME?

1840
01:22:56,767 --> 01:22:59,967
- ME?
- ME?

1841
01:22:59,967 --> 01:23:03,967
AAH!

1842
01:23:03,967 --> 01:23:07,200
OPA!

1843
01:23:07,200 --> 01:23:09,200
HORSEFLY ON YOUR NOSE.
SORRY.

1844
01:23:11,633 --> 01:23:13,367
STILL CONFUSED.
STILL HUNGRY.

1845
01:23:13,367 --> 01:23:16,633
I GUESS I SHOULD
THANK YOU, YOUNG LADY.

1846
01:23:16,633 --> 01:23:20,500
YOU JUST SAVED ME
$250,000.

1847
01:23:20,500 --> 01:23:22,467
YOU WATCH THE COWBOY, FOSTA.

1848
01:23:22,467 --> 01:23:25,967
I WATCH THE COWBOY, BUSTER.

1849
01:23:25,967 --> 01:23:27,867
HE’S THE MOBSTER
WHO GIVES PEOPLE

1850
01:23:27,867 --> 01:23:31,400
A STERN TALKING-TO.

1851
01:23:31,400 --> 01:23:35,200
LET ME GO!

1852
01:23:35,200 --> 01:23:37,200
MY WATCH IS CAUGHT
IN YOUR HAIR.

1853
01:23:37,200 --> 01:23:40,133
[PALERMO GRUMBLES]
--SEE THE DIFFERENCE HERE...

1854
01:23:43,167 --> 01:23:46,333
JUST LET ME BORROW IT.
COME ON!

1855
01:23:46,333 --> 01:23:49,567
YES, THE LONG-TIME
TEXAS MALTESE RIVALRY

1856
01:23:49,567 --> 01:23:52,300
COMES TO A HEAD.

1857
01:23:52,300 --> 01:23:53,867
D’OH...

1858
01:23:53,867 --> 01:23:55,867
IF I COULD ONLY GET
MY SAUSAGEY FINGERS

1859
01:23:55,867 --> 01:23:59,300
AROUND HIS GUN.

1860
01:23:59,300 --> 01:24:02,167
UGH! POPEYE.

1861
01:24:05,033 --> 01:24:07,400
I PICK YOUR NOSE
IF YOU SCREAM.

1862
01:24:09,700 --> 01:24:11,233
OOH. HOT. HOT GUN.

1863
01:24:11,233 --> 01:24:12,967
OOH. OW.

1864
01:24:17,133 --> 01:24:20,700
EW, HE’S GOT AU JUS
ALL OVER HIM.

1865
01:24:23,167 --> 01:24:25,300
AND NOW THE THICK,
MEATY CONCLUSION

1866
01:24:25,300 --> 01:24:28,000
OF FINAL JUSTICE.

1867
01:24:28,000 --> 01:24:29,267
TAKE IT EASY.

1868
01:24:29,267 --> 01:24:30,667
OR THE GUN GETS IT--
I MEAN, THE GIRL.

1869
01:24:30,667 --> 01:24:33,467
DO IT!
BLOW THE [MUTED] AWAY!

1870
01:24:35,233 --> 01:24:37,567
DON’T BE STUPID, COWBOY.

1871
01:24:37,567 --> 01:24:39,000
I’LL BLOW HER BRAINS OUT.

1872
01:24:39,000 --> 01:24:40,333
ALL OVER THE BOAT!

1873
01:24:40,333 --> 01:24:41,700
JUST THROW THE GUN AWAY.

1874
01:24:41,700 --> 01:24:44,300
- PALERMO, LET’S TALK.
- I MISS OUR LITTLE CHATS.

1875
01:24:44,300 --> 01:24:45,900
YOU SAID SOMETHING
TO WILSON ABOUT

1876
01:24:45,900 --> 01:24:48,367
$250,000.

1877
01:24:48,367 --> 01:24:52,267
OKAY. I WAS GOING TO
HAVE TO PAY WILSON ANYHOW.

1878
01:24:52,267 --> 01:24:54,300
JUST GIVE ME THE GUN.

1879
01:24:54,300 --> 01:24:55,500
ARE YOU SERIOUS?

1880
01:24:55,500 --> 01:24:57,533
YEAH.

1881
01:24:57,533 --> 01:24:59,400
ALL RIGHT.
PUTTING IT AWAY.

1882
01:24:59,400 --> 01:25:01,500
I’VE JUST HAD
A REALLY HARD DAY.

1883
01:25:04,567 --> 01:25:06,533
[PALERMO LAUGHS]

1884
01:25:06,533 --> 01:25:08,167
EVEN DUMBER
THAN I THOUGHT, COWBOY.

1885
01:25:08,167 --> 01:25:09,967
- TELL ME ABOUT IT.
- YOU KNOW,

1886
01:25:09,967 --> 01:25:12,600
I CAN SAVE A LOT OF MONEY
WITH ONE BULLET.

1887
01:25:12,600 --> 01:25:14,633
ONE!

1888
01:25:14,633 --> 01:25:16,567
AND I CAN GET RID OF
A [MUTE] LIKE YOU

1889
01:25:16,567 --> 01:25:19,500
WITH JUST ONE BULLET.

1890
01:25:19,500 --> 01:25:22,267
UGH, SOMEONE SALTED HIM
SO HIS JUICES ARE COMING UP.

1891
01:25:22,267 --> 01:25:24,567
YUCK.

1892
01:25:24,567 --> 01:25:25,900
YOU THINK YOU CAN TAKE ME?

1893
01:25:25,900 --> 01:25:28,067
YEAH, IF I CAN GET
MY MOM’S CAR.

1894
01:25:28,067 --> 01:25:29,467
GO AHEAD ON.

1895
01:25:29,467 --> 01:25:33,433
HE’S GOING-AHEADING-ONNING!

1896
01:25:33,433 --> 01:25:35,500
IT’S YOUR--

1897
01:25:35,500 --> 01:25:37,200
AAH!

1898
01:25:37,200 --> 01:25:40,533
OUR HERO.
A BIG STINKY CHEATER.

1899
01:25:44,700 --> 01:25:46,233
- DARLING?
- MY CHEATER.

1900
01:25:46,233 --> 01:25:48,967
THAT BIG ONE’S GOT MY BADGE.

1901
01:25:48,967 --> 01:25:52,267
WOULD YOU GET IT FOR ME?

1902
01:25:52,267 --> 01:25:53,600
WHAT?

1903
01:25:53,600 --> 01:25:56,033
WHAT KIND OF A GREAT LAST LINE
IS THAT?

1904
01:25:56,033 --> 01:25:58,200
THE HELL?

1905
01:25:58,200 --> 01:25:59,567
AH, YOU KNOW THIS MUSIC
MAKES ME WANNA

1906
01:25:59,567 --> 01:26:02,800
PUT A TRIANGLE ON MY PRIVATES
AND SQUIRM AROUND.

1907
01:26:02,800 --> 01:26:04,400
LIKE IN THE MOVIE.

1908
01:26:04,400 --> 01:26:07,700
LIKE WHAT?
WHAT’RE YOU TALKING ABOUT?

1909
01:26:07,700 --> 01:26:09,333
- AH, NEVER MIND.
- I WANNA PUT A TRIANGLE

1910
01:26:09,333 --> 01:26:10,733
- ON MY PRIVATES
AND SQUIRM AROUND.
- OKAY.

1911
01:26:10,733 --> 01:26:12,667
♪ YOU’D BETTER RUN ♪

1912
01:26:12,667 --> 01:26:14,633
♪ OR HE’LL STEAL
YOUR LUNCH ♪

1913
01:26:14,633 --> 01:26:17,100
♪ YOU’D BETTER HIDE ♪

1914
01:26:17,100 --> 01:26:19,000
♪ YOUR LUNCH ♪

1915
01:26:19,000 --> 01:26:21,400
♪ YOU’D BETTER RUN ♪

1916
01:26:21,400 --> 01:26:23,800
♪ ’CAUSE HE’S GOT THE RUNS ♪

1917
01:26:23,800 --> 01:26:25,833
♪ ’CAUSE HE WON’T STOP ♪

1918
01:26:25,833 --> 01:26:27,967
♪ TILL HE GETS HIS MAN ♪

1919
01:26:27,967 --> 01:26:31,700
♪ OR YOUR LUNCH... ♪

1920
01:26:31,700 --> 01:26:33,967
- OH YEAH.
- WHOO!

1921
01:26:33,967 --> 01:26:36,267
- OKAY.
- PLAY IT.

1922
01:26:36,267 --> 01:26:38,233
MM. LISTEN TO THAT
GUITAR SOLO.

1923
01:26:38,233 --> 01:26:39,733
I THINK IT’S BY ERIC CLAP.

1924
01:26:39,733 --> 01:26:41,767
YEAH, ERIC CLAP.

1925
01:26:44,567 --> 01:26:46,667
HEY, JOE DON’S
PERSONAL PROSTITUTE

1926
01:26:46,667 --> 01:26:48,200
MADE IT INTO THE CREDITS.

1927
01:26:48,200 --> 01:26:51,333
♪ GONE FOREVER ♪

1928
01:26:51,333 --> 01:26:53,100
♪ TAKES A ROAST
AND WRAPS IT ♪

1929
01:26:53,100 --> 01:26:56,000
♪ IN BACON ♪

1930
01:26:56,000 --> 01:26:57,967
♪ BUT THERE’S POTATOES ♪

1931
01:26:57,967 --> 01:27:01,900
♪ ON THE SIDE ♪

1932
01:27:01,900 --> 01:27:03,367
WHOO!

1933
01:27:03,367 --> 01:27:06,700
YEAH!
PASS THE GRAVY, NOW!

1934
01:27:06,700 --> 01:27:09,467
YOU KNOW, MAYBE WE SHOULD
LAY OFF THE FOOD JOKES, GUYS.

1935
01:27:09,467 --> 01:27:12,033
YEAH, I GUESS IT’S NOT REALLY
FAIR TO JOE DON BAKER.

1936
01:27:12,033 --> 01:27:14,367
YEAH, I MEAN SOME PEOPLE
JUST METABOLIZE A LI--

1937
01:27:14,367 --> 01:27:17,167
♪ MEATBALLS FRIED IN LARD ♪

1938
01:27:17,167 --> 01:27:18,533
ALL RIGHT, SERVO!

1939
01:27:18,533 --> 01:27:19,933
SORRY, MIKE.
ALL BETS ARE OFF.

1940
01:27:19,933 --> 01:27:21,333
OH, COME ON NOW.

1941
01:27:21,333 --> 01:27:23,067
[BOTS]
♪ EAT EAT EAT EAT ♪

1942
01:27:23,067 --> 01:27:25,300
♪ EAT EAT EAT EAT ♪

1943
01:27:25,300 --> 01:27:27,367
- OKAY.
- ♪ MUNCH MUNCH MUNCH MUNCH ♪

1944
01:27:27,367 --> 01:27:29,567
- ♪ CHEW CHEW CHEW CHEW ♪
- OKAY.

1945
01:27:29,567 --> 01:27:31,867
♪ GORGE GORGE GORGE GORGE ♪

1946
01:27:31,867 --> 01:27:34,033
♪ BURP BURP BURP BURP ♪

1947
01:27:34,033 --> 01:27:36,100
♪ STUFF LOTS OF FOOD IN ♪

1948
01:27:36,100 --> 01:27:38,033
♪ YOUR MEAN BABY-FACE! ♪

1949
01:27:38,033 --> 01:27:40,100
OH, NOW, YOU GUYS
PREPARED THAT.

1950
01:27:40,100 --> 01:27:42,700
COME ON.
IT’S AN OBVIOUS LINE, MIKE.

1951
01:27:42,700 --> 01:27:44,867
♪ PORK CHOPS, CREAM PUFFS ♪

1952
01:27:44,867 --> 01:27:46,933
♪ CANDY BARS ♪

1953
01:27:46,933 --> 01:27:49,267
♪ MEAT SAUCE, CHEETOS ♪

1954
01:27:49,267 --> 01:27:51,433
♪ MALLOMARS ♪

1955
01:27:51,433 --> 01:27:53,433
♪ HE WON’T STOP TILL ♪

1956
01:27:53,433 --> 01:27:55,333
♪ HE EATS IT ALL ♪

1957
01:27:55,333 --> 01:27:57,000
OKAY, THAT’S IT.
I’M GOING.

1958
01:27:57,000 --> 01:27:59,567
YOU GUYS DO YOUR FOOD JOKES.

1959
01:27:59,567 --> 01:28:01,900
GIVE ME SECONDS, BABY!

1960
01:28:01,900 --> 01:28:05,300
HEY, BABY,
YOU GONNA FINISH THAT?

1961
01:28:05,300 --> 01:28:07,400
ANYONE GONNA EAT
THAT LAST PIECE OF CAKE?

1962
01:28:07,400 --> 01:28:09,267
’CAUSE I WILL.

1963
01:28:09,267 --> 01:28:11,600
AW, SOMEBODY
GIVE ME A NAPKIN!

1964
01:28:11,600 --> 01:28:14,200
HEY! HEY, HEY,
WHERE’D MIKE GO?

1965
01:28:14,200 --> 01:28:15,967
- MIKE?
- MIKE? HE DITCHED US.

1966
01:28:15,967 --> 01:28:18,400
- MIKE?
- WHAT DO I DO?

1967
01:28:30,600 --> 01:28:32,767
[SIREN BLARES]

1968
01:28:32,767 --> 01:28:34,767
TEN SECONDS AND COUNTING!

1969
01:28:34,767 --> 01:28:36,700
- WHAT?
- WHAT’S GOING ON
UP HERE, GYPS?

1970
01:28:36,700 --> 01:28:38,300
SEVEN SECONDS, AND--

1971
01:28:38,300 --> 01:28:40,533
OH, IT’S SO SAD.

1972
01:28:40,533 --> 01:28:42,033
SO SAD!

1973
01:28:42,033 --> 01:28:43,633
WHAT, WHAT’S-- WHOA, MIKE.

1974
01:28:43,633 --> 01:28:45,133
I’M READY, YOU GUYS.

1975
01:28:45,133 --> 01:28:48,000
BOY, I CAN’T WAIT TO SEE
SPOONER, WISCONSIN AGAIN.

1976
01:28:48,000 --> 01:28:51,000
SERVO, CROW, GYPSY, SO LONG.

1977
01:28:51,000 --> 01:28:52,500
I LOVE YOU GUYS.

1978
01:28:52,500 --> 01:28:55,033
- WHAT?
- MIKE, WHAT’RE YOU DOING
IN THERE?

1979
01:28:55,033 --> 01:28:56,533
WELL, IT’S MY TURN
TO ESCAPE.

1980
01:28:56,533 --> 01:28:58,333
JOEL GOT TO GO
RIGHT AFTER HE SAW

1981
01:28:58,333 --> 01:29:00,067
A REALLY BAD
JOE DON BAKER MOVIE.

1982
01:29:00,067 --> 01:29:01,500
SO, YOU KNOW,
I JUST FIGURED--

1983
01:29:01,500 --> 01:29:03,067
- POOR MIKE.
- WELL, ANYWAY,

1984
01:29:03,067 --> 01:29:04,667
I LEFT YOU A PLAQUE THERE

1985
01:29:04,667 --> 01:29:06,267
WITH AN INSPIRATIONAL
POEM ON IT.

1986
01:29:06,267 --> 01:29:10,200
IT’S FROM MY FAVORITE MOVIE,
HERBIE GOES TO MONTE CARLO.

1987
01:29:10,200 --> 01:29:12,200
SO, YOU ARE SMALL AND WHITE.

1988
01:29:12,200 --> 01:29:13,767
- YOUR WHEELS ARE SILVER--
- MIKE?

1989
01:29:13,767 --> 01:29:15,233
- AND THEY ALWAYS INSPIRE--
- MIKE, MIKE.

1990
01:29:15,233 --> 01:29:17,333
MIKE-- MIKE!
I’M SORRY, BUDDY,

1991
01:29:17,333 --> 01:29:19,467
- BUT YOU’RE
NOT GOING ANYWHERE.
- NOPE.

1992
01:29:19,467 --> 01:29:21,233
BUT I JUST SUFFERED
THROUGH A REALLY BAD

1993
01:29:21,233 --> 01:29:24,100
- JOE DON BAKER MOVIE.
- UNRELATED, MIKE. SORRY.

1994
01:29:24,100 --> 01:29:27,000
YOU SEE, GYPSY SENT JOEL
BACK TO EARTH IN AN ESCAPE POD

1995
01:29:27,000 --> 01:29:29,100
SHE HID IN A BOX
OF HAMDINGERS.

1996
01:29:29,100 --> 01:29:31,400
- YEAH.
- THERE ARE NO MORE
ESCAPE PODS, MIKE.

1997
01:29:31,400 --> 01:29:33,867
YOU DO KNOW THAT YOU’RE
SITTING IN THE WATER HEATER,

1998
01:29:33,867 --> 01:29:36,100
DON’T YOU?

1999
01:29:36,100 --> 01:29:38,000
YEAH. I KNOW.

2000
01:29:38,000 --> 01:29:39,400
COME ON UPSTAIRS, HONEY.

2001
01:29:39,400 --> 01:29:41,067
WE’LL MAKE YOU
SOME SWISS MISS.

2002
01:29:41,067 --> 01:29:43,133
WELL-- HOW ABOUT IF

2003
01:29:43,133 --> 01:29:45,200
WE SEE A REALLY GOOD
JOE DON BAKER MOVIE?

2004
01:29:45,200 --> 01:29:46,733
WELL, I THINK
I CAN GUARANTEE

2005
01:29:46,733 --> 01:29:48,500
THAT’S NEVER
GONNA HAPPEN, MIKE.

2006
01:29:48,500 --> 01:29:50,433
OH, PEARL’S CALLING.
POOR FELLA.

2007
01:29:50,433 --> 01:29:53,367
REALLY.

2008
01:29:53,367 --> 01:29:55,867
SEE, NOW THAT’S FUNNY,
NELSON.

2009
01:29:55,867 --> 01:29:58,033
PRETENDING YOU WERE
STUPID ENOUGH TO THINK

2010
01:29:58,033 --> 01:30:01,000
YOU COULD EVER ESCAPE ME.

2011
01:30:01,000 --> 01:30:02,733
AND HERE’S SOMETHING ELSE
WE RECOMMEND

2012
01:30:02,733 --> 01:30:04,867
TO KEEP THOSE CHUCKLES
COMING AT THE OFFICE.

2013
01:30:04,867 --> 01:30:06,833
FUNNY DRESS-UP DAY.

2014
01:30:06,833 --> 01:30:09,200
WORKERS ARE MORE LIGHT-HEARTED
BECAUSE THEY ARE WEARING

2015
01:30:09,200 --> 01:30:11,900
WHIMSICAL EXPRESSIONS
OF FAUX-INDIVIDUALITY.

2016
01:30:11,900 --> 01:30:13,733
FOR INSTANCE, I’M WEARING

2017
01:30:13,733 --> 01:30:16,200
WACKY MISMATCHED COLORS.

2018
01:30:16,200 --> 01:30:17,767
WHEE!

2019
01:30:17,767 --> 01:30:19,667
AND, BOBO,
WHAT DO YOU HAVE ON?

2020
01:30:19,667 --> 01:30:21,667
WELL, LAWGIVER,
I WENT AHEAD ON

2021
01:30:21,667 --> 01:30:23,700
AND TOOK A CUE
FROM JOE DON BAKER.

2022
01:30:23,700 --> 01:30:26,133
HECK, EVERY DAY IS
FUNNY DRESS-UP DAY FOR HIM!

2023
01:30:26,133 --> 01:30:27,600
WAHOO!

2024
01:30:27,600 --> 01:30:29,867
THE RESEMBLANCE IS UNCANNY.

2025
01:30:29,867 --> 01:30:32,833
- OH, MY.
- WHY, AND HERE COMES
BRAIN GUY.

2026
01:30:32,833 --> 01:30:35,133
MY, MY, YOU WENT ALL OUT

2027
01:30:35,133 --> 01:30:36,600
FOR FUNNY DRESS-UP DAY.

2028
01:30:36,600 --> 01:30:38,300
UH, FUNNY WHAT?

2029
01:30:38,300 --> 01:30:39,967
YOUR OUTFIT.

2030
01:30:39,967 --> 01:30:43,833
OH, THIS. NO NO NO,
I JUST HAVE A DATE TONIGHT.

2031
01:30:43,833 --> 01:30:47,367
DON’T WAIT UP.

2032
01:30:47,367 --> 01:30:49,833
[PEARL WHIMPERS]

2033
01:30:49,833 --> 01:30:52,833
NOTHING WILL EVER BE

2034
01:30:52,833 --> 01:30:54,567
FUNNY AGAIN.

2035
01:30:54,567 --> 01:30:57,500
MOTHER.

2036
01:30:57,500 --> 01:31:00,733
♪♪ [THEME]

2037
01:31:59,400 --> 01:32:01,467
DO YOU THINK
YOU CAN TAKE ME?

2038
01:32:01,467 --> 01:32:04,133
GO AHEAD ON.

2039
01:32:04,133 --> 01:32:05,600
IT’S YOUR MOVE.
